375ff6d16af9-6b98-d988-c85e76f3b59a	2026-11-15 12:40:23	2026-11-15 12:40:23	0	<h3>Before/after report: list-page parts on the agent and workflow lists</h3>\n<p>Parts: <code>AppUi::ListToolbar</code> (blocks <code>search</code>, <code>actions</code>, <code>selection</code>, <code>pager</code>), <code>AppUi::Pager</code> (<code>@offset</code>, <code>@limit</code>, <code>@count</code>, <code>@hasMore</code>, optional <code>@total</code>, <code>@disabled</code>, <code>@compact</code>; event <code>@onPageChange(offset)</code>) and <code>AppUi::DataTable</code> (column descriptors <code>{ key, label, sortable, sortKey, cell, class }</code>, blocks <code>cell</code>, <code>rowActions</code>, <code>empty</code>; events <code>@onSort(sortKey)</code>, <code>@onSelect(id, checked)</code>). <code>AppUi::Table</code> is unchanged. QuickList's footer now uses <code>AppUi::Pager @compact</code>, and <code>QuickList::Pagination</code> was removed.</p>\n\n<h4>Lines</h4>\n<table>\n<tr><th>File</th><th>Before</th><th>After</th></tr>\n<tr><td>agent/index.hbs</td><td>136</td><td>97</td></tr>\n<tr><td>workflow/index.hbs</td><td>142</td><td>101</td></tr>\n<tr><td>agent controller</td><td>77</td><td>94 (+ columns getter)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>workflow controller</td><td>114</td><td>132 (+ columns getter, row id)</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>Each template loses about 40 lines: the 18-line pager, the table and header scaffolding, and the per-column sort buttons. Each controller gains a 15-line column list. The base list controller gets <code>pageSize</code>, <code>offset</code>, <code>changeOffset(offset)</code> and <code>selectRow(id, checked)</code>; <code>select(evt)</code> now calls <code>selectRow</code>. Its sort code skips the DOM icon update when there is no <code>[data-sort]</code> header. The three lists that are not on the parts work as before.</p>\n\n<h4>Test churn</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Agent and workflow steps: 4–5 lines each. Rows, cells and buttons now use <code>data-test-data-table-row</code>, <code>data-test-data-table-cell="&lt;column key&gt;"</code>, <code>data-test-&lt;module&gt;-name|status</code> and <code>data-test-list-action</code>.</li>\n<li><code>common-steps/list-toolbar-steps.js</code> takes <code>{ dataTest: true }</code>. The issue list still uses the old <code>data-issue-*</code> / <code>data-btn</code> selectors, so nothing changes for it.</li>\n<li>QuickList pager selectors: 11 lines in 4 files moved to <code>data-test-pager-*</code>. The 88-line <code>quick-list/pagination-test</code> was replaced by <code>app-ui/pager-test</code>.</li>\n<li>New integration tests: pager (7), data-table (6), list-toolbar (2) and the Component Library demo (1). The feature files are unchanged.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>Readability</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Better: the page reads as toolbar → table, and each part has one job. The pager arithmetic (<code>add (mult (sub page 1) 20)</code> …) is gone from the templates. The sort icon now follows <code>sort</code>/<code>order</code> instead of DOM class toggling.</li>\n<li>Worse: a page with a hand-built cell for most columns ends up with one <code>&lt;:cell&gt;</code> block holding an <code>{{#if (eq column.key …)}}</code> chain. It works, but the cells' markup is now separate from their headers, which live in the controller. If more pages follow, the shared cells (status label, date-humanized, a label list) are candidates for small cell components named by <code>cell</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>What the parts could not express (or express only partly)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Selection state still lives in the DOM.</b> <code>PrometheusListController.selectAll</code> and <code>updateCheckboxState</code> walk <code>.list-view input[type=checkbox]</code>, so the DataTable row checkboxes keep <code>data-select</code>. The selector in <code>updateCheckboxState</code> was widened to also match <code>[data-select]</code>. A clean events-out selection, with <code>@selectedIds</code> in and a select-all inside DataTable, needs the base controller's selection rewritten. That is worth its own issue before the other three pages move.</li>\n<li>Select-all stays in the page's <code>selection</code> block, not in the table header, so that the controls row looks as it does today.</li>\n<li><code>ListToolbar</code> gained a fourth block, <code>pager</code> (the selected count and the pager), because the controls row has a right-hand side that the three listed blocks did not cover.</li>\n<li>The workflow rows are view objects. They needed an <code>id</code> so that DataTable can key rows and selection.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>Visual differences found by comparing the markup</h4>\n<p>There are no after screenshots: the local app serves another checkout, so this branch could not be opened in the browser from this run. Please compare <code>/app/agent</code> and <code>/app/workflow</code> on the branch. Differences known from the markup:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The sorted column shows its direction (<code>fa-sort-asc</code>/<code>desc</code>) from the first render. Before, every column showed <code>fa-sort</code> until a header was clicked.</li>\n<li>The range reads <code>1-20 / 20+</code> (it was <code>1-20 / 20 +</code>), with the same text as QuickList.</li>\n<li>The pager buttons use the <code>disabled</code> attribute and a plain <code>title</code> ("Previous page"/"Next page") instead of the <code>.disabled</code> class and the Bootstrap tooltip. They look the same.</li>\n<li>The agent list's search now sits in <code>div.search</code>, as on the workflow list, and the controls row sits directly under the header instead of inside a zero-padding <code>box-body</code>. Neither changes the spacing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4>Recommendation</h4>\n<p>Move user/management, projects/index and project/issue/index onto the parts after the selection issue above lands. Moving them now would carry the DOM-based selection into three more pages.</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	conversationrooms	c