2c8914486ae0-262a-c4dd-916cb007492c	2026-10-27 10:00:12	2026-10-27 10:00:12	0	<p><strong>PR opened:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/projects4me/gaia/pull/216">gaia#216</a> (commit fbfa65e, based on ca4c30e).</p><p><b>Design decisions</b></p><ul><li>Class table inheritance (users.type + agents row) rather than a separate principal table, so every existing user-based ACL, audit and assignment path works for agents unchanged.</li><li>AgentUserPolicy vs AgentEscalationGuard is deliberate: the policy is what an agent <i>user</i> is (type, passwords); the guard is what an agent <i>actor</i> may do (no self-modification).</li><li>Fixes made while finishing: harness permission ids fit varchar(36); guard queries use <code>deleted = false</code> on boolean columns; agentConfigBehavior reads fields with readAttribute(); AgentLifecycle uses getShared('db') so the rollback covers the models' writes; the permission-row lookup moved from PermissionController into <code>AgentEscalationGuard::assertNotOwnPermission</code>; the guard checks <code>instanceof User</code> instead of duck-typing.</li></ul><p><b>Design-review findings left as follow-ups</b> (should-fix, not blocking)</p><ul><li>AgentLifecycle has several reasons to change (create/delete, name sync, sponsor check, lockout check, transaction helper): split the transaction helper into a unit-of-work class and the sponsor/lockout checks into a policy.</li><li>AgentController / UserController orchestrate the user-agent pairing (field split, name sync, paired delete, transaction): move behind single domain calls or model hooks.</li><li>RestController gained extractRequestAttributes / extractCollectionAttributes, duplicating body parsing in postAction/patchAction: move into a shared component used by both.</li></ul><p><b>Other follow-ups</b></p><ul><li>app/config/services.php and tests/TestHelper.php register 'db' non-shared; other transactions using get('db') (RoleController, Systemnotificationrecipient, IssuestatusController TransactionScope) may run on a separate connection outside public/index.php.</li><li>A PDO error was swallowed into an empty 200 instead of a 500 (seen with the boolean deleted query).</li></ul><p><b>Permissions to grant manually</b> (no seeds): the new <code>agent</code> module permissions for the roles that manage agents (admins). The 'Coding Agent' role is not created by this PR; its grants are the reviewer's call. Whatever it is granted, AgentEscalationGuard still blocks self-modification (the api-tester agent profile grants all the guarded resources and checks every denial).</p><p><strong>Tests</strong></p><pre>phpunit tests/libraries/security: OK (88 tests, 216 assertions)\nphpunit tests/libraries/utils: OK (112 tests, 276 assertions)\napi backend: 148 passed, 0 failed, 12 skipped\napi acl: 131 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped\napi client: 201 passed, 0 failed, 6 skipped\nRESULT: PASS</pre><p>Cost so far: 125.0k output tokens, 190 turns, peak context 232.5k, cache reads 19882.7k (3 sessions).</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	conversationrooms	95bbfe326ade-6dbd-cfb4-d3dd328283a7	Agent Achilles	Agent Achilles	\N
