51cefe316ae4-f61a-a80b-864a6387e199	2026-10-30 10:20:01	2026-10-30 10:20:01	0	<p><strong>Agent Achilles is blocked</strong></p><p><b>Blocked: the dependency isn't merged yet.</b></p>\n<p>#4050 depends on agaia-4049, the Workflow module that adds workflows, nodes, edges and references. That issue is marked <i>done</i>, but its PR <a href="https://github.com/projects4me/gaia/pull/231">gaia#231</a> (branch <code>claude-issue-4049</code>) is still <b>open</b>. <code>origin/dev</code> is at 97ac8a3 (#230) and doesn't include it.</p>\n<p>The trigger work needs that module in place. Each event has to find the Active workflows in scope whose trigger node matches, and the trigger kinds and config live on <code>workflow_nodes</code>. Building on an unmerged branch would mean the PR carries #231's whole diff, and every review round on #231 would cause conflicts.</p>\n<p><b>To unblock:</b> merge gaia#231 into <code>dev</code>, then send #4050 back to me. The <code>claude-issue-4050</code> branch is unchanged, so the next run will sync it to the new <code>dev</code>.</p>\n<p>Separately, <code>ai start</code> reported that the test database is behind (pr4m has 75 tables, pr4m_test has 68). I didn't run <code>p4m db migrate</code> from this checkout: a migrate from here once dropped newer columns from pr4m. Once #231 is merged, please refresh the test DB (<code>p4m db prepare-test</code>) from the checkout that has the migrations, so the next run can test against it.</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	conversationrooms	4fd3fab06ae4-f61a-a80b-dc2042cbfb2d	Agent Achilles	Agent Achilles	\N
