cf1055a76ad9-95f2-5f53-7779a595f5b6	4f0ce6006ad9-95f2-5f53-2d0fd54845df	I'm proposing one Prometheus issue in **Claude-v1** (plan and screen above). It needs no Gaia change, because the parent and child issues are already loaded wherever the issue details appear.\n\n- **Collapsed cards:** each issue starts as a one-line title card (priority, linked number, subject, status). A chevron opens it to show the description.\n- **Three levels:** parent, this issue and child issues each get a small caption, a deeper indent and a different left-bar colour.\n- **Current issue:** its row never opens, since the page already shows its details.\n\nThe screen uses today's styles, so the indents, the parent's bar colour and cutting long subjects to one line aren't visible yet; the issue adds them.\n\n**Decision for you:** should an opened card also show assignee and type? I recommend not for now: it means loading extra data for the child issues, and the description is what you asked for.\n\n**Left out:** grandchildren, parents further up, an "expand all" button, and moving the box into the main column. Issue aprom-3763 (assigned to Rana Nouman in "Known Issues") also asks for that move. Once this ships most of 3763 is covered, so you may want to close it.\n\nI also noted this area in my knowledge map.	message	["Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/issue/issue-details.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/issue/issue-details.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles/modules/issue.scss", "Reading prometheus/app/styles/modules/issue.scss", "Reading prometheus/app/styles/modules/issue.scss", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai kb search issue hierarchy children parent 2>&1 | head -40; ls pr", "Searching issues: issue hierarchy child issues --project aprom", "Listing prometheus/docs/ui/screens/*", "Reading issue 3763", "Reading prometheus/docs/ui/screens/issue-detail.png", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching the code in prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Searching the code in prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Reading prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles", "Searching issues: parent child --project aprom --status new; dev-tools/ai/ai kb search issue --project aprom --status in_progress", "Reading prometheus/app/styles/modules/project.scss", "Listing prometheus/app/components/app-ui/priority-icon.*", "Reading prometheus/app/components/app-ui/priority-icon.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/app-ui/priority-icon.js", "Updating the knowledge map"]	\N	0.703171	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-22 11:38:55	f	\N
