f9aecdf86adc-f821-179a-702392fd3862	df2235066adc-c3c3-c7b3-5100bb8bba88	Here's the plan as I understand it: Nestor keeps planning issues in other projects it can reach. Any issue that lands outside the idea's own project gets marked as a request from that project, and the receiving project decides whether to take it. You're handling the Prometheus side (showing unreadable issue refs as plain text instead of links).\n\n**What I found in the code**\n- Talos tells Nestor which projects it can plan in, but not which project the idea belongs to. The plan in `conversation.py:27` is built without the idea, even though the client already reads `projectId` (`client.py:124`). Nestor can't tell "home" issues from cross-project ones today.\n- `Approval.description` (`approval.py:76`) already adds the "Depends on" and "Screens" lines on its own, without the model. The cross-project label should be added there the same way, so it doesn't depend on Nestor remembering a rule.\n- Your decision affects agaia-4075: the "issue must be in the idea's project" check goes away. The other checks there still apply: the plan must belong to the same idea, the plan-version race, and the Comment PATCH scope. You may want to update that issue.\n\n**What I left out:** a "request" badge on the plan card, linking projects together, and choosing the receiving project's priority. That last one is for the receiving project to decide.\n\n**Your call:** should cross-project issues use the existing **Change Request** type instead of Task or Story? I recommend no for now. Keep the type that fits the work and use the label. A type change can affect workflows, and it's easy to add later.	message	["Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai kb search nestor cross project --project adt 2>&1 | head -40; de", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai kb show 4075 2>&1 | head -60; ls dev-tools/talos/agents/nestor d", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai kb show 4075 2>&1 | head -60", "Listing dev-tools/talos/{agents/nestor/*,lib/ideas/*.py}", "Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas/approval.py", "Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas", "Reading dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas/conversation.py", "Reading dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas/approval.py", "Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas/setup.py", "Searching for \\"projects\\" in dev-tools/talos/agents/nestor/agent.json", "Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas/client.py", "Reading dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas/setup.py", "Updating the knowledge map"]	f88538c86adc-f821-179a-c9dac4010cb4	0.454099	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-24 05:58:17	f	\N
