3fbb4af96adc-986b-1f5a-9001b74edb76	e5bbc5d16adc-d3fe-2863-120be2b9005e	I've revised the plan based on your answers.\n\n**The empty space** comes from the create page. The ideas layout (`templates/app/project/idea.hbs`) already puts each page in a `col-md-9` content column. Inside that, `create.hbs` adds another `.row` with a `col-md-8` form and a `col-md-4` "How it works" box, which leaves gaps on both sides. The fix is to drop the inner row and the side box so the form box fills the content column, the same way the "Brainstorm an idea" box already does.\n\n**The description is the idea's first message** (`afterSave` in `controllers/app/project/idea/create.js` posts it). So it gets the full editor: toolbar, markdown output and a proper height, not a small field.\n\n**What changed in the plan:**\n- My Summary box and conversation box tightening is gone.\n- The create page work is its own issue. It depends on the composer issue because it reuses the editor's markdown option.\n- The approve flow is as you confirmed. After you confirm, the modal shows a spinner and Approve stays disabled. The modal closes once the approval is saved. If the save fails, the modal stays open and Approve comes back.\n- Ctrl+Enter or Send posts a message, like comments. Mentions and issue search are off.	message	["Listing prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea*.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/idea/create.js", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/idea/create.js", "Updating the knowledge map"]	3e5e67e26adc-986b-1f5a-97badbba1c45	0.242996	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-24 06:54:55	f	\N
