214e34956adc-b1c2-91a7-0fde3d68747d	5b131d096adc-f42c-e36e-1693e76da846	Agreed: the plan now works out the target from `relatedTo`/`relatedId` instead of the context link.\n\n**What I checked**\n- **Columns exist.** Gaia sets both columns on every new notification (agaia-4064). Comment and time-log notifications point at their issue, so all three resolve to `relatedTo = issue`, `relatedId = <issue id>`. The Prometheus `systemnotification` model already has both fields, and the REST load returns them. Whether the live Hermes `notification.created` event also carries them is unverified, so the issue asks for that to be checked.\n- **Old rows are NULL.** agaia-4064 left backfilling out. Gaia has no data-migration mechanism yet (only `MigrationTask` for schema and `AdminTask`), so the backfill is its own `complex` Gaia issue. Old issue, comment and time-log notifications all have `{{Issue@<issueId>}}` in their description, so the issue id can be recovered reliably.\n- **Fallback page.** The issue page route needs the project shortcode and issue number, and an issue id alone doesn't give them. The fallback takes both from the notification context. That's only for building route parameters; the target is always decided by `relatedId`.\n\n**How it works**\n- The board, the issue list and the gantt each register as preview views while they're open.\n- On click, the service asks the open view whether it holds an issue with that id. If it does, its quick view opens. If not, Prometheus goes to the issue detail page.\n- Notifications for milestones and projects keep working as today. That's out of scope here; say if you want those covered too.\n\n**Assumption:** the Prometheus work depends on the backfill. Without it, old notifications would have nothing to resolve, and I've kept no context-link fallback. Notifications the backfill can't resolve are just marked read when clicked, with no navigation.	message	["Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching the code in gaia/app/metadata/model/Systemnotification.php", "Listing prometheus/app/models/systemnotification*.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/services/notifications.js", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai kb search relatedId notification backfill migration 2>&1 | head ", "Reading prometheus/app/models/systemnotification.js", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai kb show 4064 2>&1 | head -40", "Reading prometheus/app/services/notifications.js", "Searching the code in gaia", "Listing gaia/core/tasks/*.php", "Searching the code in gaia/core/tasks", "Searching the code in gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/notifications/modules", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/router.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/models/issue.js", "Updating the knowledge map"]	1fadfea26adc-b1c2-91a7-e34517a3dd09	0.401295	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-24 08:53:53	f	\N
