297a28f96ae0-008b-29af-63080241b96a	5b131d096adc-f42c-e36e-1693e76da846	I found the cause; it's a Prometheus bug in the Created Issues box.\n\n## Cause\n\n`prometheus/app/components/idea/created-issues-box.js:53` (`describe`) reads `link.issue.projectShortcode` and `link.issue.issueNumber` as plain properties.\n- **Proxy, not a record.** `issue` on `ideaplanissue` is an **async** `belongsTo` (`models/ideaplanissue.js:49`), so `link.issue` is a promise proxy. Plain property access on the proxy returns `undefined`.\n- **Wrong label and no link.** The label comes out as `undefined-undefined`. `projectId` is `undefined` too, so `readable` is false and the row renders as the grey `text-muted` span.\n- **Missing issues aren't caught.** The proxy is always truthy, so the "no loaded issue → show the plan key" fallback never runs either.\n- **Plan box is fine.** It reads the same data with `get(link, 'issue.issueNumber')` (`plan-box.js:197`), which goes through the proxy, so its links work.\n- **Why the tests didn't catch it.** The integration test passes plain objects as `issue` (`tests/integration/components/idea/created-issues-box-test.js:17`), not real records.\n\n## Something I couldn't verify\n\nThe version headings look wrong. Plan v2 created three issues and v3 one, but you see "Plan v1" with one row and "Plan v3" with two. The box groups by the plan whose id matches each link's `ideaplanId`, so either the stored `ideaplanId`s are off (Talos records them) or your example was approximate.\n\nI couldn't read this idea's plan links: the Gaia tool was denied in this session. The issue below asks the implementer to check the real data and file a separate issue if the stored ids are wrong.\n\n## Fix\n\nOne Prometheus bug.\n- **Read the issue safely.** Use `link.belongsTo('issue').value()`: it returns the loaded record or `null` and never starts a fetch.\n- **Share the logic.** Put this in one small helper that both the box and the plan box use, so they can't drift apart again.\n- **Test with real records.** The test should use real store records instead of plain objects.	message	["Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/created-issues-box.hbs", "Listing prometheus/app/components/idea/created-issues-box.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/created-issues-box.js", "Reading prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/idea/page.js", "Reading prometheus/app/models/ideaplanissue.js", "Gaia: get idea", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/models/issue.js", "Searching the code in gaia/app/metadata/model/Ideaplanissue.php", "Listing prometheus/tests/integration/components/idea/created-issues-box-test.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/tests/integration/components/idea/created-issues-box-test.js", "Searching for \\"projectShortcode\\" in gaia/app/metadata/model/Issue.php", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/idea/plan-box.js", "Updating the knowledge map"]	28d1c2c96ae0-008b-29af-23b229a048f1	1.032469	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-27 16:19:53	f	\N
