e56ea8826ae5-10d2-613b-d1962ec01156	6471d1b46ae5-10d2-613b-e3f2313332d0	You want four fixes to the Ideas screens: make Ideas a plain nav link, align the title field on the create page, show the right status in the idea list, and open the New Idea page by default instead of the empty "Brainstorm an Idea" box.\n\n**What I found**\n1. **Nav:** the `Idea` item in `app/utils/metadata/metadata.js` (~l.140) has an `actions` list (List and New Idea). Board and Gantt don't have one. Removing it makes Ideas a direct link. "New" in the ideas list box stays as the way to start an idea.\n2. **Alignment:** in `templates/app/project/idea/create.hbs` the title's `FormFields::FieldText` sits inside an extra `<div class="form-field">`. The component already renders its own `form-field`, so the title gets double spacing. The description field is laid out correctly, as you said. The fix is to drop the extra wrapper.\n3. **Status:** an idea only has two statuses, `open` and `archived`, so every idea in the list says "Open". I need your answer here (below).\n4. **Default page:** `routes/app/project/idea/index.js` shows the Brainstorm box. It will open the create page instead. One catch: Cancel on the create page currently goes back to `idea.index`, which would now just reopen the create page. Cancel will clear the form instead. People without `idea.create` permission can't use the create page, so they keep the current hint.\n\n**Question on item 3** (it changes the plan):\n- What should the list show? **My recommendation:** each idea's progress, taken from its latest plan: *Brainstorming* (no plan yet), *Plan proposed*, *Creating issues*, *Issues created*, *Failed*, and *Archived* when archived. This needs no Gaia change: one extra query loads the plans of the listed ideas. If you meant a bug where Open/Archived is shown wrong, tell me what you saw.\n\nThe plan below covers items 1, 2 and 4 as one issue. Once you answer, I'll add item 3 as a second issue in the next version. All issues go in **aga-v1**, which already exists in A Prometheus.	message	["Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Gaia: project options aprom", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/utils/metadata/metadata.js", "Listing app/**/idea* in prometheus", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M/prometheus/app; grep -rln -i \\"idea\\" --include=*.js --include=*.hbs --include=*.scss", "Listing app/**/*idea*/** in prometheus", "Reading prometheus/app/utils/metadata/metadata.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/utils/metadata/metadata.js", "Listing app/{templates,controllers,routes}/app/project/idea* in prometheus", "Listing prometheus/app/**/idea/** in .", "Searching issues: idea status list --project aprom", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea/index.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea/create.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/routes/app/project/idea/index.js", "Searching for \\"status\\" in gaia/app/metadata/model/Idea.php", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching for \\"status\\" in prometheus/app/components/idea/conversation-box.hbs", "Reading gaia/app/metadata/model/Idea.php", "Searching for \\"status\\" in dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas", "Reading prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/idea.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/translations/en-us.json", "Listing prometheus/app/components/form-fields/field-text.* in .", "Searching for \\"FieldText\\" in prometheus/app/templates/app/project/issue/create.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/form-fields/field-text.hbs", "Searching for \\"'name' => '\\" in gaia/app/metadata/model/Ideaplan.php", "Reading prometheus/app/routes/app/project/idea.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/idea/create.js", "Searching for \\"idea\\" in prometheus/tests/acceptance", "Updating the knowledge map"]	e44e9ea16ae5-10d2-613b-5f03d1afa9d4	0.786038	b7844c206ad7-8b87