942929f96ae5-3f15-613b-73d2befe0eb9	6471d1b46ae5-10d2-613b-e3f2313332d0	Ideas in the list will show the status of their latest plan. That's the second issue in this version of the plan.\n\n**How the list status works** (`aprom` issue `idea-status`):\n- **Where the status comes from:**\n  - No plan yet: *Brainstorming*.\n  - Otherwise the latest plan's status: *Plan proposed*, *Approved*, *Creating issues*, *Issues created* or *Failed*.\n  - Archived ideas say *Archived*, whatever their plans say.\n- **Loading:** the list loads ideas only. One extra `ideaplan` query gets the plans of the project's ideas, and the newest version per idea is kept. No Gaia change is needed.\n- **Colours:** the plan box already maps plan statuses to label colours (`STATUS_LABELS` in `components/idea/plan-box.js`). That mapping moves into a small shared util, so the list and the plan box always show the same colours.\n- **Staying current:** the list today only reloads on `idea.created` and `idea.updated`. It will also update on `idea.plan.created` and `idea.plan.status.changed`, so it changes while Nestor proposes a plan or Talos creates the issues.\n\n**Left out:** the Open/Archived label in the conversation box header stays as it is. Say if it should show the plan status too.\n\nThe two issues touch different files apart from `en-us.json` and the browser test, so they can be worked on at the same time. Both are in **aga-v1**.	message	["Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching the code in prometheus/translations/en-us.json", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/idea/plan-box.js", "Searching for \\"STATUS_LABELS =\\" in prometheus/app/components/idea/plan-box.js", "Updating the knowledge map", "Reading prometheus/translations/en-us.json"]	934503d76ae5-3f15-613b-2c37f851a001	0.231795	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-30 22:05:08	f	\N
