f29b56836ae5-3f15-1173-92e785a72801	6471d1b46ae5-10d2-613b-e3f2313332d0	No, nothing changed in the rules. I put them together because each fix is small and they touch the same screens. That was my call and the wrong one for how you want to track work. I've noted your preference, so future plans get one issue per item you raise.\n\nThe new split has five issues: one per item you listed, plus the live updates of the list status as their own issue, because that change stands on its own.\n\n- **`nav-link`**: Ideas becomes a direct nav link.\n- **`create-align`**: the title field lines up with the description.\n- **`default-create`**: the New Idea page opens by default, and Cancel clears the form.\n- **`idea-status`**: the list shows the latest plan's status.\n- **`idea-status-live`**: the list status updates on plan events. It depends on `idea-status`.\n\nOnly `idea-status-live` has to wait. The other four can be worked on at the same time. All are in **aga-v1**.	message	["Updating the knowledge map"]	f1823e636ae5-3f15-1173-de26a5aadfc4	0.151134	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-30 22:06:42	f	\N
