182414466ae5-27dd-7dee-4e3ce6c5ef89	6471d1b46ae5-10d2-613b-e3f2313332d0	I've planned both changes: three new issues, separate from aprom-4204–4208.\n\n**1. Screens can't be seen during ideation**\nThe screens already reach the idea. Talos renders each one, uploads it and attaches it to my message. The idea page shows message screens with `Idea::MessageScreen`, and the plan box uses the same component. The likely fault is the preview image itself:\n- `services/upload-preview.js` `thumbnail()` uses `upload.fileThumbnail` as the image address.\n- In Gaia that field is only a **true/false flag** (`Upload.php` ~l.126). Only the upload request returns real thumbnail data, and even that is a 198×132 crop.\n- So when the page loads, the thumbnail is a broken image (or just an icon). The only way to see a screen is clicking through to a new tab.\n\nI couldn't open a real idea to confirm this (I don't have access to the idea data), so the issue starts by reproducing it.\n\nThe fix shows each screen as the full image, scaled to the message width. It loads the image the same way pasted images in messages already do, so no Gaia change is needed. Clicking a screen still opens it full size.\n\n**2. Too little room to review the plan**\nThe plan box is the `col-md-4` side column inside the `col-md-9` beside the ideas list, so it gets about a quarter of the screen. My recommendation is two separate changes:\n- **Plan review mode:** an expand button in the Plan box header swaps the columns. The plan takes `col-md-8` and the conversation drops to `col-md-4`, still usable for replies. Another click switches back, and `?view=plan` keeps the mode on reload.\n- **Collapsible ideas list:** a button in the ideas list header hides it, so the idea page uses the full width. This helps in chat mode too.\n\nTogether, the plan gets about two thirds of the screen. Just say "yes" if that layout works. Otherwise, the alternative is a full-width plan above the conversation. I can also draw both modes as screens once the screen fix is in.\n\nI've kept these in **aga-v1**. All three can be worked on at the same time.	message	["Searching issues: idea screen thumbnail preview; dev-tools/ai/ai kb search upload 404 download idea", "Searching for \\"screen\\" in dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/message-screen.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/message-screen.js", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/message-screens.hbs", "Gaia: list ideas aprom", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/services/upload-preview.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/idea", "Searching for \\"idea-message-screen\\" in prometheus/app/styles/modules/idea.scss", "Searching for \\"thumbnail\\" in gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/UploadController.php", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/modifiers/render-markdown.js", "Reading prometheus/app/services/upload-preview.js", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea/page.hbs", "Searching the code in gaia/app/metadata/model/Upload.php", "Updating the knowledge map"]	175f88a66ae5-27dd-83ef-ba9503f03470	1.064685	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-31 09:30:00	f	\N
