fe2e1a296ae5-ef52-7dee-48e8b8944a8d	6471d1b46ae5-10d2-613b-e3f2313332d0	Your screenshot showed me where it breaks. There are two faults stacked on top of each other, and they get one issue each.\n\n**1. The screens never reach the UI.** The icon and name you see are what the plan box shows when it can't find a screen by its key. In Gaia, a message's `screens` (and `steps`) are stored as JSON text, and the API sends that text back as is. In Prometheus, `models/ideamessage.js` declares both as plain `@attr` with no conversion, so they stay strings. Every component checks for an array, finds none, and draws nothing. In the plan box that leaves the static icon and key, with nothing to click. Nestor's step lists are lost for the same reason. The tests didn't catch it because the Mirage factory returns real arrays, not the text Gaia sends. Prometheus already has a `json` transform for this; the model just doesn't use it.\n\n**2. Even once found, the preview would be broken.** The screen thumbnail is loaded with `GET /upload/{id}`. That response only carries `fileThumbnail` as a true/false flag; Gaia sends the real thumbnail data only when an upload is created or when files come attached to a parent record. So the image source would be `true`. The fix from my last reply still applies: show the full image through the download token, the same way pasted images already work. It depends on fix 1 so it can be checked in the running app.\n\n**Question about the created issues** (the attached image you can't preview): I can't see which files aprom-4179 has. In its **Files** box, is `planning-view.png` there with a broken or icon-only preview, or missing entirely?\n- **If it's listed:** clicking the file name should still open it, and the thumbnail is a separate small bug.\n- **If it's missing:** Talos failed to attach it when the plan was approved, and the idea thread should have a "Some screens could not be attached" message.\n\nTell me which one and I'll add the matching issue.\n\nThe plan-review and browser-collapse issues are the same as last time; say if you want a different layout.	message	["Reading dev-tools/talos/state/ideas/6471d1b46ae5-10d2-613b-e3f2313332d0/images/fcc740596ae5-27dd-7dee-c74ddd0369c0.png", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/plan-box.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/idea/plan-box.js", "Searching for \\"screens\\" in prometheus/app", "Searching for \\"screens\\" in prometheus/app", "Searching the code in gaia/app/metadata/model/Ideamessage.php", "Searching for \\"steps\\" in prometheus/app/components/idea", "Searching the code in gaia/app", "Searching for \\"screens\\" in prometheus/mirage", "Reading prometheus/mirage/factories/ideamessage.js", "Searching the code in gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/behaviors", "Searching the code in gaia", "Searching the code in gaia/core/mvc/models/behaviors/ideaScreensBehavior.php", "Listing prometheus/app/transforms/* in .", "Reading prometheus/app/transforms/json.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/models", "Reading prometheus/app/models/ideamessage.js", "Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas/approval.py", "Reading dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas/client.py", "Reading issue 4179 | head -60", "Gaia: get issue 4179", "Searching for \\"fileThumbnail\\" in prometheus/app", "Searching for \\"def attach_png\\" in dev-tools/talos/lib/tracker.py", "Reading prometheus/app/components/issue/issue-details.hbs", "Searching the code in gaia", "Updating the knowledge map"]	fd583b336ae5-ef52-7dee-a1b870ebc2f6	0.819588	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-31 09:38:06	f	\N
