f48d57506ae5-7860-7dee-6505778590ed	6471d1b46ae5-10d2-613b-e3f2313332d0	Thanks, that settles it. The attachments on created issues work, and the problem is only on the idea page. That fits both faults I found there, so no Talos or attachment issue is needed.\n\nThe four issues are ready to approve, all in **aga-v1**:\n- **`screens-parse`**: Prometheus never parses the screens and steps that Gaia sends as JSON text, so the idea page has nothing to draw. This fix makes the screens appear in the thread and the plan box with their title and version, and opens them on click.\n- **`screen-preview`** (after `screens-parse`): shows each screen as its full image. Today the image source would be Gaia's true/false thumbnail flag.\n- **`plan-review`**: an expand button on the Plan box gives the plan the wide column, and `?view=plan` keeps it on reload.\n- **`browser-collapse`**: the ideas list can be collapsed, and the choice is remembered.	message	["Updating the knowledge map"]	f3acd5f76ae5-7860-7dee-53f92575e2d5	0.180104	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-31 09:42:12	f	\N
