d9644f186ae5-1449-ae8f-671b7834bf7a	d87ad5636ae5-1449-ae8f-5808a9dddbf1	Right now I get the Image link, fixed in 4222 however, clicking on the link in the Idea page takes to a new tab which is giving me the following error.\n[http://devapi.projects4.me/preview/get/e81a5cc86ae5-f697-ae8f-47293e992556](http://devapi.projects4.me/preview/get/e81a5cc86ae5-f697-ae8f-47293e992556)\n\n<br>\n**Fatal error**<span class="colour" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">: Uncaught Error: Class 'Gaia\\MVC\\REST\\Controllers\\Downloadtoken' not found in /var/www/html/app/api/v1/controllers/PreviewController.php:45 Stack trace: #0 [internal function]: Gaia\\MVC\\REST\\Controllers\\PreviewController->getAction('e81a5cc86ae5-f6...') #1 [internal function]: Phalcon\\Dispatcher\\AbstractDispatcher->callActionMethod(Object(Gaia\\MVC\\REST\\Controllers\\PreviewController), 'getAction', Array) #2 [internal function]: Phalcon\\Dispatcher\\AbstractDispatcher->dispatch() #3 /var/www/html/public/index.php(213): Phalcon\\Mvc\\Application->handle('/preview/get/e8...') #4 {main} thrown in </span>**/var/www/html/app/api/v1/controllers/PreviewController.php**<span class="colour" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> on line </span>**45\n\n1.**the preview should be in a modal on the same screen.\n2\\. did you assume that we will allow an image within the system to be downloaded with authentication?	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-10-31 14:19:05	f	[]
