eb653e706ae6-5efb-935c-d1a3ab8624d0	d87ad5636ae5-1449-ae8f-5808a9dddbf1	I've got what I need. Here's each item.\n\n## 1. The thread modal shows the thumbnail-size image\n\nThe plan box works and the thread doesn't, and both use the same `Idea::MessageScreen` component. So the cause is likely where the modal sits on the page, not the image it loads. In the thread, the modal is rendered inside the message's comment element (`.box-comment`). There, `conversation.scss` (~l.180 and l.232) forces every `img` to `width/height: 100% !important`, and `idea.scss` makes the screen link 160px wide. The plan box isn't inside a comment, so none of that applies there.\n\nI couldn't confirm this: your local checkout is older than 4237. So I've marked the issue complex and it starts with a failing test. The fix is to render the modal outside the thread.\n\n## 2. Collapsing the ideas list\n\nThe board and the issue list already have this control: `button.board-panel-divider`, a small crimson tab with an arrow that sits in the gap between columns. The idea list would use the same one. It points left to hide the list and right to bring it back, and it replaces both "Hide the ideas list" / "Show" text buttons. Screens 1 and 2 show it.\n\n## 3. Switching between Brainstorm and Plan\n\nTwo alternatives:\n\n- **A (recommended): the same divider handle between the conversation and the plan.** Clicking it moves the divider: the plan gets the wide column and the arrow flips. It works like the board's handle, so people already know it. It frees the box headers, which fixes the overlap with Archive/Refresh. `?view=plan` stays so the layout survives reload. Screens 1 and 2.\n- **B: a labelled switch, "Brainstorm | Plan review", above the two columns.** The clearest about what it does, but it adds a toolbar row and doesn't match the board. Screen 3.\n\nI'd leave out drag-to-resize for now. Bootstrap columns snap to 12ths, so smooth resizing needs custom width code, saved per user. It could come later on top of A.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOn the screens:\n- The divider tab is the existing component as it is, including its slightly rounded corners. Those are legacy; say if you want them squared off for the ideas page.\n- Screens 1 and 2 also show the plan box header with only the status label left, since the expand button goes away.\n\nTo finish the plan, please confirm three things:\n- The collapse handle for the list (screens 1–2)?\n- **A** or **B** for Brainstorm/Plan?\n- Should the handle still sit in the gap at small widths, where the columns stack? I'd hide it there.\n\nThe plan below holds only item 1 for now, so it can start right away. I'll add issues 2 and 3, with the approved screens attached, once you've picked.	message	["Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai kb search \\"idea plan review collapse browser\\" --project aprom 2>", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai kb show 4223 2>&1 | head -25; dev-tools/ai/ai kb show 4224 2>&1 ", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/message-screen.hbs", "Listing prometheus/app/{templates/app/project/idea*.hbs,templates/app/project/idea/page.hbs,components/idea/*.hbs}", "Listing **/.runs/issue-4237/prometheus/app/components/idea/message-*.hbs in .", "Listing */issue-42*/prometheus/app/components/idea/message-screen.hbs in .", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4223/prometheus/app/styles/modules/idea.scss", "Reading .runs/issue-4223/prometheus/app/components/idea/message-screen.hbs", "Reading .runs/issue-4223/prometheus/app/styles/modules/idea.scss", "Reading .runs/issue-4224/prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4224/prometheus/app/templates/app/project", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4224/prometheus/app/components/app-ui", "Reading .runs/issue-4224/prometheus/app/templates/app/project/board.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4224/prometheus/app/styles", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4224/prometheus/app", "Reading .runs/issue-4224/prometheus/app/styles/modules/issue.scss", "Reading .runs/issue-4223/prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea/page.hbs", "Reading .runs/issue-4223/prometheus/app/components/idea/plan-box.hbs", "Reading .runs/issue-4223/prometheus/app/components/idea/conversation-box.hbs", "Reading .runs/issue-4223/prometheus/app/components/idea/message-item.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4223/prometheus/app/styles", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4223/prometheus/app/styles", "Reading .runs/issue-4223/prometheus/app/styles/modules/conversation.scss", "Reading .runs/issue-4223/prometheus/app/styles/modules/conversation.scss", "Searching the code in prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Updating the knowledge map"]	eaa08e266ae6-5efb-935c-ff17a1a6f9db	1.430797	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-31 16:48:43	f	[{"uploadId": "d548eb836ae6-5efb-935c-b738e79a8f0b", "key": "ideas-dividers", "title": "A: divider handles, brainstorm layout", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "dde148716ae6-5efb-935c-2ad767837503", "key": "ideas-dividers-plan", "title": "A: list hidden, plan widened", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "e66377b66ae6-5efb-935c-c3b544a8bde4", "key": "ideas-plan-switch", "title": "B: labelled Brainstorm | Plan review switch", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}]
