3ca655966ae8-a01d-04c3-cc76508f2950	ca4b85356ae8-4b25-04c3-5f32a380596a	Good, so that's confirmed. Once you've stopped the extra process, new messages should get one reply each.\n\nDo you want me to plan the two A Dev Tool issues so this can't happen again?\n1. **`talos run` single-instance lock** (`simple`): a second `talos run` refuses to start and says which PID is already running.\n2. **Atomic Nestor turn claim** (`complex`): a turn that loses the claim stops before it runs Claude, so even if two processes run again, they can't both reply.\n\nBoth are in dev-tools and can be done in parallel. Say yes and I'll send the plan. I'll check for duplicate issues first if the issue search is allowed then.	message	\N	\N	0.02284	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-02 12:17:00	f	\N
