0b0579806ae6-5dca-104b-9148fe2c2cff	34bdca956ae6-8157-e410-2af2948f16f3	That works. Once Agamemnon is done, I'll plan the follow-up issues against what it actually built, not the old issue text. Some notes so the run goes smoothly:\n\n**Order.** The issues only list their Gaia dependencies, so the dispatcher could start them all at once. Run them in this order:\n1. **4044** first: the others build on its agent page.\n2. **4045, 4037, 4036 and 4059** after 4044. These four can run side by side.\n3. **4056**, which needs nothing in Prometheus and can run any time.\n4. **4038**, then **4057 and 4058**.\n\n**4038 will stop and ask** about the graph library, since the issue says a new library needs approval. If you want it to keep going, add a comment first, e.g. "No new library: draw the canvas with our own SVG layer." The same goes for these two:\n- **Node kinds:** Gaia has no API for the node kinds, so 4038 and 4057 will hard-code the list from `NodeKindCatalog.php`. Say whether that's acceptable for now.\n- **Active workflows:** Gaia refuses structural edits to an Active workflow. Say whether the editor should move it to Draft before editing.\n\n**Expect review comments, or `needs_input`, on these points:**\n- **4044:** creating an agent also needs an email; the user model has no `type` field for the AGENT badge; it's oversized and may be cut short.\n- **4036:** the refresh error (502 + `refreshError`) and skill files aren't in the issue.\n- **4058:** the test-run inputs `changes` and `actorPorts` aren't in the issue.\n- **4059:** "referenced in filter" can never appear, because Gaia doesn't record references from filters.\n\nTell me when the run is done. I'll check what was built, and the plan will only cover what's still missing, plus the Gaia node-kind catalog if you still want it.	message	["Updating the knowledge map"]	\N	0.090817	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-10-31 17:23:23	f	\N
