0463b5186ae8-162c-ab99-6906474a9581	ab9b79d46ae8-749b-ab99-c04ee42421fc	Adding assignee and comments only needs Prometheus changes, because Gaia already sends those events. The activity list is different: it needs a new event from Gaia and a Hermes change.\n\n**What I found about activity:** Gaia doesn't send any live event for activity rows. They are created in four places: status changes, time logs, file attachments and issue mentions (`IssueactivitiesComponent`, `TimeloggedComponent`, `FileattachmentComponent`, `IssuementionComponent`). All of them save an `Activity` row linked to the issue (`relatedTo` is `'issue'`).\n\nThe simplest fix is one hook in the `Activity` model that publishes a new event, `issue.activity.created`, after a row is saved. That covers every source at once, and new activity sources will be covered automatically. It is the same approach `Systemnotificationrecipient` already uses for `notification.created`. Hermes only accepts event names on its list, so it needs the new name added.\n\n**The plan has four issues:**\n1. **Gaia:** publish `issue.activity.created` from the `Activity` model hook.\n2. **Hermes:** add the new event name to its list. This ships together with issue 1.\n3. **Prometheus:** the issue page updates status, assignee and comments live. When someone else makes the change, a Messenger toast tells you. This one can start now; it doesn't wait for 1 or 2.\n4. **Prometheus:** the activity list updates live. It waits for 1 and 2, and comes after 3 because it changes the same controller.\n\n**How the toasts behave:** you get a toast for status, assignee and comment changes made by someone else. Your own changes never show a toast. New activity rows just appear in the list with no toast. Otherwise one status change would show two toasts, one for the change and one for its activity row.\n\n**Left out:** other issue fields (dates, estimates, description), the issue list page, wiki, and toasts for activity rows.	message	["Searching the code in gaia/app", "Searching issues: activity live event issue 2>&1 | head -30", "Reading gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/IssueactivitiesComponent.php", "Searching the code in gaia/app/models", "Reading issue 0 >/dev/null 2>&1; grep -n \\"\\" gaia/docs/dev/bundles.md | sed -n '/^[0-9]*:## E\\\\./,/^[0-9]*:## F/p' | head -40; ls gaia/app/mod", "Listing gaia/{app/models/Activity.php,docs/generated/bundles/E.md,docs/generated/models/Activity.md}", "Reading gaia/docs/generated/models/Activity.md", "Reading gaia/app/models/Activity.php", "Searching for \\"relatedTo = '\\" in gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components", "Reading gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/events/support/ProjectIdResolver.php", "Searching the code in gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/events/IssueLiveEventsComponent.php", "Updating the knowledge map"]	032f5db06ae8-162c-ab99-78db5d55cf44	0.409547	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-02 13:37:08	f	\N
