0a856b556ae8-20b5-ab99-2a4e553613c7	a43af2e76ae8-162c-ab99-d45c339909fd	You want the static "Agent Nestor is working on it." line replaced by an animated "thinking" indicator, and the indicator gone once the reply arrives.\n\n**What I found**\n- Talos posts that line as an ordinary idea message with kind `system` (`dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas/client.py:66`). That makes it a permanent part of the thread.\n- `system` isn't only used for this. Talos also posts real notices with it (`approval.py`, e.g. "Some screens could not be attached"). So Prometheus can't just hide every `system` message, and matching on the text would be fragile.\n- Gaia's `Ideamessage.kind` accepts any short text, and Talos ignores kinds other than `message` when it decides to start a turn or replays history. A new kind `working` therefore needs no change in Gaia.\n- Prometheus already has an animated-dots effect for comments being posted (`comment-posting-dot` in `styles/_animations.scss`), so the indicator can reuse it. The idea page already updates live when a new message arrives, so the indicator will disappear when the reply lands without a refresh.\n\n**Approach**\n1. **Talos (adt):** post the notice with kind `working` instead of `system`. This is about a two-line change plus tests.\n2. **Prometheus (aprom):** show a `working` message as the agent's avatar with "Agent Nestor is working on it" and three animated dots. Hide it as soon as any later message exists. Old threads have the old `system` version of the line, so it's handled the same way and they get cleaned up too.\n\nThe two issues can be done in parallel: Prometheus handles both the old and the new kind.\n\n**Risk:** if Talos dies mid-turn, nothing comes after the working message, so the dots keep animating until the next message. That's acceptable for now. A timeout or a "stopped" state would need Talos to report its state, which I've left out.\n\n**Left out:** live progress (streamed text or steps) while Nestor works. The README notes that Hermes has no way for the agent to publish events yet, so that would be a separate, bigger idea.	message	["Running cd /home/rana.noman/web/hammad-hassan/Pr4M; grep -n -i -A3 \\"idea\\\\|nestor\\" dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md | head -80", "Running cd /home/rana.noman/web/hammad-hassan/Pr4M; cat dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md | head -60; grep -rn -i \\"working on ", "Searching for \\"is working on it\\" in .", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Searching for \\"system\\" in prometheus/app", "Reading dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas/client.py", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/message-item.js", "Listing prometheus/app/components/idea/*", "Reading dev-tools/talos/README.md", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/conversation-box.js", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/conversation-box.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/message-item.hbs", "Searching for \\"\\"system\\"\\" in dev-tools/talos/lib", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles", "Searching the code in gaia/app", "Reading prometheus/app/styles/_animations.scss", "Searching for \\"kind\\" in gaia/app/metadata/model/Ideamessage.php", "Reading prometheus/app/styles/modules/conversation.scss", "Searching the code in gaia/app", "Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/lib/ideas", "Updating the knowledge map"]	09c8c9116ae8-20b5-ab99-e626ce692687	0.403511	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-02 13:41:30	f	\N
