a6a5a7666ae8-20b5-32a1-1e2d96e3e99a	a43af2e76ae8-162c-ab99-d45c339909fd	Here are the two states of the idea conversation box.\n\n\n\n\n\n**What the screens show**\n- **While working:** the thread ends with a compact row in the normal comment layout: Agent Nestor's name, then "Agent Nestor is working on it" in muted text, followed by three dots. There's no timestamp on the row.\n  - In the app, the dots fade in and out one after the other, using the same animation as the "Posting..." comment. The PNG can't show the animation, so it shows static dots.\n  - In the app the row also has Nestor's round avatar; avatars can't be drawn in this render.\n- **After the reply:** the indicator row is gone and the reply sits where it was. The earlier "working" lines from previous turns are gone too.\n  - The info notice at the bottom shows that real `system` notices still look exactly as they do today.\n\n**Still open:** the speech-bubble icon (`fa-commenting-o`) before the text is my choice. Tell me if you'd prefer the dots alone.\n\nThe plan hasn't changed, except that the Prometheus issue now carries both screens and names `styles/modules/idea.scss` for the styles.	message	["Listing prometheus/app/components/conversation-ui/{comment-frame,pending-comment}.hbs", "Listing prometheus/docs/ui/screens/*idea*", "Listing prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea/*.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/conversation-ui/comment-frame.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/conversation-ui/pending-comment.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea/page.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/composer.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles", "Updating the knowledge map"]	a5e568126ae8-20b5-32a1-368f5dfbef0b	0.250004	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-02 13:44:06	f	[{"uploadId": "97cee2c66ae8-20b5-32a1-5f7d772b7469", "key": "idea-working", "title": "Idea thread while Agent Nestor is working", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900