9eead0336ae8-0772-4071-c9080c16b487	22a9bd746ae8-4e76-5f8b-4f37d884cb93	Got it. Hera, the retrospective agent, is the first agent defined in Gaia that Talos runs. When a milestone completes, she reads its issues and creates **"Retrospective {{Milestone Name}}"**. The milestone **"aga-agentic system"** doesn't exist in A Dev Tool yet, so it will be created when you approve the plan.\n\n## Approach\n- **The trigger already exists.** Gaia publishes the Hermes event `milestone.completed` (`MilestoneLiveEventsComponent`) whenever a milestone moves to completed. Talos only needs to listen for it. This needs no Gaia change.\n- **Hera's definition lives in Gaia.** Her role prompt, model, turn limit and permission mode come from the `agentspec` resource (agaia-4043) at each run. Her local `agent.json` keeps only what is specific to this machine: the env file holding her credentials, the projects she covers, allowed tools and the trigger.\n- **Talking to Gaia:** Talos already passes each agent's `GAIA_*` env to its Claude run. With adt-4041 (client_credentials), that env holds Hera's own agent client id and secret, so her gaia-mcp calls run as Hera. You move 4041 into the milestone. Every new issue that needs it depends on it.\n- **Gaia permissions:** Hera's Gaia user needs `agentspec.get`, `milestone.get`, `issue.get/create` and `comment.get`, plus membership in the projects she covers. You grant these by hand (no seed SQL).\n\n## The issues\n1. **gaia-mcp milestone tools** (simple), in parallel with **2. gaia-mcp agent lookup** (simple).\n3. **Talos loads an agent's definition from Gaia** (complex, after 2 and 4041).\n4. **Talos agents that run on Hermes events** (complex), in parallel with 3.\n5. **Hera** (simple, after all of the above).\n\n## Left out\n- **Workflow lookup tools:** nothing on day one needs them; they come with adt-4047.\n- **Skills:** you said they can wait. The spec already contains them, so they're easy to add later.\n- **Replay of missed events:** if Talos is down when a milestone completes, no retro gets written. Hera's tools make catching up a small follow-up.	message	["Searching for \\"milestone\\" in gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/events", "Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/lib/hermes.py", "Reading .dev-tools-runtime/gaia-mcp/server.py", "Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/lib", "Reading dev-tools/talos/lib/registry.py", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4243/gaia/app/metadata/model/Agentspec.php", "Listing {gaia,.runs/*/gaia}/**/{Agentspec*,agentspec*}", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4220/gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/AgentspecController.php", "Reading .runs/issue-4220/gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/AgentspecController.php", "Gaia: project options adt", "Updating the knowledge map"]	9e441ca36ae8-0772-4071-926af978bd02	0.485505	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-02 20:59:10	f	\N
