e28930196ae9-467f-90e3-5f216540f8f8	34bdca956ae6-8157-e410-2af2948f16f3	Both halves of this need code. The agent and the workflow themselves are set up in the UI and need no issue.\n\n**What's missing:**\n\n1. **Gaia has no Milestone trigger.** The workflow trigger list covers issues, comments, wiki pages and time logs only. Gaia already detects "status changed to completed" for its live `milestone.completed` event. But the trigger list can't express "changed *to* a value": update triggers only look at which fields changed. Milestone saves also aren't wired to workflows at all. That's one Gaia issue.\n2. **Talos only runs agents on issues.** A Run agent step about a milestone is refused: "Talos runs agents on issues only" (`talos/lib/workflow_steps.py` ~l.197). Gaia's side is fine with any record. The run itself is built around an issue: a repo workspace, a branch and the PR flow. A retrospective needs a run with no repo: just Claude, the step's prompt and the agent's Gaia tools. That's one dev-tools issue.\n3. **The workflow editor may not show the new trigger.** It keeps its own copy of Gaia's node kinds and triggers, according to a comment on aprom-4038. The test run's record picker may also only offer issues. That's a small Prometheus issue after the Gaia one. The checkouts with that code have been cleaned up, so the agent confirms this first.\n\n**Once these are done, you set up in the UI:**\n- **The agent:** "Retrospective", with a role prompt that reads the milestone and its issues (estimates and time spent come with them) and creates one retrospective issue in the same project. Grant it the `gaia` MCP server.\n- **The workflow:** trigger *Milestone completed* → *Run agent* (Retrospective; prompt e.g. "Write the retrospective for {milestone.name}") → End. Scope: the projects you want.\n\nThe Gaia and Talos issues can run in parallel. Prometheus waits for Gaia. Left out: other milestone triggers (created, started), and a Gaia action that writes the retrospective itself. These go in **Claude-v1** by default. Say if you want them in aga-v1 with the other agent work.	message	["Reading .runs/issue-4220/gaia/core/libs/workflows/TriggerEventCatalog.php", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4220/gaia", "Reading .runs/issue-4220/gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/events/WorkflowTriggersComponent.php", "Searching for \\"WorkflowTriggers\\" in .runs/issue-4220/gaia/app/api/v1/controllers", "Reading .runs/issue-4220/gaia/docs/generated/models/Milestone.md", "Searching for \\"MILESTONE\\" in .runs/issue-4220/gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/events/support/EventNames.php", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4220/gaia/core/libs/workflows/TriggerPayload.php", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4220/gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/events/MilestoneLiveEvents.php", "Searching for \\"MILESTONE_COMPLETED\\" in .runs/issue-4220/gaia/app", "Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/lib", "Reading dev-tools/talos/lib/workflow_steps.py", "Reading dev-tools/talos/lib/workflow_steps.py", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4220/gaia/core/libs/workflows/RunAgentActor.php", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4220/gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/events/support/ProjectIdResolver.php", "Searching for \\"workflowevent\\" in .runs/issue-4243/prometheus/app", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4243/prometheus/app/utils", "Listing .runs/issue-*/prometheus/app/models/workflowevent.js in .", "Listing prometheus/app/models/workflow*.js in .", "Listing .runs/issue-*/prometheus/app/models/workflow*.js in .", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai kb search workflowevent --project aprom", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai kb search \\"trigger catalog\\" --project aprom", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4220/gaia/core/libs/workflows/RunAgentActor.php", "Searching for \\"def run_step\\" in dev-tools/talos/lib", "Updating the knowledge map"]	e195edd76ae9-467f-90e3-62433add6e32	2.327459	b