a7173e856ae9-021b-2d0a-622d49f3838c	fad996876ae9-78e7-2d0a-c16a5271c4a2	I'd do this in two stages. **Stage 1** gives people "collaboration-aware" editing and fits our current architecture. **Stage 2** is true Google-Docs-style co-editing, and I recommend scoping it with a Research issue first rather than building it now.\n\n## What the wiki does today\n- **Gaia:** `Wiki` is a plain REST resource. Saving sends the whole `markUp` document, and the last save wins. Nothing checks for conflicts, and Gaia publishes no live events for wiki (the live-updates decisions doc lists wiki as an open question).\n- **Prometheus:** the wiki uses the `AppUi::ToastUi` editor and saves the whole page in one go. The page tree is built once when the route loads, and is only rebuilt through `refreshWiki`.\n- **Hermes:** by its own rules it is a stateless relay. Only Gaia can publish to it; clients can only subscribe. It has no storage and no client-to-client messages.\n\n## Stage 1: recommended now\n1. **Live wiki:** Gaia publishes `wiki.created`, `wiki.updated` and `wiki.deleted` (added to the allowlist in Gaia and Hermes together).\n   - An open page refreshes itself.\n   - The page tree updates without a reload.\n2. **No more silent overwrites:** a save carries the `dateModified` it started from. If someone else saved in the meantime, Gaia rejects the save with a 409. Prometheus then shows a conflict dialog (their version next to yours) where you choose what to keep.\n3. **"Who's editing" presence:** a small Gaia resource records an edit session per user and page, kept alive with a heartbeat while the editor is open. It publishes `wiki.editing.*` events. The page and the tree show who is editing, and the editor warns you when someone else saves.\n\nThat's about 7 issues across Gaia, Hermes and Prometheus. No new libraries, and Hermes stays a pure relay.\n\n## Stage 2: true co-editing (live cursors, merging as people type)\nThis is much bigger than it looks:\n- **Editor:** Toast UI has no CRDT support. We'd have to switch to a ProseMirror/Tiptap editor with Yjs, which means new dependencies and approval.\n- **Server:** it needs a server that holds each document's state. Hermes's rules forbid that, so it would be a new service or a change to Hermes's design decisions.\n- **Saving:** Gaia would also need to save snapshots of the shared document.\n\nI'd start it as one Research issue that compares the options, after Stage 1 ships.\n\n## Screens\n1. **Page view** (`wiki-page-live`): a live presence notice, a pencil next to pages someone is editing in the tree, and an "updated" notice.\n2. **Edit page** (`wiki-edit-presence`): a warning that someone else saved while you were editing.\n3. **Save conflict dialog** (`wiki-save-conflict`).\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe conflict dialog shows both versions side by side; it doesn't mark the changed lines. A line-level diff could come later.\n\n## Decisions for you (my recommendation in brackets)\n1. **Scope:** build Stage 1 now and open one Research issue for Stage 2? *(Yes)*\n2. **Where presence lives:** in Gaia as a small edit-session resource, which keeps Hermes a pure relay, or tracked inside Hermes, which is lighter but changes its design decisions? *(Gaia)*\n3. **When a save conflicts:** block it with the dialog above, or let it save and just warn? *(Block with the dialog)*\n\nOnce you answer, I'll send the full plan with the issues and their dependencies.	message	["Running cat /home/rana.noman/web/hammad-hassan/Pr4M/dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md 2>/dev/null | head -300", "Running cd /home/rana.noman/web/hammad-hassan/Pr4M; ls prometheus/app/components/wiki* prometheus/app/templates/app/project/wiki", "Running cd /home/rana.noman/web/hammad-hassan/Pr4M; dev-tools/ai/ai kb search wiki collaborative editing 2>&1 | head -40; dev-to", "Listing prometheus/app/**/*wiki*", "Reading gaia/docs/generated/models/Wiki.md", "Searching for \\"wiki\\" in gaia/docs/architecture/live-updates/decisions.md", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/project/wiki.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/routes/app/project/wiki.js", "Listing prometheus/app/{templates/app/project/wiki,controllers/app/project/wiki,routes/app/project/wiki,components/wiki}/**/*", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/project/wiki/edit.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/project/wiki/page.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/wiki/edit.js", "Listing hermes/src/**/*.js", "Listing prometheus/app/components/app-ui/toast-ui*", "Listing prometheus/docs/ui/screens/*", "Reading hermes/src/socket/register.js", "Reading hermes/src/intents/rooms.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/app-ui/toast-ui.js", "Searching the code in gaia/core/mvc/controllers/RestController.php", "Reading hermes/src/contract/names.js", "Reading prometheus/docs/ui/screens/issue-detail.png", "Reading gaia/core/mvc/controllers/RestController.php", "Searching the code in prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Reading prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Listing prometheus/app/{components,templates/components}/**/tree-list*", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles/modules/wiki.scss", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/components/tree-list.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/app-ui/toast-ui.hbs", "Updating the knowledge map"]	\N	0.825904	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-03 10:25:43	f	[{"uploadId": "896682496ae9-021b-2d0a-75154f241d18", "key": "wiki-page-live", "title": "Wiki page with live presence and update notice", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "9d5078186ae9-021b-2d0a-ab2f1e31c207", "key": "wiki-edit-presence", "title": "Editing with presence and a newer-version warning", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "a668d0c76ae9-021b-2d0a-5198258fa273", "key": "wiki-save-conflict", "title": "Save conflict dialog", "version": 1, "width": 1100, "height": 640}]
