bb402bd16aea-3ad0-be98-aba3e123f85e	ba63ff326aea-3ad0-be98-b6a90d50524a	1. limit\n-1\n2. query\n(Project.id : add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729)\n3. rels\nmembers,milestones,issuetypes,issuestatuses\n4. sort\nmembers.name\nabove params had made project api fail by throwing following fatal error:\n**Fatal error**<span class="colour" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">: Allowed memory size of 134217728 bytes exhausted (tried to allocate 57344 bytes) in </span>**/var/www/html/core/mvc/controllers/RestController.php**<span class="colour" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> on line </span>**1194**	message	[]	\N	\N	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	2026-11-03 16:32:59	f	[]
