cacd9f546aea-cb24-4534-5057bf290c6e	6de133f26aea-cb24-4534-3173523ada56	The idea is to make the `:` emoji menu in comments work from the keyboard (Up/Down to move, Enter to pick) and to match emoticon shortcodes, so typing `:)` offers 🙂 and `:D` offers 😄, as well as matching by name.\n\n**What exists**\n- All comment and description editors use `AppUi::ToastUi` (`app/components/app-ui/toast-ui.js`). It builds the emoji list from the `emoji.*` translations. The Tribute menus are set up in `app/modifiers/initialize-toastui.js:332`, with `@` for users, `#` for issues and `:` for emojis (`lookup: 'name'`, `menuItemLimit: 5`).\n- **Up/Down:** Tribute already handles the arrow keys. But the modifier gives the list Bootstrap's `dropdown-menu` class, and no stylesheet styles Tribute's `li.highlight`. So the selection probably moves but you can't see it. I couldn't run the app to confirm, so the issue asks the agent to confirm the cause in the browser first. It also checks that the ToastUI editor isn't moving the cursor at the same time. The fix covers the `@` and `#` menus too, since they share the problem.\n- **Shortcodes:** typing `:)` opens the menu with the query `)`. Matching only on the name finds nothing useful there. The fix is to give each emoji a list of shortcodes and use a `values` function that ranks exact shortcode matches first, then name prefix matches, then the current fuzzy name matches.\n\n**Scope (MVP).** Tell me if you want any of these changed:\n- Only shortcodes that start with `:` (`:)` `:-)` `:(` `:D` `:P` `:O` `:|` `:/` `:'(` `:*`), because `:` is what opens the menu. Shortcodes like `;)` and `<3` would need another trigger character, so I've left them out.\n- It only searches. Typing `:) ` followed by a space doesn't convert it to an emoji automatically.\n- The old editors (`message-box.js`, `summer-note.js`) stay as they are.\n\nI split the work into two small Prometheus issues. The second depends on the first only because both change the same modifier and test file.	message	["Running cd /home/rana.noman/web/hammad-hassan/Pr4M; grep -n -i -A3 \\"emoji\\" dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md | head -40; dev-t", "Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Reading prometheus/app/modifiers/initialize-toastui.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/modifiers/initialize-toastui.js", "Reading prometheus/app/modifiers/initialize-toastui.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles", "Searching the code in prometheus", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Updating the knowledge map"]	ca0ac0186aea-cb24-4534-d682153c74f1	0.432645	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-03 16:41:46	f	\N
