255569176aea-e643-53ce-42fd4f1da977	fad996876ae9-78e7-2d0a-c16a5271c4a2	Live editing is only one part of collaboration. The bigger gain is letting people discuss a page, follow it and see who changed what. Several pieces for this already exist in Gaia, so most of it is reuse.\n\n## What we can reuse\n- **Comments:** the `Comment` model can attach to any record (it has `relatedTo`/`relatedId`), and comments already have mentions and notifications. The wiki page just doesn't show any comments yet. Gaia's live comment events currently only cover conversation rooms, so they'd need extending to wiki pages.\n- **Mentions:** the editor already supports @mentions, and issues already turn mentions into notifications (`Issuemention`). The wiki body doesn't do this yet.\n- **Watching:** issues have watchers (`Issuewatcher`), which is a ready pattern for "watch this page".\n- **History:** Gaia records old and new values for each changed field when a page is saved. There is still no history of page versions that people can browse or restore.\n\n## Suggestions, in order of value\n1. **Page discussion:** a Discussion box under the page, built with the existing comment composer. It has @mentions that notify people and updates live through Hermes.\n2. **Watch page:** a Watch button. Watchers get notified when the page is edited, commented on or moved.\n3. **Page history:** every save stores a revision (a new `Wikirevision` resource). A History view lists the revisions, shows the differences between any two, and has a Restore button. This also gives the Stage 1 conflict dialog a proper "their version".\n4. **Contributors box:** shows who wrote and edited the page, taken from the revisions.\n5. **@mentions in the page body:** mentioning someone in the page text notifies them, the same way issue descriptions do.\n\n**Later (bigger, I'd defer them):**\n- Inline comments anchored to selected text, like Google Docs margin comments. These need anchors that survive edits, which is hard without Stage 2.\n- Suggest mode with accept/reject.\n- A "request review" workflow.\n\n## Screens\n**`wiki-page-collab` (page view).** I've switched the page to the design system's detail layout:\n- the page on the left (col-md-8), with the Discussion box under it;\n- Contributors and Watchers boxes on the right (col-md-4);\n- the presence notice from Stage 1.\n\n\n\n**`wiki-history` (page history).** Revisions are listed on the left. On the right is the difference between the selected revision and the current version, with a Restore button.\n\n\n\n## Suggested order\n- **Stage 1 (live wiki and safe saves) and the cursor flags:** unchanged from my last reply.\n- **Next, in parallel:** page history first (it also improves the conflict dialog), then discussion with @mentions, watch page and the contributors box. Each is a Gaia issue plus a Prometheus issue.\n\n## Your decisions (my recommendation in brackets)\n1. **Which features to include?** *(Discussion, Watch, History with restore, and Contributors. Defer inline comments, suggest mode and reviews.)*\n2. **What notifies watchers?** *(Edits and comments, batched so a run of edits sends at most one notification every 10 minutes per page)*\n3. **Who can restore an old version?** *(Anyone with `wiki.update`. Locked pages stay creator-only.)*\n\nOnce you confirm, I'll send one complete plan covering Stage 1, the cursors, these features and the Stage 2 Research issue.\n\nI couldn't save these notes to my knowledge map: editing the file was denied this time, though it worked in the earlier turns.	message	["Running cd /home/rana.noman/web/hammad-hassan/Pr4M; dev-tools/ai/ai kb search wiki history version 2>&1 | grep -E '^#' | head; d", "Searching for \\"wiki\\" in gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components", "Searching for \\"wiki\\" in gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/events", "Running cd /home/rana.noman/web/hammad-hassan/Pr4M/gaia; ls docs/generated/models | grep -iE 'audit|comment|notif|mention|activ|", "Running cd /home/rana.noman/web/hammad-hassan/Pr4M/gaia; sed -n '5,40p' docs/generated/models/Comment.md; sed -n '5,30p' docs/ge", "Searching the code in gaia/core/mvc/models/behaviors", "Searching the code in gaia/core/mvc/models/behaviors/auditBehavior.php", "Reading gaia/core/mvc/models/behaviors/auditBehavior.php", "Updating the knowledge map"]	\N	0.808195	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-04 07:47:49	f	[{"uploadId": "198363886aea-e643-53ce-86d5d01e9786", "key": "wiki-page-collab", "title": "Wiki page with discussion, contributors and watchers", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 1100}, {"uploadId": "249d78086aea-e643-53ce-17064774e20d", "key": "wiki-history", "title": "Wiki page history with diff and restore", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}]
