9e523d996aeb-ed81-c85a-2d636227ae08	393073e96aeb-daa0-504d-005f14c7084c	OK, I'll leave the control sidebar alone.\n\nPrometheus shows user avatars in 23 places, but a status dot only helps where you'd use it to decide whether to contact someone right now. I sorted them that way:\n\n**Worth having (my recommendation)**\n1. **Project dashboard → Members box** (`templates/app/project/index.hbs` ~265). This is the team's main "who's around" view. The avatar wrapper (`member-avatar-wrap`) already overlays an inactive/invited badge, so a dot fits the same pattern.\n2. **User profile → close members** (`components/user-profile/close-members.hbs`). People you work with, linked to their profiles.\n3. **User management list** (`templates/app/user/management.hbs` ~97). It already has a "Last activity" column, so the dot is the live version of that.\n4. **Your own sidebar panel** (`app-ui/nav-bar.hbs`). The "Online" text stays, but it becomes your real connection state: Online, Away, or Reconnecting.\n\n**Maybe, later**\n- **Assignee picker** (`issue/assignee-select.hbs`) and the **Add watchers** modal. These are nice-to-haves, not why people open those screens.\n- **User-to-user conversations** (aprom-3752, still new). Presence matters most in direct messages, so it should be part of that feature when it's built, not this one.\n\n**Not worth it**\n- Comment and conversation author avatars, notifications, gantt bars, the small avatar stack on project cards (`project/member-avatars.hbs`), and the header. They show who did something in the past, they're too small for a dot, or both. Adding dots there would add clutter and more presence lookups.\n\n**How it would look:** a small round dot (round is allowed for status dots) at the bottom-right of the avatar: green for online, amber for away, nothing for offline. Hovering it shows a tooltip such as "Away · active 12 min ago". One shared `UserUi::PresenceDot`-style component would be used at every site, fed by a presence service that checks `lastActivityAt` about once a minute for the users on the screen.\n\nTwo questions before I plan:\n1. Is that set right: the Members box, close members, user management and your own panel? [Yes.]\n2. Do you want a mockup of the Members box with dots first? [Yes, it's the screen that sets the look for the rest.]	message	["Searching for \\"userimage/get\\" in prometheus/app", "Reading prometheus/app/components/project/member-avatars.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/user-profile/close-members.hbs", "Searching for \\"userimage/get\\" in prometheus/app", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/project/index.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/issue/issue-details.hbs", "Updating the knowledge map"]	\N	0.148991	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-04 14:39:26	f	\N
