f4efe9d16aeb-9e83-c85a-a5fd1ea2be1b	393073e96aeb-daa0-504d-005f14c7084c	Here's the plan: dots on the project dashboard's Members box only. It's two Prometheus issues and needs no change in Gaia or Hermes.\n\n**How it works**\n- Each member's status comes from `User.lastActivityAt`, which Gaia already updates on every authenticated request:\n  - **Online:** active in the last 5 minutes (green dot, `$successColor`).\n  - **Away:** active 5 to 30 minutes ago (amber dot, `$warningColor`).\n  - **Offline:** nothing for over 30 minutes, or never. No dot.\n- Hovering a dot shows "Online", or "Away · active 12 minutes ago".\n- Invited and inactive members keep their current badge and get no dot.\n- While the dashboard is open, a small service re-fetches only `id,lastActivityAt` for the members every 60 seconds and stops when you leave the page. Dots update within about a minute, so this is near real time, not instant.\n\n**Split**\n1. **`presence-dot`:** a standalone component that turns a `lastActivityAt` into a dot plus tooltip, with tests. Nothing else depends on it yet.\n2. **Presence polling + Members box:** a service that keeps the timestamps fresh, plus the dashboard integration. It depends on 1.\n\n**Left out**\n- Your own sidebar "Online" stays static.\n- No dots on other screens and no changes to the control sidebar.\n- No status that people set themselves.\n- No instant push presence through Hermes; that needs a Hermes ADR.\n- The string-concatenated query in Gaia's `trackLastActivity` isn't in this plan. I can add a small Gaia issue for it if you want.\n\n**One limitation:** "active" means "made an API request". Someone with Prometheus open in an idle tab that makes no requests will drift to Away. Anyone viewing the dashboard stays Online, because the polling itself counts as a request. That's fine for this version.\n\nI can mock up the Members box with dots before you approve if you'd like to see it.	message	["Searching the code in prometheus/app/routes/app/project/index.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles/variables.scss", "Searching the code in gaia/docs/generated/acl-matrix.md", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/routes/app/project/index.js", "Updating the knowledge map"]	f430d0d66aeb-9e83-c85a-a814a9b6ec1c	0.207688	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-04 14:45:08	f	\N
