7a4fa5126aeb-160e-d9f0-51ee477161ce	34bdca956ae6-8157-e410-2af2948f16f3	I am unable to mark a workflow as active, I am getting the error\n\n\\<div class="messenger-message-inner">Port 'done' of node 'call Hera' is not connected; connect it or end it with an end node.\\<br>\nPort 'needs\\_input' of node 'call Hera' is not connected; connect it or end it with an end node.\\<br>\nPort 'blocked' of node 'call Hera' is not connected; connect it or end it with an end node.\\<br>\nPort 'failed' of node 'call Hera' is not connected; connect it or end it with an end node.\\<br>\nPort 'limit' of node 'call Hera' is not connected; connect it or end it with an end node.\\</div>	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-05 00:40:26	f	[]
b16cd2366aeb-160e-d9f0-eec4f6fbbe8e	34bdca956ae6-8157-e410-2af2948f16f3	This isn't a bug: it's a rule Gaia applies when a workflow is activated. Every output port must lead somewhere, and a branch only ends at an explicit **End** node (`core/libs/workflows/WorkflowGraph.php`). A Run agent step has five ports: done, needs_input, blocked, failed and limit. "call Hera" has none of them connected.\n\n**To get it active now:** add one End node from the palette's actions and connect each of the five ports to it. Each port takes one connection, but one End node can take any number. Better still, send `done` on to the next step and only end the rest.\n\nThe rule is worth keeping: it stops a forgotten `failed` branch from silently dropping a run. But the editor makes it tedious and only shows you at activation time. I recommend fixing that in Prometheus rather than relaxing Gaia:\n- **Open-port markers** on the canvas, so you see the problem while building.\n- **An "End open ports" action** on a selected node: it connects every free port to one End node, adding the End node first if the workflow has none.\n\nThe other option is to change Gaia so a port with no connection counts as an implicit end. I'd turn that down: it would make the forgotten-branch case silent again.	message	["Searching the code in .runs/issue-4220/gaia/core/libs/workflows/WorkflowGraph.php", "Reading .runs/issue-4220/gaia/core/libs/workflows/WorkflowGraph.php", "Updating the knowledge map"]	b08175706aeb-160e-d9f0-42e10cb53bf7	2.02726	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-05 00:41:21	f	\N
