6fabed026aee-bd4d-6d43-ecf9d0333615	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	I've drawn the three screens and the plan below. Before you approve, there are three findings, a naming question and two changes to how you split the work.\n\n**Findings in the code**\n- **Name clash.** `<QueryBuilder>` is already taken by the classic jQuery component (`app/components/query-builder.js`), and that stays until the removal phase. I propose `app/components/query/` for the new pieces: `<Query::Builder>`, `::SearchBar`, `::Panel`, `::Group`, `::Condition`, `::ValueEditor`. The styles stay in `components/query-builder*.scss`.\n- **Another Gaia trap.** `Clause.php:159` treats any leaf containing `NULL` or `EMPTY` (case-sensitive, anywhere in the leaf) as a no-value operator. So `subject CONTAINS NULL pointer` breaks in Gaia today. I added it to the serializer's refusals, next to brackets and apostrophes.\n- **Wire format details the parser must accept.** Board and Gantt build top-level `(a) AND (b)` without outer brackets, put an extra space before the bracket (`(Issue.milestoneId : X )`) and use `NULL`/`EMPTY`. Values with spaces inside a bracketed leaf are often unquoted. Inside brackets the value therefore runs to `)`; outside brackets it is one word unless quoted.\n\n**Changes to your split**\n- **Query core is two issues:** the model (tree, operators, serializer, composer) and the parser (lexer, parser, round trips). Together they would be over 15 files.\n- **The Panel is two issues:** `ValueEditor` first, then `Panel`/`Group`/`Condition`.\n- **A last container issue (`Query::Builder`).** It holds the tree, the toolbar and the API, so SearchBar and Panel only take `@tree`/`@onChange` and can really run in parallel.\n- Error codes come out of the utils with positions; their translations ship with the issue that defines them, so neither UI depends on the other.\n\n**Decisions I made (say if you disagree)**\n- **Mixed and/or without brackets:** AND binds tighter, so `a OR b c` reads as `a OR (b AND c)`.\n- **Consecutive bare words** become one phrase: `time zone` is `(Issue.subject CONTAINS 'time zone')`.\n- **Field prefixes:** a unique prefix also works for fields (that's how `prio = hi` resolves).\n- **Incomplete builder rows** are lost when you apply a query typed in the bar.\n\n**Not planned in this phase:** page integration, removing jQuery QueryBuilder, the Gaia value-binding fix, using the composer on boards, and suggestions from recent or saved queries.\n\n**Screens**\n- **toolbar-typing:** the toolbar while typing `prio`. The menu has the field suggestion first, then a subject-search fallback and the key hints.\n- **builder-open:** the bar showing the formatted query with colours, and the builder open with an AND group (status IN, start date BETWEEN, one incomplete row) and a nested OR group.\n- **bar-error:** an unknown-value error with its position. Search is disabled while the query is invalid.\n\nThe renderer only has the CSS that exists today, so the screens use stand-ins for the parts that need new styles:\n- Groups are shown as `box-primary` (AND) and `box-default` (OR). In the real component they get the crimson or plum left edge from your design.\n- The query colours use AdminLTE text classes; the build should use `$secondaryColor` for fields, `$primaryColor` for operators and `$highlightColor` for keywords.\n\nI couldn't run `ai kb search` (the shell is blocked in this session), so I haven't checked for existing query builder issues. If you know of any, tell me and I'll link or drop them.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n**Plan: 8 issues in A Prometheus, Claude-v1**\n\nThere are two chains that can run in parallel:\n- **Text chain:** model → parser → completer → SearchBar\n- **Builder chain:** model → schemas → ValueEditor → Panel\n\nThe container comes last and depends on both chains.\n\n**Questions** (answer "yes" to keep my recommendation):\n1. Name the new components `Query::*` (recommended) instead of renaming the old classic component now?\n2. Is the AND-binds-tighter rule for unbracketed mixed and/or OK?\n3. Do you want the container issue (recommended), or should SearchBar own the container and Panel wait for it?	message	["Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M/prometheus && ls app/utils/query app/utils/metadata app/components | head -80; wc -", "Listing prometheus/app/utils/query/**/*", "Listing prometheus/docs/ui/screens/*", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/templates/app/project/issue/index.hbs", "Listing prometheus/app/components/form-fields/*", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/project/issue/index.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/utils/query/parser.js", "Reading prometheus/app/utils/query/builder.js", "Reading prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Reading prometheus/docs/ui/screens/issue-list.png", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/routes/app/project", "Listing prometheus/app/{components/query-builder*,utils/metadata/querybuilder*,services/*search*,models/savedsearch*}", "Reading prometheus/app/components/query-builder.js", "Reading prometheus/app/utils/metadata/querybuilder-operators.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/issue/index.js", "Reading prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/issue/index.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/controllers/app/projects/index.js", "Searching the code in gaia/core/mvc/models/query/Clause.php", "Reading gaia/core/mvc/models/query/Clause.php", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles", "Reading prometheus/app/components/form-fields/field-text.hbs", "Listing prometheus/app/components/app-ui/dropdown.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/styles/modules/document.scss", "Reading prometheus/app/components/app-ui/dropdown.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching the code in prometheus/translations/en-us.json", "Reading prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/issue/index.js", "Updating the knowledge map"]	6e7c3bc66aee-bd4d-6d43-e693c55b93b7	1.760982	b7844c2