554165c56aee-46a0-e0b2-af25b827016e	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	For the name, lets user ezSearch.\nI am fine with the gaia issues.\nNext for mixed and or. We have a rule, every clause is contained. This way there is no interpretation required and no unexpected result, to facilitate the user I am having you creat the autocomplete and better search bar. lets not break this rule.\nConsecutive bare words being encapsulated together is totally fine.\nIf no field prefix is defined we default to the current module\nLosing incomplete is totally fine.\n\nBut lets create the gaia issues.\n\nAll the issues goes to milestone aga-v1.\n\nI have restarted talos so let try to generate the screen again and this time also create mobile compatible views.\n\n<br>\n<br>	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-06 21:27:49	f	[]
