f62b90706aee-a9ea-e0b2-2030d9aac03b	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	Here is plan v2 with your decisions applied: the ezSearch name, no AND/OR mixing, the default module, the Gaia issues, milestone **aga-v1** and mobile views. The screens are re-sent with the same keys, and the three mobile views are added as one sheet.\n\n**What changed**\n- **Name:** the components live in `app/components/ez-search/`: `<EzSearch>` (the container) and `<EzSearch::SearchBar>`, `::QueryText`, `::Panel`, `::Group`, `::Condition`, `::ValueEditor`. Translations go under `components.ezSearch.*`, and the utils stay in `app/utils/query/`.\n- **No mixing:** a group without brackets that has both AND and OR is an error, never interpreted. An implied AND counts as AND. The completer follows the same rule: once a group has AND, it only suggests AND.\n- **Default module:** a word followed by an operator that isn't an alias, a label or a unique prefix becomes `<Module>.<word>`. The case is taken from the schema's field ids when one matches, so `startdate` becomes `Issue.startDate`. The "unknown field" error is gone.\n- **Mobile:** below 768px the toolbar wraps. The bar takes a full row, the buttons go on a second row (icons only for Saved Searches and Builder), and the suggestion menu is full width. Builder rows stack field, operator and value, and group buttons become icons.\n\n**Gaia: 3 request issues, in order**\n\nAll three change the same method in `Clause.php`, so they run one after another:\n1. **Spot NULL/EMPTY by the operator.** Today `Clause.php:159` matches those words anywhere in the leaf.\n2. **Bind values and validate field names.** Values are concatenated into PHQL today; field names come straight from the query too. The bound values have to follow the where string through query splitting, `getWhereClause` and the many-to-many relation path.\n3. **Parse leaves with quotes in mind.** Brackets inside quoted values then work, and an apostrophe is written as `''`.\n\nThe Prometheus serializer keeps refusing these characters until all three are merged; relaxing that belongs in the Issue list phase.\n\n`ai kb search` is still blocked in this session, so I couldn't check whether Gaia already has an issue for binding query values.\n\n**Screens**\n- **toolbar-typing, builder-open, bar-error:** the same three desktop screens as before.\n- **mobile-views:** one sheet with three 390px-wide views side by side, because a reply can hold at most four screens. The third view shows the new mixed AND/OR error.\n\nThe renderer only has today's CSS, so these parts are stand-ins:\n- The crimson and plum group edges.\n- The colours of the formatted query.\n- The way the toolbar wraps on mobile.\n\nThe issues describe the real styles.	message	["Reading gaia/core/mvc/models/query/Clause.php", "Reading gaia/core/mvc/models/query/Clause.php", "Searching the code in gaia/core", "Updating the knowledge map"]	f501fad46aee-a9ea-e0b2-c359d0594351	0.930426	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-06 21:34:46	f	[{"uploadId": "c7bdbbe86aee-a9ea-e0b2-761bc0b65188", "key": "toolbar-typing", "title": "ezSearch toolbar: typing 'prio', suggestions open", "version": 2, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "d43239926aee-a9ea-e0b2-477a1fa1658b", "key": "builder-open", "title": "ezSearch builder open: AND group, status IN, date BETWEEN, nested OR", "version": 2, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "e14965b06aee-a9ea-e0b2-d2bcff58c15e", "key": "bar-error", "title": "ezSearch bar: unknown value error with position", "version": 2, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "ed8d61636aee-a9ea-e0b2-751c977ff5e4", "key": "mobile-views", "title": "ezSearch on mobile (390px): typing, builder, mixed AND/OR error", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 1100}]
