047e45c36aee-88b0-248d-a723bbd81d3c	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	Here is plan v3 with both changes:\n\n- **New small issue ahead of the integration.** **ez-saved-search-api** adds `@activeSavedSearchId` and `@onSavedSearchChange` to `<EzSearch>` on top of aprom-4300. The integration issue now depends on it instead of on 4300 directly.\n- **Screens as a guide.** Every issue that carries screens now says the PNGs are a rough guide to layout and content, not the final look. Where they disagree with the design system or the real components, the design system and the real components win. The renderer only has today's CSS, so group edges, query colours and the mobile wrapping are stand-ins. I'll write this into every future issue that carries screens.\n\nThe phase 1 issues that already have screens attached (aprom-4297, 4298, 4299, 4300) don't carry this note. I can't edit issues, so you may want to add a comment there.	message	["Updating the knowledge map", "Updating the knowledge map"]	036203086aee-88b0-248d-67de2e16ce14	0.246365	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-07 01:59:32	f	\N
