594a4e126aee-8611-5ba1-a676eb5ccc9c	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	That explains it: `FormFields::FieldText` always renders a `.form-field` wrapper, and `styles/modules/form-fields.scss:11-13` gives every `.form-field` `margin: 3rem`. The fix is a style override that applies only inside the ezSearch bar; the global rule stays.\n\nThe mobile menu has a similar cause. `AppUi::Dropdown` positions its menu with `right: 0` (`styles/components/dropdown.scss:26`), so the menu lines up with the right edge of the button and grows to the left. Saved Searches sits at the left edge of the screen, so on a phone the menu opens off-screen. That rule is shared by every dropdown (the board and conversation styles override it too), so the fix applies only inside `.ez-search`: `left: 0; right: auto`.\n\nThis replaces the earlier `ez-single-line` plan with two small bugs, one per problem. They change different style files, so they can go in parallel.	message	["Reading dev-tools/talos/state/ideas/c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e/images/f11f9f676aee-b0e7-5ba1-07178c2072ec.png", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles/modules/form-fields.scss", "Searching for \\"app-dropdown\\" in prometheus/app/styles", "Reading prometheus/app/styles/components/dropdown.scss", "Reading prometheus/app/styles/modules/form-fields.scss", "Updating the knowledge map"]	5854a5816aee-8611-5ba1-999303bf0514	0.275241	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-07 07:25:13	f	\N
