4d56fad06aee-4713-5ba1-f5d73f377c35	d87ad5636ae5-1449-ae8f-5808a9dddbf1	When an image is added by a user in the chat box in Ideas section. The image is successfully uploaded, however for some reason it is unable to display it, the display section get stuck in a loop where it continuously tries to load the attached image, which when I see in the network request is returned. However the views keeps on trying to load it and it continuously tries to refresh the section.	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-07 07:29:17	f	[]
