7357f6a76aef-53b5-9b16-71abcb86f211	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	```\nNext phase: move the remaining jQuery QueryBuilder\nusers and remove it.\n- Project list (templates/app/projects/index.hbs, controllers/app/projects/index.js) on the project schema.\n- Admin module lists (controllers/app/module.js, `#builder`): a schema built from MD.getViewMeta(module,\n  'filters').\n- Then remove:\n  - jQuery-QueryBuilder and jquery-extendext from package.json / ember-cli-build;\n  - utils/query/builder.js, the old utils/query/parser.js, utils/metadata/querybuilder-operators.js and\n    components/query-builder.js;\n  - the old searchByRules/openFilters code and global keydown handler in controllers/prometheus/list.js;\n  - the plugin's styles in app.scss and modules/*.scss.\n- Acceptance tests for both lists.\nRemoval goes last, depending on both migrations.\n```	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-07 12:24:19	f	[]
10b71bb86aef-9bb6-9b16-907c9cf2f81a	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	The plan is three issues: the Project list moves to ezSearch, the admin list's search is removed, and the plugin removal comes last. The admin lists don't work the way your brief assumes, so that's the one decision for you.\n\n**The admin module list search can't work today.**\n- `controllers/app/module.js:255` reads `MD.getViewMeta(module, 'filters').enabledFilters`. No module in `utils/metadata/metadata.js` defines `filters` view metadata: only `Project` has `list` metadata, and the Dashboard widget `filters` are something else. So `getViewMeta` returns `false`, there are no filters, and the jQuery plugin throws as soon as `setupQuery` runs.\n- Nothing in the app links or transitions to `app.module`. It's only the catch-all route (`:module`), and Project has its own `app.projects` route.\n- A schema built from `MD.getViewMeta(module, 'filters')` would therefore be empty.\n\n**Question:** I recommend removing the search from the generic list for now (`module.hbs` search box and `#builder`; `searchByRules`, `setupQuery`, `openFilters` and `toggleFilters` in `module.js`). It isn't usable today, and adding a schema for metadata that doesn't exist is guesswork. The alternative is ezSearch with a schema built from each module's `list` field metadata. Only Project has that, and Project is already covered by its own list. The plan below takes the recommended option; say if you want the alternative.\n\n**Other findings**\n- **Project list:** it has the same shape as the Issue list (saved searches, `searchId`, `toggleSearch`), so it can copy aprom-4305: `applyQuery`, the saved-search arguments from aprom-4304, and the `project` schema from aprom-4295. Its route has no project filter to add, so it passes no `@baseQuery` either.\n- **`user/management`** also extends `list.js`, but its template has no search, so the removal doesn't affect it.\n- **Styles to remove:** the plugin's styles are `document.scss:456-466` and `module.scss:11-46`. The `.search` block (`document.scss:329`) is reused by the ezSearch toolbar, so it stays.\n- **Plugin imports:** there is no plugin CSS import, only the two JavaScript imports in `ember-cli-build.js:45-46` and the two `package.json` entries (l.105, l.107).\n- **Generated docs:** `docs/` is generated YUIDoc that still mentions the old classes. Regenerating it isn't part of this plan.	message	["Searching the code in prometheus", "Searching the code in prometheus", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/controllers/app/module.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/templates/app/module.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/templates/app/projects/index.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/controllers/app/module.js", "Reading prometheus/app/controllers/app/module.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/router.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Reading prometheus/app/utils/metadata/metadata.js", "Reading prometheus/app/routes/app/module.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/utils/metadata", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles", "Searching the code in prometheus", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/utils/metadata/metadata.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/package.json", "Listing prometheus/tests/acceptance/{project,projects,module,admin}*/**/*.feature", "Reading prometheus/app/utils/metadata/metadata.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Reading prometheus/app/controllers/app/projects/index.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/routes/app/projects/index.js", "Listing prometheus/{tests/**/*query*,app/templates/components/query-builder.hbs,tests/acceptance/project/search-project-from-list.feature}", "Searching for \\"_searchRulesHandler\\" in prometheus/app", "Reading prometheus/app/styles/modules/document.scss", "Updating the knowledge map"]	0fb2a8496aef-9bb6-9b16-7c7c8caa0908	2.515971	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-2298