0ad701666aef-1001-619b-c989bccea008	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	The premise of #4326 doesn't hold. Two list pages still depend on the code this issue deletes:\n\napp/templates/app/agent/index.hbs (l.35, 44, 48) and app/templates/app/workflow/index.hbs (l.35, 44, 53) use {{query-builder}}, this.openFilters, this.searchByRules and this.clearSearch.\nTheir controllers extend PrometheusListController and define a metadata property for the query builder.\napp/controllers/app/project/issue/index.js saveSearch (l.236) still sends searchByRules. It is probably dead code, since the Issue list moved to ezSearch in #4305.\napp/styles/app.scss l.42 imports the QueryBuilder scss. The issue doesn't list it, and it must go too.\nRemoving everything as written would break the Agents and Workflows lists.\n\nOptions\n\n(Recommended) Convert the Agents and Workflows lists to ezSearch in a separate issue, as #4324 and #4325 did. Hold #4326 until that issue is merged. Their metadata and templates differ from the generic module list, so this is a real feature change and not cleanup.	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-07 14:43:22	f	[]
