92f00f486aef-1001-619b-ffd92c8e6069	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	I agree: the Agents and Workflows lists still use the jQuery builder, so #4326 has to wait for them. I checked the code that #4326 is running on (`.runs/issue-4326/prometheus`).\n\n**What's there**\n- **Same pattern as the Issue list.** Both lists extend `PrometheusListController`, define `metadata.filters` in the controller and load saved searches in their routes. Their templates have the jQuery search plus a Saved Searches dropdown, but no Save Search button.\n  - Agents filters: `Agent.name`, `Agent.purpose` and `sponsor.name`.\n  - Workflows filters: `Workflow.name`, `Workflow.description` and `Workflow.status` (Draft, Active or Disabled, translated under `views.app.workflow.status.*`).\n- **Search metadata is in place.** #4323 added `views.Issue.search` and `views.Project.search`, so these two lists only need `views.Agent.search` and `views.Workflow.search` plus the template switch.\n- **Saved-search code is copied, not shared.** #4305 and #4324 each copied the same four actions into their controller: `ezSavedSearches`, `selectSavedSearch`, `showEzSaveSearchDialog` and `saveEzSearch`. Converting Agents and Workflows the same way would make four copies.\n  - I've added a small issue first that moves them into `controllers/prometheus/list.js`.\n  - Each list then only says what a saved search is related to (`relatedTo`, and `projectId` where it applies).\n  - That fits the metadata-driven direction from #4323.\n\n**Plan:** three issues. The base-class move comes first; Agents and Workflows then run in parallel. Agents and Workflows keep today's behaviour: saved searches can be picked but not saved from these lists. With the base class, adding Save Search to them later is template work only.\n\n**#4326 needs a comment and a hold.** I can't edit issues, so please put #4326 on hold until agent-list and workflow-list are merged, and add this comment:\n\n> Hold until the Agents and Workflows lists are on ezSearch (issues from idea c89b1b19, plan v9). Additional removals:\n> - `app/styles/app.scss` l.42: `@import 'node_modules/jQuery-QueryBuilder/dist/scss/default.scss';`\n> - `app/controllers/app/project/issue/index.js`: the old `saveSearch` action (~l.236, sends `searchByRules`). It is dead since #4305 (the template uses `saveEzSearch`); check for the same leftover in `controllers/app/projects/index.js`.\n> - After these issues, `metadata.filters` should exist in no controller.	message	["Listing **/app/controllers/app/{agent,workflow}/index.js in .", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/controllers/app/agent/index.js", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/controllers/app/workflow/index.js", "Reading .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/templates/app/agent/index.hbs", "Reading .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/controllers/app/workflow/index.js", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/templates/app", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/utils/metadata/metadata.js", "Listing .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/tests/acceptance/{agent,workflow,agents,workflows}/**/* in .", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/styles/app.scss", "Reading .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/styles/app.scss", "Reading .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/controllers/app/agent/index.js", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app", "Searching for \\"EzSearch\\" in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/templates", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/controllers", "Updating the knowledge map"]	91c032376aef-1001-619b-4f2a65ecc31a	2.690095	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-07 14:45:38	f	\N
