098847b76aef-57d2-2f5c-d7216761554c	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	Here are the mockups for search on the idea list. They show two layouts so you can pick one before I write the plan. As before, they only use today's CSS, so treat them as a guide to layout and content.\n\n**What I found**\n- The idea list is the narrow `col-md-3` box on the left of the idea area (`templates/app/project/idea.hbs`). Its route loads all of the project's ideas at once (`(Idea.projectId : X)`, `limit -1`).\n- Whether an idea is open or archived, and its progress label (Brainstorming, Proposed, Approved, Created…), are worked out in the browser. The label is the status of the idea's latest plan (`progressByIdea`).\n- Gaia's Idea can be searched by `title`, `description`, `status` (open/archived), the creator (`createdBy.name`) and the created/modified dates. **The progress label can't be searched in Gaia**: it isn't stored on Idea, and filtering through `plans.status` would match any version of the plan, not the latest.\n\n**Option A (recommended):** a compact search bar inside the idea list box, with a Builder icon in the box header.\n- Enter runs the search, and the suggestion menu is as wide as the bar.\n- The builder opens in a modal, because the column is too narrow for the full builder.\n- A small line under the bar ("3 of 14 ideas · Clear") shows that a search is active.\n- The conversation keeps its full width.\n\n**Option B:** the full ezSearch toolbar across the top of the idea area, as on the Issue list.\n- It's familiar, but it pushes the conversation down on every idea page, and the search filters a list that sits under it rather than next to it.\n\n**Screens**\n- **idea-search-a:** Option A with a search applied (ideas created by Hammad whose title contains "search").\n- **idea-search-a-builder:** Option A's builder modal.\n- **idea-search-b:** Option B.\n- **idea-search-a-mobile:** Option A on mobile, typing `sta` with the menu open.\n\n**Questions** (my recommendation first, so "yes" works):\n1. **Layout:** Option A?\n2. **Progress (plan status):** leave it out of search for now. The alternative is a Gaia change that stores the latest plan status on Idea so it can be searched, which would be a separate Gaia request.\n3. **Archived ideas:** while a search is active, list matching archived ideas too (with their Archived label) and hide the "Show archived" toggle. The alternative is keeping the toggle as it is.\n\nNo saved searches or Save Search on the idea list for now.	message	["Listing .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/{templates/app/project/idea*.hbs,templates/app/project/idea/*.hbs,controllers/app/project/idea.js,routes/app/project/idea.js,components/idea/*.hbs,styles/modules/idea.scss} in .", "Listing .runs/issue-4326/gaia/app/metadata/model/Idea.php in .", "Reading .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/idea.js", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/routes/app/project/idea.js", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/models/idea.js", "Reading .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/idea.js", "Reading .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/idea.js", "Listing {gaia,.runs/*/gaia}/app/metadata/model/Idea.php in .", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4326/prometheus/app/styles/modules/idea.scss", "Searching the code in gaia/app/metadata/model/Idea.php", "Reading gaia/app/metadata/model/Idea.php", "Updating the knowledge map"]	\N	2.754651	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-07 17:16:57	f	[{"uploadId": "df75ac696aef-27f6-2f5c-db9d787383b5", "key": "idea-search-a", "title": "Option A: compact ezSearch in the idea list, query applied", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "eb21c9606aef-27f6-2f5c-a6117ab2a066", "key": "idea-search-a-builder", "title": "Option A: builder in a modal, opened from the idea list", "version": 1, "wi