b6235c456aef-41e1-a72a-17e69c7eacc6	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	Here's the plan: five Prometheus issues, all in milestone aga-v1.\n\n**How the issues fit**\n1. **ez-search-base:** moves `<EzSearch>`'s state into a shared base class. Behaviour doesn't change; it's what keeps `<EzSearchCompact>` a true drop-in.\n2. **ez-saved-name-edited:** shows the active saved search's name and the "edited" state, with Update, Save as new and Revert, on both components. It adds `@onUpdateSavedSearch`.\n   - The store calls for saved searches move into a `saved-search` service, because the idea controller doesn't extend the list controller.\n   - Today aprom-4304 drops the mark when the query changes; this replaces that.\n3. **ez-chips:** the applied-filter chips as their own component. It runs in parallel with 1 and 2.\n4. **ez-search-compact:** `<EzSearchCompact>` itself, multi-row by default or a single row with `@linear={{true}}`, with the builder in a modal.\n5. **ez-idea-list:** the idea list uses `<EzSearchCompact>`, with `views.Idea.search` metadata and project saved searches.\n\nAssumptions written into the issues:\n- **Archived ideas:** while a search is active, matching archived ideas are listed with their Archived label and the "Show archived" toggle is hidden. Without a search the list works as today.\n- **Saved searches** on the idea list are per project.\n- **The idea list has no plan-status field:** the progress label isn't stored in Gaia, so it can't be searched.\n\nNot planned in this phase: the header (it needs a decision on what Search shows there), Threads, Gantt Cal and the Task Board, and the extras from your mockup (Mine, sort, tags, searching messages).	message	["Updating the knowledge map"]	b4d0edf56aef-41e1-a72a-c33e000f52b6	0.401	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-07 17:49:42	f	\N
