f37f08106aef-218c-aab1-16debd9aaebc	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	Here are the placements and the plan for the Gantt Cal and the Task Board. The two issues don't depend on each other and can run in parallel. The screens are drawn with today's CSS only, so treat them as a guide to layout and content.\n\n**Gantt Cal: multi-row compact search (default)**\n- Today the Gantt has no search box at all. It only honours a `?query=` in the URL, which the route adds to each milestone's issue query.\n- The search goes at the top of the left task list (the 400px column), above the Milestone / Start-End header. It gets the bar with Search and Clear, Saved, Filter with its badge, and chips.\n- It searches issues with the existing Issue search fields and the project's issue saved searches, the same ones the Issue list uses. Saving and updating go through the `saved-search` service.\n- `GanttChart` doesn't take on search: the page passes the search in through a named block, and the chart just places it above the header.\n\n**Task Board: linear compact search**\n- Today the board has two filters: a Saved Searches dropdown that changes the server query, and a free-text box that hides loaded cards in the browser (`task-board/issues-provider.js`). The linear bar replaces both and sits where they are now, at the right of the milestone tabs row.\n- **Decision to flag:** with one search model, typed text runs on the server as `Issue.subject CONTAINS …` and reloads the lanes. The instant browser-side filtering is removed. If you'd rather keep it, I'd keep it as a separate small quick-filter and not mix it into ezSearch.\n- On narrow screens the bar wraps onto its own full-width row under the tabs.\n- The search state (`activeSearch`, `filterQuery`, `toggleSearch`) moves out of the `TaskBoard` component into the board controller and the saved-search service, as on the other lists.\n\n**Save Search on both pages:** I included it. "Save current search…" and Update appear because both pages pass `@onSave`/`@onUpdateSavedSearch`; the searches are shared with the Issue list. Say if you'd rather keep these pages apply-only, as they are today.\n\n**Screens**\n- **gantt-compact:** the Gantt with the multi-row search in the task list and a saved search applied.\n- **board-linear:** the board with the linear bar in the tabs row and a saved search applied.\n- **board-linear-mobile:** the board at 390px, with the bar on its own row.	message	["Listing .runs/*/prometheus/app/components/ez-search-compact/index.hbs in .", "Listing {.runs/*/prometheus,prometheus}/app/components/ez-search*/**/*.hbs in .", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/components/app-ui/task-board.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/templates/app/project/gantt.hbs", "Reading .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/components/app-ui/task-board.hbs", "Listing .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/**/*gantt*.hbs in .", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/components/app-ui/task-board.js", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/components/app-ui/task-board/milestones.js", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/templates/app/project/board.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/modifiers/initialize-sortable.js", "Reading .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/components/app-ui/task-board.js", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/components/app-ui/gantt-chart.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/components/app-ui/task-board", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/templates/app/project/gantt.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/controllers/app/project/board.js", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app", "Reading .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/components/app-ui/gantt-chart.hbs", "Reading .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/templates/app/project/gantt.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4323/prometheus/app/styles/modules/gantt.scss", "Updating the knowledge map"]	f281d8936aef-218c-aab1-369e2150ba48	3.693223	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-07 19:50:11	f	[{"uploadId": "cfc4d4e26aef-218c-f5ca-7e622796ae26", "key": "gantt-compact", "title": "Gantt Cal: EzSearchCompact (multi-row) at the top of the task list", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "dd0c4b316aef-218c-f5ca-4e6c2c68487a", "key": "board-linear", "title": "Task Board: EzSearchCompact linear in the milestone tabs row", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "eb1706846aef-218c-aab1-dafc43a93be2", "key": "board-linear-mobile", "title": "Task Board on mobile: linear search on its own row under the tabs", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}]
