7147aa726aef-9eab-9161-b618cf22ab6c	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	Here's plan v12 with your three points:\n\n1. **Ideas:** I've added a bug fix for `<EzSearchCompact>` itself. In the multi-row layout, Search and Clear become icon-only buttons attached to the right end of the bar (`fa-search` crimson, `fa-times` grey, each with a tooltip), as in the Gantt screen. Because the fix is in the shared component, the idea list and the Gantt both get it.\n2. **Gantt Cal:** unchanged. It now also depends on the icon fix, so it ships with icons from the start.\n3. **Task Board:** the bar stays inline with the milestone tabs, on the same row. It takes at least 30% of the row and the tabs share the rest. With many tabs, the tab strip scrolls sideways instead of pushing the bar down. My earlier mockup wrapped it by accident; the updated `board-linear` screen shows it inline.\n   - Only on phones (below 768px) does the bar wrap under the tabs, because 30% of 390px is too narrow to type in. Say if you want it inline there too.\n\nThe screen is drawn with today's CSS only, so treat it as a guide to layout and content.	message	["Updating the knowledge map"]	702e94606aef-9eab-9161-151c67395b7c	0.351898	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-07 20:26:25	f	[{"uploadId": "6889abc76aef-9eab-9161-390573001261", "key": "board-linear", "title": "Task Board: linear search inline with the milestone tabs (at least 30% of the row)", "version": 2, "width": 1440, "height": 900}]
