657e02896aef-0d7b-3158-38b4516cb06b	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	4338 has introduced quite a few bugs.\n\n1)As![image.png](upload:196f16d56aef-6528-3158-d77325facd56) 1)  I only asked for the search bard to be inline. The milestone tab selected should still behave in the same way, i.e. any overfill should automatically go to the next row.\n2) The horizontal scroll bar on the Task board has been messed up. I can no longer scroll horizontally.\n3) Most probably, just to get the searchbar in, you modifed the position of the taskboard, bad decision. open quick preview on the issue is overlapping some section of the task board.\n\nIf cannot find fixes then I will have to revert the changes made here.\nAnother thing is that for the Task board, it does not make sense to filter on milestone, as we have a selector for it.\n\nAnother issue and that is everywhere, the search popup when typing is washed out\n![image.png](upload:5ea523706aef-0d7b-3158-b1f080895c65)	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-07 21:25:57	f	[]
