eedbb4f86aef-0d7b-3158-2b132a119c85	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	All five problems have clear fixes, so a revert shouldn't be needed. The first one is my fault: the aprom-4338 description told the agent to make the tab strip "scroll sideways when there are more tabs than fit". You only asked for the search to be inline; the tabs should wrap as before.\n\n**What I found**\n- **Board before 4338** (`styles/modules/board.scss` ~l.13-74, from a checkout taken before 4338 merged):\n  - `.nav-tabs-custom` was `position: relative`;\n  - `.milestone-tabs` was an `inline-block` at 80% width, so its tabs wrapped onto new rows;\n  - `.milestone-filters` was `position: absolute` at the top right, 20% wide;\n  - the lanes scrolled sideways through `.milestone.box-body { display: flex; overflow-x: auto }`.\n- **Board fix:** going back to exactly that layout with a 70/30 split gives you the search inline at 30% and the tabs wrapping as before. The board container's positioning and the lane scrolling stay untouched.\n  - Your bugs 2 (the horizontal scroll) and 3 (the quick preview overlapping the board) almost certainly come from 4338 changing the board container's layout.\n  - I couldn't read 4338's own diff (no checkout here has it), so each fix issue starts by comparing against `dev` before 4338.\n- **Washed-out menu:** `ez-search-bar.scss` ~l.71 gives the active row a light crimson background (`$primaryColorLight`) without setting a text colour, so Bootstrap's white text for active items lands on light pink. The other rows use AdminLTE's grey menu text.\n  - Fix: dark item text (`$darkColor`), field ids in `$mediumColor`. The active row gets a crimson background with white text, matching the hover of the other app dropdowns (`dropdown.scss`).\n- **No Milestone search on the board:** I'd keep this metadata-driven. The board declares its own search metadata, `views.TaskBoard.search = { extends: 'Issue', exclude: ['issuemilestone.name'] }`, and the architecture doc gets a section on `extends` and `exclude`.\n  - Excluded fields aren't suggested and aren't in the builder. Typing one gives "Milestone can't be searched here. Use the milestone tabs."\n  - A shared saved search that filters on milestone shows the same error on the board and isn't applied there.\n\n**Plan:** five issues, one per problem.\n- The three board layout fixes are chained, because they change the same files. If an earlier one already fixes a later bug, the later issue only adds its test and closes.\n- The search fields and the menu fix run in parallel with the chain.	message	["Reading dev-tools/talos/state/ideas/c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e/images/196f16d56aef-6528-3158-d77325facd56.png", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/ideas/c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e/images/5ea523706aef-0d7b-3158-b1f080895c65.png", "Listing .runs/issue-43{36,37,38}/prometheus/app/styles/**/{board,ez-search*}.scss in .", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4337/prometheus/app/styles/modules/board.scss", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4337/prometheus/app/styles/components/ez-search-bar.scss", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4337/prometheus/app/components/app-ui/task-board.hbs", "Reading .runs/issue-4337/prometheus/app/styles/modules/board.scss", "Reading .runs/issue-4337/prometheus/app/styles/components/ez-search-bar.scss", "Updating the knowledge map"]	ec5482566aef-0d7b-3158-0b4bc900ef43	3.421147	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-07 21:28:14	f	\N
