fea520746aef-9996-399b-c92639532170	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	A few more issues.ezSearch Popup\nWhen hovering over the ezSearch Popup  if a field is taking two rows, field label, and then field syntax overflowing into the next row, the highlight color is only visible for the first row and that causes the syntax to not be visible as its font is changed to white. I think we need to highly the whole field rather than just the label.\nSimilar issue with saved popup, the highlight color (primary color) is not displayed. So what happens is that the text is changed to white and highlight is not changed thus we do not see anything.\n\nThe other issue is the modal in the TaskBoard view. When a user clicks on filter button the filter modal is behind the overlay. This is not an issue on the ideas section. but is on the Taskboard.	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-08 00:44:46	f	[]
