5ef416146aef-1a22-399b-e232d3e5684e	c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	I found the cause of all three in the newest code, which is in `.runs/issue-4344/prometheus`. Here's a three-issue plan, one per problem.\n\n1. **Two-line suggestion rows.** In each suggestion row the field id (`.ez-search-item-detail`) floats to the right (`ez-search-bar.scss` ~l.91). When the label and the id don't fit on one line, the id drops below, outside the row. The highlight only covers the row, so the id is white on white.\n   - Fix: lay out label and id inside the row so it grows to two lines and the whole row gets the highlight.\n2. **Saved menus show no highlight.** Both saved-search menus reset their item buttons to `background: transparent`: `ez-search-compact.scss` ~l.62 and `ez-search.scss` ~l.90. That rule wins over the shared dropdown's crimson hover (`dropdown.scss` ~l.44), while the white hover text still applies.\n   - Fix: give the hovered or focused item the crimson background with white text in both menus. Items that aren't hovered stay transparent.\n3. **Task Board filter modal behind the overlay.** The compact builder modal is rendered inline inside the search (`ez-search-compact/index.hbs` ~l.82). On the Task Board that puts it inside the search slot, which aprom-4344 gave its own stacking level. So the modal can't rise above the overlay Bootstrap adds to the page body. On the idea list there's no such wrapper, which is why it works there.\n   - Fix: render the modal at the page body, as the idea screen preview already does (`components/idea/message-screen.hbs:11`, `{{#in-element this.modalRoot insertBefore=null}}`).\n\nThe three issues change different files, so they can run in parallel.	message	["Searching the code in .runs/issue-4337/prometheus", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4337/prometheus/app/components/ez-search-compact", "Listing .runs/*/prometheus/app/components/ez-search-compact/index.hbs in .", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4344/prometheus/app/components/ez-search-compact/index.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4344/prometheus/app/components/ez-search/search-bar.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4344/prometheus/app/styles/components/ez-search-bar.scss", "Reading .runs/issue-4344/prometheus/app/styles/components/ez-search-bar.scss", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4344/prometheus/app/styles/components", "Reading .runs/issue-4344/prometheus/app/components/ez-search-compact/index.hbs", "Reading .runs/issue-4344/prometheus/app/styles/components/ez-search-compact.scss", "Reading .runs/issue-4344/prometheus/app/styles/components/ez-search.scss", "Reading .runs/issue-4344/prometheus/app/components/ez-search-compact/index.hbs", "Updating the knowledge map"]	5e20cb446aef-1a22-399b-5f26e1625466	0.795267	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-08 00:46:23	f	\N
