ca9d07076af0-9a8b-6f54-55301e706fb0	c82823c16af0-9a8b-6f54-9c6fbacd2282	Lets work on the improvement of the idea's list. We have "Quick List" in multiple places in the application, there is some standardization already, but lets create a new quickList component and its parts.\n\n![download.png](data:image/png;base64,)![image.png](data:image/png;base64,)\nHere is a representation or "rougly", i repeat "roughly" of what I would like it to look like.\n\nWe already have quick list in Gantt Cal, Notification, Issue  quick list in the project  detail page.\nThe features the quickList should have are listed here\n\n1) List Item - A list item has two types of information associated with it, primary info e.g. title in case of Idea and status, etc. this is the information that is used to distinguish between the ideas. Then there is secondary information, tags, creator, dates,etc.\n2) Pagination - the list should have pagination support\n3) A List can be linked with ezSearch.\n4) A list can have selection and actions available on those selections\n5) A list can have some grouping e.g. grouped by Created User or Milestone, etc.\n6) A list may have sorting options.\n\nLets first create the screen that is addressing all of these details. Lets create comprehensive sub-component identification and description along with key design system declaration.\n\nTarget milestone "aga-Quick List", its does not exist yet, so you will have to create it.	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-08 11:11:06	f	[]
