ce50cc646af0-5e8e-6f54-0dd1ecccae30	c82823c16af0-9a8b-6f54-9c6fbacd2282	I've drafted three screens for the Quick List. I used the idea browser as the reference because your sketch is based on it. I haven't proposed issues yet: you asked for the screens and component breakdown first.\n\n**What exists today:** there's no shared Quick List component. Each place builds its own list. The idea browser is a `ul.nav.nav-stacked` with a title and a status label. The Gantt task list, the notifications sidebar and the project's latest issues are separate markup. The new idea browser already uses `EzSearchCompact`, so the search part is already reusable.\n\n## Sub-components\n\n| Part | What it does | Arguments |\n|---|---|---|\n| `QuickList` | Root `box box-primary`. Holds the items, selection, group, sort and page state, and tells the caller about changes. It never loads data itself. | `@items`, `@total`, `@page/@limit`, `@groupBy`, `@sort`, `@selectable`, `@activeId`, `@onPage/@onSort/@onGroup/@onSelect` |\n| `QuickList::Header` | Box title with the count (`64`, or `0 of 64` while a search is on), plus a slot for actions such as **New Idea** | `@title`, `@count`, `@total`, `<:actions>` |\n| `QuickList::Search` | Wraps `EzSearchCompact` (saved searches, filter count, icon Search/Clear, chips) | the same arguments as `EzSearchCompact` |\n| `QuickList::Toolbar` | Select-all checkbox on the left; **Group by ▾** and **Sort ▾** dropdowns on the right | `@groupOptions`, `@sortOptions` |\n| `QuickList::SelectionBar` | Takes the toolbar's place once something is selected: partial or full checkbox, "2 selected", the action buttons, ⋮ for more actions, × to clear the selection | `<:actions as |selected|>` |\n| `QuickList::Group` | Grey heading that folds open and closed: caret, name in capitals, badge with the count | `@label`, `@count`, `@collapsed` |\n| `QuickList::Item` | One row: optional checkbox, crimson left bar on the active row, link to the record | `@item`, `@route/@model`, `@checked`, `@active` |\n| `<:primary>` / `<:secondary>` blocks of `::Item` | Primary block: bold title (wraps) and the status label on the right. Secondary block: a grey line cut off with an ellipsis (avatar, creator, "2 minutes ago", counts), then optional tags | yielded blocks, so each module decides what goes in them |\n| `QuickList::Pagination` | `1-20 / 64` with square ‹ › buttons, the same as the list-page row toolbar | `@page`, `@limit`, `@total` |\n| `QuickList::Empty` / `::Loading` / `::Error` | Empty state: grey `fa-info-circle` text with a "Clear the search" link. Loading: three skeleton rows. Error: red text with "Try again" | text keys and actions |\n\n## Design system rules\n- One `box-primary`, square edges, colours only from `variables.scss`.\n- Rows are separated by `#f4f4f4`. The active row has a 3px crimson left bar. Checked rows get the `#f9fafc` background.\n- Group headings are `#f4f4f4` with a `#ddd` bottom border, 12px bold uppercase text and a Bootstrap `badge`.\n- Secondary text is 12px `#999` on one line, cut off with an ellipsis. Tags have a square 1px `#ddd` border.\n- Every toolbar button is a square `btn-default btn-xs`, and the only crimson button is Search. Menus mark the current choice in crimson with a check or sort icon.\n- New classes are scoped under `.quick-list` in `styles/components/quick-list.scss`.\n\nThe PNGs are a guide for layout and content only; the real components and the design system decide the final look.\n\n## Open questions (my recommendation in brackets)\n1. **Grouping with paging.** Gaia can't search or sort ideas by plan status, because it is worked out in the browser. [Group by a field Gaia can sort on, sorting by the group first so groups continue across pages. Group by plan status only works within the loaded page.]\n2. **Group counts.** A total per group needs one extra count request per group. [Show counts for the loaded page only for now.]\n3. **First adopter.** [The idea browser first, then Notifications and Gantt as later issues. The Gantt rows are tied to the timeline rows, so it may only use Item and Group.]\n4. **Selection actions for ideas.** I showed Archive, the only action ideas support today. [Keep it to Archive.]\n\nI couldn't check the milestone list (that tool was blocked). As you said, **aga-Quick List** doesn't exist yet, so the plan will introduce it and it will be created on approval. Once you've reviewed the screens and settled the questions, I'll propose the issues.	message	["Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M; ls -d .runs/*/prometheus 2>/dev/null | head; for d in .runs/*/prometheus; do ls $d", "Listing .runs/*/prometheus/app/components/ez-search-compact/index.hbs in .", "Searching the code in prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Reading prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Reading .runs/issue-4349/prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea.hbs", "Reading .runs/issue-4349/prometheus/app/components/ez-search-compact/index.hbs", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4349/prometheus/app/styles", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai screen render <<'EOF' ```nestor-screen key=\\"quick-list-default\\" ", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/previews/quick-list-default.png", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai screen render <<'EOF' ```nestor-screen key=\\"quick-list-selection", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai screen render <<'ENDSCREEN' ```nestor-screen key=\\"quick-list-sel", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/previews/quick-list-selection-grouped.png", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai screen render <<'ENDSCREEN' ```nestor-screen key=\\"quick-list-sta", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/previews/quick-list-states.png", "Gaia: list milestones aprom", "Updating the knowledge map"]	\N	4.793383	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-08 11:15:26	f	[{"uploadId": "b6f0c7446af0-5e8e-6f54-1ea7bdf7af4f", "key": "quick-list-default", "title": "Quick List: ideas browser, default state", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "c3148c106af0-5e8e-6f54-54b8d103c14f", "key": "quick-list-selection-grouped", "title": "Quick List: grouped by plan status, two ideas selected", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "cd9ee1006af0-5e8e-6f54-2bfcf4a66978", "key": "quick-list-states", "title": "Quick List: group/sort menus, loading, empty and error", "version": 1, "width": 1100, "height": 620}]
