aaf3e1566af0-d214-00cd-3ab6031a051b	c82823c16af0-9a8b-6f54-9c6fbacd2282	Plan v4 follows your decisions.\n\n- **Pagination:** Prometheus asks Gaia for 21 rows, shows 20, and a 21st row means there's a next page. That's the same `1-20 / 20+` the list pages already show. The Gaia total request is gone. A small helper does the trimming, so later QuickList pages do the same thing. The pagination fix also writes this down as an architecture decision in `prometheus/docs/architecture/lists/decisions.md`, next to the existing live-updates decisions.\n- **Search and archived ideas:** a search lists open ideas only unless "show archived" is on, and the order comes from the server only. The "show archived" toggle stays visible during a search.\n- **"Show archived" in the URL:** it becomes a query parameter, so a reload keeps it.\n\nThe menu-hover bug and the five follow-ups are unchanged.\n\nSeveral of these issues touch the idea route and controller. Agamemnon already holds issues that edit the same files until the earlier one is done, so I left them independent rather than chaining them.	message	["Updating the knowledge map"]	aa243df96af0-d214-00cd-6d59c33d79cc	0.379686	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-08 15:00:59	f	\N
