c2be0bd96af0-09ac-bf1d-24fce89188d4	ded9f4396af0-2b69-3bb7-c36bdb48cfdf	I've moved the library into its own **Developer** section, redrawn the screen, and written the plan. It is 9 Prometheus issues in **aga-Component Library**.\n\n## What changed\n- **A separate Developer section.** It gets its own item in the sidebar's Admin group (**Developer**, `fa-code`, `/app/developer/components/<name>`). Settings goes back to how it was before the library. The QuickList demo moves out of Settings → UI, and that page is then deleted.\n- **Navigation:** a **Components** box on the left with a search box and the components grouped by category. Each entry fills the content column.\n- **Docs:** each component has a markdown file in `public/ui-docs/<name>.md`, downloaded only when its entry opens. Each `##` heading in the file becomes a tab: Overview, Arguments, Blocks, Events, Do and Avoid.\n- **No code snippets.** The Usage tab is gone.\n- **Who sees it:** for now the Developer section uses the existing `setting.read` permission. A new permission would need the reviewer to grant it by hand.\n\nThe screen draws the page. It is a guide for layout and content, not the final look: the design system and the real components win. The app's sidebar in the render doesn't show the new **Developer** item yet.\n\n\n\n## The plan\nIt runs in three waves, which fits Agamemnon's 3 in parallel:\n1. **Framework:** three issues that can run side by side:\n   - the Developer section: route, nav item, registry and the Components box with search;\n   - the entry boxes: header, Controls and Event log;\n   - the Documentation box, which downloads the `.md` file and turns its headings into tabs.\n2. **Five entries:** QuickList, ezSearch, Form fields, Modal and Dropdown. Each depends on all three framework issues.\n3. **Cleanup:** remove Settings → UI, once the QuickList entry has moved over.\n\n**Left out:** copy-ready snippets, the lazy-loaded engine (option B), excluding the library from production builds, a dedicated developer permission, and entries beyond the first five.\n\n**aga-Component Library** is a new milestone; it will be created when you approve the plan.	message	["Searching the code in .runs/issue-4367/prometheus/app", "Reading .runs/issue-4367/prometheus/app/router.js", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai screen render <<\\"EOF\\" ```nestor-screen key=\\"library-entry\\" title", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/previews/library-entry.png", "Searching for \\"render-markdown\\" in .runs/issue-4367/prometheus/app", "Reading .runs/issue-4367/prometheus/app/utils/metadata/metadata.js", "Updating the knowledge map"]	c1b3a2766af0-09ac-bf1d-c03051b9e30d	0.607639	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-08 16:01:06	f	[{"uploadId": "bd1301f96af0-09ac-bf1d-ac4eb5cfc091", "key": "library-entry", "title": "Developer section: Component Library, QuickList entry", "version": 2, "width": 1440, "height": 1100}]
