c42e1be66af0-6d25-f538-62f976383670	c31674596af0-6d25-f538-e6760785c02e	Let's see what we have right now for inter application communication. We need a secure way to allow applications to be able to communicate with each other. Lets explore how we will do that.\n\nWhat I would need is Talos able to get secure information from gaia, hermes getting it from gaia, prometheus able to communicate securely with hermes.	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-08 18:47:32	f	[]
