a54aac176af0-7d1c-cccd-15c909c7bdad	c31674596af0-6d25-f538-e6760785c02e	Created 22 issue(s) from plan v2: ah-4383 (h-hardening, external request to A Hermes), agaia-4384 (g-service-clients), agaia-4385 (g-token-scopes), agaia-4386 (g-service-access), agaia-4387 (g-enrollment), agaia-4388 (g-enrollment-tokens), agaia-4389 (g-secret-rotation), agaia-4390 (g-delegation), agaia-4391 (g-runtime-reads), agaia-4392 (g-introspection), agaia-4393 (g-access-changed), agaia-4394 (g-runtimes-room), ah-4395 (h-service-identity, external request to A Hermes), ah-4396 (h-socket-auth, external request to A Hermes), ah-4397 (h-access-changed, external request to A Hermes), ah-4398 (h-runtimes-room, external request to A Hermes), adt-4399 (d-enroll, external request to A Dev Tool), adt-4400 (d-discover, external request to A Dev Tool), adt-4401 (d-runtimes-room, external request to A Dev Tool), aprom-4402 (p-services, external request to A Prometheus), aprom-4403 (p-enrollments, external request to A Prometheus), aprom-4404 (p-delegation-scopes, external request to A Prometheus).	system	\N	\N	\N	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-08 20:42:13	f	\N
