37655ae06af1-88d1-a5cc-0caa45975f40	c82823c16af0-9a8b-6f54-9c6fbacd2282	I think I know why paging, sorting and grouping reload the whole page, though I couldn't see the merged code: no local checkout has aprom-4356 or 4359.\n\n**Likely cause.** The idea list is loaded in the model of the layout route `app.project.idea` (`routes/app/project/idea.js`), and `query` is a query param with `refreshModel: true`. aprom-4356 and 4359 most likely added `page`, `sort`, `order` and `group` the same way. A refresh re-runs that route's `model()`, and there's no `idea-loading.hbs`, so the parent loading screen replaces the whole content area and the open idea page draws again. The agent should confirm this before changing anything.\n\n**Fix: the list reloads in place and the route stays put.**\n1. **A list loader you can reuse.** A small `ListLoader` class in `utils/quick-list/`. It runs the store query, asks for one extra row (using aprom-4360's helper), drops answers that arrive after a newer request, and exposes the items, whether there is a next page, whether it is loading, and any error. The idea browser uses it first, and future QuickList pages can use it too.\n2. **The idea browser uses it.**\n   - List params stop refreshing the route: page, sort, order, group, query and archived all get `refreshModel: false`.\n   - Changing one reloads the list only. QuickList shows skeleton rows in its body while the header, search and toolbar stay where they are.\n   - The open idea page doesn't redraw.\n   - Back and forward still reload the list, because the URL keeps the params.\n   - Grouping by plan status doesn't fetch at all, since it only regroups the loaded page.\n   - Live (Hermes) updates go through the same loader.\n   - The rule goes into the lists ADR next to the one-extra-row rule.\n\n**Order.** Issue 2 edits the same idea route and controller as aprom-4360, 4361, 4362 and 4365, so it waits for them. Issue 1 needs only aprom-4360's helper. aprom-4368 also changes that controller; Agamemnon holds same-file work, so I didn't chain it.	message	["Listing **/prometheus/app/routes/app/project/idea.js in .", "Listing .runs/issue-43[5-6]*/prometheus/app/routes/app/project/idea.js in .", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/routes/app/project/idea.js", "Listing prometheus/app/templates/app/project/idea*loading*.hbs in .", "Reading prometheus/app/routes/app/project/idea.js", "Updating the knowledge map"]	364ed5106af1-88d1-a5cc-ae5ca09a3373	4.438237	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-09 17:00:39	f	\N
