178973d06af2-ac8b-7557-3d54404482c5	c82823c16af0-9a8b-6f54-9c6fbacd2282	Here's how the role detail could follow the design system's detail-page pattern, inside the `col-md-9` that QuickList leaves (screen below). I worked from the local `templates/app/role/page.hbs`, which may be slightly older than `dev`.\n\n**What breaks the guidelines today**\n\n| Today | Guideline it breaks |\n|---|---|\n| Name and description are bare form fields outside any box | Content lives in boxes (rule 2) |\n| A floating × close toolbar | Not a pattern. With the first role opened automatically, it would just reopen the first role. |\n| **Delete role** sits in the Permissions box, next to Save | Record actions belong in the record box's header tools |\n| Members is a full-width box | Detail pattern: people boxes go in the side column |\n| The Fields tab uses a raw `<select>` (`Role::Permissions`) | Forms use `FormFields::*` only |\n| Save is inside the box body | It belongs in a `box-footer` |\n\n**Proposed layout**\n- **Record box** (`col-md-8`, `box-primary`, titled "Role"):\n  - Delete as a `btn-box-tool` trash icon in the header (ACL `role.delete`).\n  - An avatar block: the initials square in the role's access-tier colour, the name in bold, and "Modified … by …" as a grey caption.\n  - The name and description stay inline-editable (the pencil icons).\n  - The facts as `<h4>` headings: Access (granted and denied labels), Members, Actions granted (46 of 80).\n- **Side column** (`col-md-4`):\n  - **Members** (`box-warning`): the existing `users-list` grid with the dotted add button and "View all members" in the footer. The existing add and view-all dialogs stay.\n  - **Summary** (`box-info`): created, created by, modified.\n- **Permissions** (`box-info`): full width under both columns, because the four selects per module need the room. The Actions/Fields tabs and the scope sections stay as they are, Save moves to the `box-footer`, and the Fields selects become `FormFields::FieldRelate`.\n\n**Questions** (my recommendation in brackets):\n1. Permissions full width under both columns, or inside the main column? [Full width. In the main column the four selects get cramped next to the side column.]\n2. The Summary box only repeats what's in the caption today. Keep it? [Keep it. It's where per-scope counts could go later, e.g. "Project modules 18/32".]\n3. Is the "Actions granted 46 of 80" fact useful, or is the % enough? [Keep it: it explains the %.]\n\nOnce the layout is agreed, I'll propose the issues: the page layout, the Fields select fix, and moving Delete. Each is one issue, and they can run side by side.	message	["Searching the code in prometheus/app/templates/app/role/page.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/role/page.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/role/page.hbs", "Listing prometheus/app/components/role/permissions*.hbs in .", "Reading prometheus/app/components/role/permissions.hbs", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai screen render <<'ENDSCREEN' ```nestor-screen key=\\"role-detail\\" t", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai screen render <<'ENDSCREEN' ```nestor-screen key=\\"role-detail\\" t", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/previews/role-detail.png", "Updating the knowledge map"]	\N	5.668972	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-09 20:37:43	f	[{"uploadId": "16db52856af2-ac8b-7557-9013eee2d17a", "key": "role-detail", "title": "Role detail: record box, members and summary, permissions full width", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 1100}]
