e11341e46af3-89a1-8333-b6f31e6c1620	341481c56af2-8040-cd6a-5ea33d81936b	Plan v7 has two issues: the `section.content` fix, plus an update to `prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md` so agents stop making the mistakes we hit on Threads.\n\nThe design doc is missing three things:\n- Section 2 lists the content header and `section.content` as parts of the app shell, but never says a page must not render them itself. That gap is how Threads ended up with a second header and a nested content section.\n- Section 3 has no pattern for the list + detail (QuickList) layout, even though Roles, Ideas and now Threads all use it.\n- Nothing in it covers the other problems from this review: where the New button and pagination go, the extra type label above titles, issue statuses shown without translation, and the reply box editor.\n\n**What the doc issue adds:**\n- **Section 2, app shell:** pages under `app.project` start directly with their `.row`. They never render their own content header, title row, breadcrumb or `section.content`, because `templates/app/project.hbs` already provides them. Project pages get no page title, matching Task Board and Gantt.\n- **Section 3, a new "List + detail page (QuickList)" pattern:**\n  - Layout: QuickList in col-md-3, outlet in col-md-9; the detail is a col-md-8 record box plus a col-md-4 info column. The first row opens by default.\n  - QuickList header: the title plus the create button (`<:actions>`, `btn-primary btn-sm`).\n  - Then the search (`EzSearchCompact`), then the group/sort toolbar, which wraps when narrow.\n  - Pagination (range "1-20 / 20+" plus ‹ ›) goes in the box footer, never the header.\n  - It points to Roles, Ideas and Threads as examples.\n- **Section 8, labels:**\n  - No uppercase type label above a box title.\n  - Issue statuses always use the `status-label` and `status-style` helpers.\n  - Information shown in a side box isn't repeated in the record header.\n- **Section 9, building blocks:**\n  - A reply box is `ConversationUi::CommentComposer` with the toast-ui toolbar.\n  - Record boxes use the plain `box` classes, with no extra shadow or border.\n- **Section 12, checklist:** new checks for each of these.\n\nThe doc issue only touches documentation, so it can start right away, in parallel with the fix.	message	["Searching the code in prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Reading prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Reading prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Updating the knowledge map"]	e0360f006af3-89a1-8333-a4ceed1234ac	0.412585	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-10 17:14:09	f	\N
