5b16c5836af4-0fdf-00ad-9a4141e702d4	5a1482d46af4-0fdf-00ad-c45029d7a40d	### Goal\n\nAdd a Docs module to projects so teams can create, list and open documents inside a project.\n\n### Scope\n\n* Gaia: new `doc` entity (title, body, projectId, ownerId, tags, locked, dateCreated/Modified, createdUser/modifiedUser).\n* Prometheus: `doc` model, adapter and serializer using the existing application adapter.\n* Routes: `app.project.doc.index` (All Docs), `app.project.doc.create`, `app.project.doc.page`. Add each to `routeMaps` in `services/acl.js` (`doc.read`, `doc.create`, `doc.update`, `doc.delete`).\n* Sidebar: "Docs" item with "All Docs" and "Create Doc" children.\n* All Docs = list page pattern: one full-width `box-primary`, search toolbar, table (title, owner, last edited, tags), pagination; extend `controllers/prometheus/list.js`.\n* Create Doc = create/edit pattern using `FormFields::*`; Save/Cancel below the boxes.\n* Decide and document what happens to the existing Wiki (migrate into Docs, or keep both).\n\n### Out of scope\n\nReal-time editing, comments, AI (later Ideas).\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n* A project member with `doc.create` can create a doc and sees it in All Docs.\n* Users without `doc.read` can't open the routes.\n* `-loading.hbs` skeletons and empty states match design-system §4.\n* Mirage handlers + acceptance `.feature` tests for all three routes; strings in `translations/en-us.json`.\n\n### Planning notes\n\n* Milestone: **Docs MVP**.\n* Each issue includes its own Mirage handler, tests and translations.\n* Planned in other Docs Ideas (don't plan here): the editor (2/10), real-time sync (3/10), presence (4/10), comments (5/10), sharing dialog (8/10).\n\n### Depends on\n\nNothing.	message	[]	\N	\N	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	2026-11-11 09:46:03	f	[]
