95a630c36af4-c2ce-00ad-759ae40b421d	5a1482d46af4-0fdf-00ad-c45029d7a40d	Docs 1/10 adds a project-scoped `doc` resource in Gaia and three Prometheus screens on top of it: All Docs, Create Doc and the doc page. The scope you gave is clear enough to plan, so the plan is below. A few decisions in it are mine; change any of them before you approve.\n\n**What I found**\n- **Nothing to duplicate.** The kb has no Docs issues yet. Wiki is the closest thing: a Gaia `Wiki` model and Prometheus routes `app.project.wiki.*`, built in the old `.extend()` style with a Toast UI editor.\n- **Wiki isn't in the sidebar.** `utils/metadata/metadata.js` has no Wiki item. You can only reach it by URL.\n- **The pieces to copy already exist:**\n  - Gaia's new-resource guide (`docs/generated/bundles/B.md`, built on gaia#193).\n  - `controllers/prometheus/list.js` and the list pages that use it (`agent/index`, `workflow/index`).\n  - `FormFields::FieldRelateMulti` for picking tags.\n  - The sidebar item format with `aclContext` in `metadata.js`.\n\n**Decisions I made (say if you disagree)**\n1. **Wiki: keep both for now.** No new Wiki work in this idea, and its routes stay. Migrating Wiki into Docs is its own later idea, after the editor (2/10) settles the body format; Wiki is retired after that. The Gaia issue records this as a decision doc (`docs/architecture/docs/decisions.md`).\n2. **Tags** use the existing Tag/Tagged tables (`relatedTo: 'doc'`), the same as Wiki and Issue, not a text column.\n3. **Body:** Create Doc asks only for title and tags. The doc page shows the body as escaped plain text, or an empty state when there is none. Editing the body is left to the editor idea (2/10), so this foundation doesn't commit to a body format.\n4. **`ownerId`:** Prometheus sets it to the current user when a doc is created. **`locked`** is stored (default false) and shown as a lock icon only. Changing the owner and enforcing the lock belong to sharing (8/10).\n5. **ACL:** `doc.read` covers the index and page routes and `doc.create` covers create. `doc.delete` controls the list's row delete. `doc.update` gets a route mapping once an edit route exists (2/10).\n\n**Order:** Gaia resource → Prometheus data layer → doc page → All Docs and Create Doc side by side. The page comes before the other two because list rows link to it and Save opens it.\n\n**Milestone:** I've set **Docs MVP** as you asked. It doesn't exist yet in A Gaia or A Prometheus, so it will be created when you approve.\n\n**Left out:** editing a doc's body or title, lock enforcement, changing the owner, migrating Wiki, and live events.	message	["Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Searching issues: docs document wiki 2>&1 | head -60", "Searching issues: docs module doc entity 2>&1 | grep '^#' | head; dev-tools/ai/ai kb search \\"Docs MVP\\" 2>&1 | grep '^#' | head; wc -l gaia/C", "Running cat gaia/CLAUDE.md prometheus/CLAUDE.md; dev-tools/ai/ai kb show 4049 2>&1 | head -60; dev-tools/ai/ai kb show 4056 2>&1", "Running ls gaia/docs/generated/bundles/; cd prometheus && grep -n \\"wiki\\" app/router.js app/services/acl.js | head -30; grep -rln", "Listing gaia/docs/generated/bundles/*", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/router.js", "Searching for \\"wiki\\" in prometheus/app", "Reading gaia/docs/generated/bundles/README.md", "Reading prometheus/app/router.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/app-ui", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Reading gaia/docs/generated/bundles/B.md", "Reading gaia/docs/generated/models/Tagged.md", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/app-ui/nav-bar.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/utils/metadata/metadata.js", "Reading prometheus/app/utils/metadata/metadata.js", "Listing prometheus/{translations/*.json,app/locales/en-us/*,app/controllers/prometheus/list.js,app/controllers/app/agent/index.js,app/routes/app/agent/index.js,app/templates/app/agent/*.hbs,mirage/config.js,mirage/factories/*,tests/acceptance/agent*}", "Searc