258873746af4-cf06-254b-159118ae482e	1c3ec0016af4-cf06-254b-8bb45203956e	Given the design below for a collaborative documentation tool inside Projects4me, let's create a plan for how we can implement it. What sort of architectural backend decision would make for the storage of data and handling real-time sync and every aspect that the design shows, e.g.\n\n  **Managing the doc**\n\n<br>\n* Create a doc from blank or a template.\n* Rename it, and nest it under another doc like wiki pages.\n* Move it to another project or parent doc.\n* Duplicate it.\n* Archive or delete it, and restore it from the archive.\n* Star or follow it to get notifications.\n* Lock and unlock it, which makes it read-only. Only the owner or an admin can do this, like the wiki lock today.\n* Add tags and attach files.\n\n**Sharing and access**\n\n* The Share dialog: add people, guests or agents as viewer, commenter or editor.\n* Link sharing: project members only, anyone with the link, or off.\n* Change or remove someone’s access, and transfer ownership.\n* Stop viewers and commenters from downloading or copying.\n\n**Writing and editing**\n\n* Formatting, tables, images, checklists, and the outline.\n* Switching between Editing, Suggesting and Viewing.\n* Autosave and offline recovery.\n\n**Real-time collaboration**\n\n* Seeing who’s in the doc, live cursors, selections, and “is typing”.\n\n**Review**\n\n* Comments, replies, @mentions, resolving threads.\n* Suggestions with accept and reject.\n* Notifications for mentions and replies.\n\n**Project connection**\n\n* Linking issues with their live status, linking the doc to a milestone, and turning text into issues.\n* Showing linked docs on the issue and project pages.\n\n**AI**\n\n* Drafting, summarizing, finding open questions, improving wording, and creating issues.\n* @mentioning an agent in a comment.\n* Agent changes always arrive as suggestions, and each agent action records the person it acted for.\n\n**History**\n\n* Saved versions, named versions, comparing changes, and restoring.\n\n**Getting content out**\n\n* Export to PDF or Word, print, and copy a link to a section.\n\n**Finding docs**\n\n* Search inside docs and across all docs, plus the All Docs list with filters.\n\n![Doc editor — outline · document · details.png](data:image/png;base64,)	message	[]	\N	\N	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	2026-11-11 13:48:21	f	[]
