7bce58c16af5-7848-ca5a-922bd051653a	361eb9326af4-3b69-e9a2-8e04f96d31a4	These four screens show both options on one doc, "Docs: storage design" in A Gaia, with the same paragraph each time. They're mockups; the next section lists what they don't show exactly.\n\n**Option 1: quick help (Ares, applied by your own editor)**\n1. **assist-preview:** Rana Nouman selects a paragraph and picks **Improve wording** in the AI Assist box. The result is only a **preview** and nothing changes in the doc until they click **Insert as suggestion**. The same box holds the other actions: Summarize, Open questions, Draft, Create issues.\n2. **assist-review:** the change is in the doc as a tracked suggestion: crossed-out old text, underlined new text. The Suggestions box shows it from **AI Assist, with the Agent badge, "for Rana Nouman"**, using the same Agent badge and "for {name}" tag that comments use today. Accept or Reject is an ordinary edit, so it also syncs to anyone else in the doc.\n\n**Option 2: the agent joins the doc (Talos + collab server)**\n3. **agent-writing:** Rana Nouman mentions **@Agent Odysseus** in a comment. Talos starts the agent, which replies in the thread and then shows up like a person:\n   - in the avatar list, with "Agent Odysseus is writing…";\n   - with a cursor label in the text, while its new section streams in as an underlined suggestion;\n   - with a **Stop** button.\n\n   Rana Nouman keeps typing elsewhere at the same time, and Hamza's cursor is visible too.\n4. **agent-done:** the agent posts a summary reply. The Suggestions box groups its changes **by request**, with **Accept all / Reject all** and a link back to the comment that asked for it. Each change can still be accepted or rejected on its own. Questions it couldn't settle come back as comments, not as edits.\n\n**What the mockups don't show exactly**\n- Suggestion colours, the agent's cursor colour and the avatars are placeholders (plain underline and strikethrough, the default highlight, icons for avatars). The real ones need a small set of new styles in `doc.scss` that only use existing colours. That's part of the editor and suggestions work.\n- "AI Assist" is a placeholder name for the agent that Option 1 credits. Should that be its own Agent account, or one of the existing agents?\n- The editor toolbar is drawn with standard buttons. The real one comes from `doc-editor`.\n\nMy questions from the last two turns are still open: Talos as the runner for agents, `gaia-mcp` for the doc tools, block ids now, and `Doccontent` instead of `Doc.body`. Once you answer, I'll send the revised plan.	message	["Running cd /home/rana.noman/web/hammad-hassan/Pr4M/prometheus && wc -l docs/ui/design-system.md; ls docs/ui/screens/; grep -n \\"^", "Reading prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Reading prometheus/docs/ui/screens/issue-detail.png", "Running head -30 app/templates/app/project.hbs; grep -rn \\"class=\\\\\\"breadcrumb\\" app/components app/templates | head -3", "Reading prometheus/app/components/bread-crumb.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/conversation-ui", "Reading prometheus/app/components/conversation-ui/comment-frame.hbs", "Running cat app/components/agent/user-tag.hbs; grep -n \\"user-tag\\\\|agent-tag\\" -A6 app/styles/modules/*.scss | head -30", "Running cat app/components/agent/badge.hbs; grep -n \\"forSponsor\\\\|\\\\\\"badge\\\\\\"\\" translations/en-us.json | head", "Gaia: list agents", "Updating the knowledge map"]	\N	0.612187	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-12 07:40:43	f	[{"uploadId": "52d70ae36af5-7848-ca5a-1da2c023535d", "key": "assist-preview", "title": "Option 1: AI Assist preview on a selection", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "5e1659826af5-7848-ca5a-534e4e632dba", "key": "assist-review", "title": "Option 1: the AI change arrives as a suggestion", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "68f0e5576af5-7848-ca5a-29786f7ee209", "key": "agent-writing", 