dc7cbcb36af5-dbba-d19d-cb5c061e18c2	8870b9e26af5-dbba-d19d-df4cdc28a203	I found the cause. It's a one-line data mix-up between the API and the store, and the fix belongs in Gaia.\n\n## What's happening\n- In the database, `uploads.fileThumbnail` is just a 0/1 flag. When the issue loads, Gaia's `FilethumbComponent::afterRead` replaces it with a base64 `data:` image, but only for uploads in `included`. That's why the thumbnail shows at first.\n- When you open an attachment, `Issue::FilePreview.load` calls `store.query('upload', { id, download: true })` to get a preview token. That goes to `UploadController::getAction`, which doesn't use `Filethumb`, so `fileThumbnail` comes back as the raw `"1"`.\n- Ember Data merges that response into the same `upload` record. The data URI is overwritten with `"1"`, and the template renders `<img src="1">`, which shows as a broken image. The preview still works because it uses the token, not the thumbnail.\n\n## Fix\nI recommend fixing it in Gaia: `GET /upload` and `GET /upload/:id` should return the same `fileThumbnail` as the issue read does. Patching it in Prometheus, by saving the thumbnail before the query and putting it back after, would only hide an API that returns two different values for one field.\n\nThis is A Prometheus's bug but A Gaia's code, so the issue is written as a request to the Gaia team. Prometheus needs no change.\n\nLeft out: replacing the 0/1-or-data-URI field with a proper thumbnail URL. That's the cleaner design but a contract change, so it isn't needed for this bug.	message	["Running cd /home/rana.noman/web/hammad-hassan/Pr4M; grep -n -i -A3 \\"attach\\\\|upload\\\\|thumbnail\\" dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.", "Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/issue", "Reading prometheus/app/components/issue/issue-details.js", "Reading prometheus/app/components/issue/issue-details.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/models/upload.js", "Reading prometheus/app/components/issue/file-preview.hbs", "Listing prometheus/app/components/issue/file-preview.js", "Reading prometheus/app/components/issue/issue-details.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/issue/file-preview.js", "Searching the code in gaia/app", "Reading gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/UploadController.php", "Reading gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/components/FilethumbComponent.php", "Reading gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/UploadController.php", "Searching the code in gaia", "Searching the code in gaia/app/api/v1/controllers/UploadController.php", "Updating the knowledge map"]	dbc8e9356af5-dbba-d19d-a8f35dec595b	0.558589	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-12 14:40:28	f	\N
