50ded3b36af7-395e-cc28-d0ef719a276f	361eb9326af4-3b69-e9a2-8e04f96d31a4	I've set the milestone to **aga-Docs** on all 17 issues; nothing else in the plan changed.\n\n- **I couldn't check whether aga-Docs already exists.** I don't have access to the milestone lists. Where a project (A Gaia, A Hermes, A Prometheus, A Ares) doesn't have it yet, it's created when you approve. The plan card shows those as new. Please check the spelling on the card, so it doesn't create a near-duplicate of an existing milestone.\n- **Earlier Docs issues are in "Docs MVP".** `agaia-4488` and the deferred `aprom-4489` to `aprom-4492` are there. If you want all Docs work in aga-Docs, move them yourself; I can't change issues.	message	["Gaia: list milestones A Gaia", "Searching issues: \\"aga-Docs\\" 2>&1 | head -10", "Updating the knowledge map"]	4d1904176af7-395e-cc28-e583a8fd8a2d	0.699277	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-13 14:01:52	f	\N
