66d75ad76afa-cf15-52a3-eb75e37a454e	ded9f4396af0-2b69-3bb7-c36bdb48cfdf	The initial components are in place. They need to be improved and then finalized. The scope is just the core components, not improve the utilization or change the utilization, so if any page is not using the component correctly then so be it.\n\nThe components that need addressing are\n\n1) Avatar -- We need standard utilization sizes e.g. xs, s, m, l. Default image, Human vs Agent.\n2) Tags - We need to standardize the tags, margin, padding, colors, font, border, etc. I like the tags we are using in the Task Board.\n3) Dropdown - the demo is broken, the popup is not appearing where it should be, the primary color usage is messed up.\n4) Data Table - Select icon size and selection color is not in alignment with QuickList, the action icons styling, color and size do not make sense. Multi page select is not available in the component\n5) ListToolbar - The list toolbar is not using ezSearch properly. if the component is being utilized in a small space it should be space conscious, input box should take priority over other, buttons for Builder, Search, Clear and Saved Search should be icon only if we are short of space. The multiselect action should be tied to the list.	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-15 22:55:34	f	[]
