20b9f7516afa-b491-52a3-7b5f1d717600	ded9f4396af0-2b69-3bb7-c36bdb48cfdf	I've read all five components and their demos. Most of the problems are in the components themselves, not just the demos. Here is what I found, two screens, and a 7-issue plan. It changes only the components and their library entries; pages that use them stay as they are.\n\n## What's wrong today\n- **Avatar** (`app-ui/avatar` → `Agent::UserAvatar` → `Agent::Avatar`):\n  - Only AdminLTE `sm` and `xs` exist. With no size, the image shows at whatever size the file is.\n  - An agent's own picture never shows, because `Agent::Avatar` isn't given the user. The size isn't passed on to the agent either.\n  - A missing image shows as broken; nothing falls back to `/img/default.png`.\n- **Tag** is a bare `label label-<variant>`. It has no styles of its own and no contract file (`.json`). The Task Board look you like is `.badge.issue-type-tag`: a 1px border and text in the colour, a 16% tint of it behind, semibold.\n- **Dropdown:**\n  - The menu is always anchored with `right: 0`. Near the left edge it opens off-screen, which is why the popup is in the wrong place.\n  - Hover fills crimson with white text, the demo marks the active item in plum, and the menu sits at `z-index: 99999`.\n- **DataTable:**\n  - Its checkboxes are native 13px boxes. QuickList uses `fa-square-o` / `fa-check-square` icons in crimson.\n  - Row actions are `btn-default btn-xs` buttons, and the "more" menu is a separate hand-made one.\n  - Selection only works on the current page.\n- **ListToolbar:**\n  - The selection area is an empty slot. The demo builds its own select-all, bulk buttons and "(Selected: N)", none of it connected to the table.\n  - EzSearch only drops its button labels on phone-size screens (`hidden-xs`). It doesn't notice when it's squeezed into a narrow box.\n\n## Proposed standards\n- **Avatar sizes:** xs 20px, s 30px, **m 40px (default)**, l 96px.\n  - The old `sm` and `xs` keep working as aliases.\n  - **People:** their image, falling back to `/img/default.png`.\n  - **Agents:** their picture with a small round robot marker (from size s up); with no picture, the robot on plum.\n- **Tag:** the Task Board look in the six standard variants. `@colorKey` picks the colour from the text, like the board's issue types, but **only from the design system colours**; the board's ColorHash produces colours outside the palette. Optional `@onRemove`, and long text is cut with a tooltip.\n- **Dropdown:** `@align` with three values: `auto` (the default) flips the menu when there isn't room, plus `start` and `end`. The menu gets the Bootstrap look: white, a 1px `#ddd` border, a grey `#f4f4f4` hover with dark text. The selected item shows a check in crimson text with no fill. Crimson is used only where `@isPrimary` asks for it.\n- **Multi-page selection:**\n  - A shared selection object holds the ids across page changes. The table and the toolbar share it.\n  - The selection bar shows "12 selected · 2 on this page, 10 on other pages", the bulk actions and a Clear button.\n  - The header checkbox selects or clears the current page.\n- **Narrow ListToolbar:** the search input keeps its width. Saved Searches, Builder, Search and Clear turn into icon-only buttons (with titles) when the toolbar itself is narrow, not only on small screens. The actions block is told when it's narrow so it can do the same.\n\nThe two screens are guides for layout and content, not the final look; the design system and the real components win.\n\n\n\n\n\n## Decisions I made in the plan (say if you want any changed)\n1. **"Select all matching the search" is left out.** We never ask Gaia for totals, so the app can't know how many rows match. Selection carries across pages, and the header checkbox works on the current page.\n2. **Tag colours from text stay inside the design system palette.** The Task Board keeps its own ColorHash colours, since changing it would be changing a user of the component.\n3. **Avatar default size m (40px).** Places that pass no size will change size. That follows your "so be it" rule.\n\n## Order of the issues\n- **No two issues that run at the same time touch the same file.**\n- **Avatar → Tag** are chained only because both add a line to `app.scss`.\n- **Selection model → DataTable look**, because both change `data-table.*`. The DataTable look issue also waits for the Dropdown fix, because its "more" menu moves onto `AppUi::Dropdown`.\n- **ListToolbar** goes last. It needs the selection model and the narrow-width EzSearch.	message	["Searching the code in dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Listing .runs/*/prometheus/app/utils/developer/component-registry.js in .", "Listing prometheus/app/utils/developer/* in .", "Searching the code in .runs/issue-4558/prometheus/app/utils/developer/component-registry.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/utils/developer/component-registry.js", "Reading prometheus/app/utils/developer/component-registry.js", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M/prometheus/app && ls components/app-ui | grep -iE \\"avatar|tag|dropdown|data-table|l", "Listing app/components/app-ui/{avatar,tag,dropdown,data-table,list-toolbar,pager}*/** in prometheus", "Listing app/components/app-ui/{avatar,tag,dropdown,data-table,list-toolbar,pager}* in prometheus", "Listing app/styles/components/{avatar,tag,dropdown,data-table,list-toolbar}* in prometheus", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Listing app/components/app-ui/*.hbs in prometheus", "Listing app/styles/components/app-ui-*.scss in prometheus", "Listing public/ui-docs/* in prometheus", "Listing prometheus/app/components/app-ui/*.hbs in .", "Listing prometheus/app/styles/components/app-ui-*.scss in .", "Listing prometheus/public/ui-docs/* in .", "Reading prometheus/app/components/app-ui/avatar.hbs", "Listing prometheus/app/components/{app-ui/avatar,app-ui/tag,app-ui/dropdown,app-ui/data-table,app-ui/list-toolbar,app-ui/user-chip,