5b1a09956afa-b491-52a3-7a28642c53e5	5aa975066afa-b491-52a3-8ddda4f295d5	We need to support bulk action API. Right now we try to minimize the number of Database queries per API call. This is good as it allows a single API call to be reliable. However, that means that if we need more information than we cannot make a single big query, we have to get answer using a number of queries. This by itself solves some problem but introduces network latency issues. When we have predictable multi-query like in the case of Task Board, Dashboard, etc. we need to be able to send the API server multi REST API calls in a single bulk query.\n\nThe server should be able to handle the errors gracefully, i.e. if the a single API from the bulk packet fails and only that API returns errors, no other. The scope of this Idea is just the Gaia server. We need to have a good thorough Bulk API support system proper security and error handling.	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-15 23:03:55	f	[]
