5dde83f96afa-c6cf-7528-bf10b2648e70	9fd531f66afa-e792-fe2e-e0480570c2cd	Bulk API can also be used in Dashboard and Gantt Cal. Identify other areas which can benefit from bulk API calls.\n\nBe careful with the Dashboard, unlike Gantt Cal and Task Board, pretty soon we will have more widgets and Dashboard will be customizable so exactly which call will be added to the bulk will need to be a bit dynamic. I am thinking that if each widget is allowed to register its call with the bulk in the start and then later fetch individual widget directly.	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-16 09:43:57	f	[]
