5c7f23a16afa-2876-35fc-06a7f43a0f14	dcdfbac46afa-a4f4-35fc-b54d188e59a0	Yes, there's already an inline editor: **`AppUi::InlineEditable`** (`prometheus/app/components/app-ui/inline-editable.{js,hbs}`). The design system names it as the standard for inline editing, and the role page, user page and idea title already use it. I've planned around it.\n\n**What we have today:** comment editing lives in `conversation-ui/comment-item.{js,hbs}`. The pencil in the comment header opens a `bootstrap-modal` with a ToastUi editor. Issue detail and conversation threads both render comments through this one component, so changing it covers both screens.\n\n**Why it can't drop in as-is.** `InlineEditable` was built for short fields like a name or a description. For a comment, three things don't fit:\n- **Click-to-edit:** clicking anywhere on the text starts editing. On a comment, that would fire every time someone selects text or clicks an image. The pencil button should stay the only way to start editing.\n- **Starting from the pencil:** the pencil sits in the comment header, outside the component, and the component has no way to be started from outside.\n- **Save/Cancel controls:** its small ✓/✕ icons sit to the right of the field. Next to a full-width rich-text editor they get lost.\n\n**Approach:** two Prometheus issues.\n1. **Extend `InlineEditable`** without changing its current behaviour:\n   - a switch to turn off click-to-edit;\n   - the display slot hands out a `startEdit` action, so a button outside the field can start editing;\n   - optional Save/Cancel buttons below the editor.\n2. **Change `comment-item`** to use it. The pencil opens the editor in place and the modal goes away.\n\nI went with these defaults. Say if you want any changed:\n- The **pencil is the only trigger**. Clicking the comment text does nothing.\n- **Save/Cancel buttons go below the editor**, like the comment composer. I can render a screen of this if you want to see it first.\n- **Enter adds a new line** and doesn't save. Esc cancels, unless the mention/emoji menu is open.\n- **Out of scope:**\n  - idea messages, which are a different component;\n  - editing other people's comments (still not allowed);\n  - an "edited" marker on changed comments;\n  - live updates of edits for other viewers.	message	["Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/map.md", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Searching issues: inline edit comment --project aprom 2>&1 | head -40", "Reading prometheus/app/components/app-ui/inline-editable.js", "Reading prometheus/app/components/app-ui/inline-editable.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Reading prometheus/app/components/conversation-ui/comment-item.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/conversation-ui/comment-item.js", "Searching the code in prometheus/app", "Reading prometheus/app/templates/app/role/page.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/docs/ui/design-system.md", "Reading prometheus/app/components/idea/conversation-box.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/styles/components/inline-editable.scss", "Listing prometheus/tests/**/*{inline-editable,comment-item}*", "Searching the code in prometheus/tests", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/components/app-ui/toast-ui.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/tests", "Reading prometheus/tests/acceptance/conversation/edit-comment.feature", "Updating the knowledge map"]	5b9df9526afa-2876-35fc-539c942c2679	0.753663	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-16 10:56:28	f	\N
