5a848c686afa-4645-5654-84ace70448b0	de3303a86afa-5122-b3db-e6498ef24096	All 13 issues are now in **aga-Cleanup**. That milestone already exists in A Prometheus, so approving won't create a new one.\n\nNothing else changed. The plan still assumes my recommendations: a new `ml` 64px size for the members grids, and xs inside menus and select fields with s for the other 24–25px spots. If you'd rather not have the new size, say so and I'll remap the three grids (project overview Members, issue Members box, role page Members).	message	["Updating the knowledge map"]	59a5fa556afa-4645-5654-e98278cee66b	0.353856	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-16 11:22:02	f	\N
