54297ed76afb-dac1-e111-1026ad6743c3	de3303a86afa-5122-b3db-e6498ef24096	The Avatar on the issue quick detail that one sees in the Task Board has an issue. If the window width is small the Description text overlaps the Profile Images of the Assignee.\nThere are two potential solutions.\n1) We fix/add the container on the profile images so that the content does not overlap\n2) Since we have multiple sizes can we do a auto resize for upto 2 sizes if there space is not available e.g if the image was medium large instead of large it would have worked.	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-16 17:37:24	f	[]
