b7d804066afb-66c3-948b-d0234dcda90f	de3303a86afa-5122-b3db-e6498ef24096	Both rows have vertical padding but no horizontal padding:\n- **Sort/group toolbar:** `styles/components/quick-list/_toolbar.scss:10` sets `padding: 0.4rem 0`.\n- **Pagination footer:** `styles/components/quick-list/_pagination.scss:6` sets `padding: 6px 0` on the `AppUi::Pager` at the bottom of the list (`quick-list/index.hbs:88`).\n\nThe QuickList's selection bar and group headings already use 10px on the sides, as does AdminLTE's `.box-header`. Giving these two rows 10px sides too lines everything up.\n\nYou reported two things, so I've made them two small issues. They touch different files, so they can run in parallel. Both go in **aga-Cleanup**. I've only changed the padding and kept the pager where it is. Moving it into a `.box-footer` (which would also add a top border) would be a bigger visual change.	message	["Listing prometheus/app/{components/quick-list/*,styles/**/*quick-list*}", "Reading prometheus/app/components/quick-list/index.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/quick-list/toolbar.hbs", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles/components/quick-list.scss", "Listing prometheus/app/{components/app-ui/pager*,styles/**/*pager*}", "Searching the code in prometheus/app/styles", "Reading prometheus/app/components/app-ui/pager.hbs", "Searching for \\"padding\\" in prometheus/app/styles/components/quick-list", "Updating the knowledge map"]	b736d2196afb-66c3-948b-c8f30116f4c9	0.417717	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-16 20:12:39	f	\N
