1db025146afb-1ee8-c328-61557709a0b7	1cecd6c76afb-1ee8-c328-6f16c99cd135	In the application currently the only thing that we have is parent and child issue. We need a more thorough dependency sections.\n\nRather than an issue just being a child/parent of another issue we need to support the following\n\n1) An issue might block another issue\n2) An issue might be blocked by another issue\n3) An issue might be related to another issue\n4) An issue might split into multiple issue\n5) An issue might be a Parent or Child of another issue\n\nIt is important to hold these values so we need to extend the current implementation. We need to be careful of cyclic complexities of such self-relationship.	message	[]	\N	\N	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-16 21:01:17	f	[]
