F' ```nestor-screen key=\\"nav-mobile\\" title=\\"P", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/previews/nav-mobile.png", "Running cd D:/Claude/Workspace/Projects/Pr4M && dev-tools/ai/ai screen render <<'EOF' ```nestor-screen key=\\"divider-check\\" title", "Updating the knowledge map"]	\N	1.92443	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-17 09:21:46	f	[{"uploadId": "9c5f27176afc-8e2e-d8ff-4da7602b9bde", "key": "nav-desktop", "title": "Desktop: project switcher in the header, grouped navigation", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "a31984436afc-8e2e-d8ff-a6e5b9f3e4a7", "key": "nav-desktop-collapsed", "title": "Desktop: sidebar collapsed, project switcher open", "version": 1, "width": 1440, "height": 900}, {"uploadId": "aa0eda306afc-8e2e-d8ff-4c9147c94756", "key": "nav-mobile", "title": "Phone (390px): header with project + presence; navigation open, closes on tap", "version": 1, "width": 900, "height": 860}]
