b22326b06afc-72fe-b62c-27dcb224aec8	411da3826afc-9a36-ac6f-3a7c323d23c4	Created 16 issue(s) from plan v7: agaia-4653 (system-fields), agaia-4654 (search-migrations), agaia-4655 (search-metadata), agaia-4656 (issue-searchable), ah-4657 (hermes-service-sockets, external request to A Hermes), agaia-4658 (search-events), agaia-4659 (service-search-access), agaia-4660 (cli-scheduler), aa-4661 (ares-embeddings, external request to A Ares), aa-4662 (ares-gaia-client, external request to A Ares), aa-4663 (ares-search-listener, external request to A Ares), adt-4664 (stack-pgvector-ares, external request to A Dev Tool), agaia-4665 (embeddings-client), agaia-4666 (search-lexical), agaia-4667 (search-endpoint), agaia-4668 (search-semantic).	system	\N	\N	\N	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-17 16:24:18	f	\N
