443f38826afd-a500-49c2-c192ce0fe23d	6c7240d86afd-3eec-75db-a5acaf1064a6	Agreed. The boot loader now uses the skeleton standard we already have, with no new component, class or CSS.\n\n## What the start-up now looks like\n\n- **Step 1, before Ember runs (boot-splash).** `index.html` gets static markup copied from what the app already renders. It is the AdminLTE shell (`main-header`, `main-sidebar` with `sidebar-menu`, `content-wrapper`), with the `AppUi::Skeleton::PageLoading` markup (`page-skeleton-header` plus `PageLoadingBody`) in the content area.\n  - It uses only the existing `.skeleton-*` and AdminLTE classes. `prometheus.css` loads in `<head>`, so the shimmer works before the JS does.\n  - It has no text, because translations aren't loaded yet. The header holds just the static logo image (`img/app/logo-256.png`); the preview can't load images, so it shows that slot empty.\n- **Step 2, `app.loading-assets`.** The application route removes the static skeleton when it finishes, after session restore and translations. Loading-assets then shows the same skeleton through the component, `<AppUi::Skeleton::PageLoading @showHeader={{true}} />`, inside the real shell. The two look almost the same, so the handover isn't noticeable.\n- **Step 3, `app.project`.** This is unchanged: `app/project-loading.hbs` with the same `PageLoading` skeleton (the project-loading screen from my last reply).\n\nTrade-offs:\n- Signed-out users see the shell skeleton for a moment before sign-in. Session restore and translations are quick, and this is what a skeleton-based app normally does.\n- The skeleton markup now exists in two places: `index.html` and the component. The issue asks for a comment in each that points to the other.\n- In the preview, the content area starts a little right of the sidebar edge. That's the renderer: AdminLTE's default sidebar width without the app's runtime setup. The issue asks the implementer to compare it with the real shell in the browser.\n\nI couldn't update my knowledge map this turn either (edits are denied), so these findings exist only in this chat.	message	["Reading prometheus/app/components/app-layouts/application-wrapper.hbs", "Reading prometheus/app/components/app-layouts/application-header.hbs", "Searching for \\"class=\\"\\" in prometheus/app/components/app-layouts/application-sidebar.hbs", "Running dev-tools/ai/ai screen render <<'EOF' ```nestor-screen key=\\"boot-splash\\" title=\\"Boot skeleton (index.html, before Ember)", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/previews/boot-splash.png", "Running dev-tools/ai/ai screen render <<'EOF' ```nestor-screen key=\\"boot-splash\\" title=\\"Boot skeleton (index.html, before Ember)", "Reading dev-tools/talos/state/nestor/previews/boot-splash.png"]	4096fa976afd-a500-49c2-c27e71b5ffc6	0.432784	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-18 10:26:12	f	[{"uploadId": "2f4da6a16afd-a500-49c2-a4a8f5ac95ff", "key": "boot-splash", "title": "Boot skeleton (index.html, before Ember)", "version": 2, "width": 1440, "height": 900}]
