5b9ad5556afd-200a-42c4-7d2bbd4263ff	d98352c16af4-9ee0-e9a2-4dddf1b444ee	## Plan v3\n\nAlmost everything in your list was already in plan v2. Two things change in v3:\n- **`migrate-dry-run` is its own issue again, at medium priority.** Removing `phalcon/migrations` stays high and now includes the before/after schema snapshot script, which covers the main risk. The dry run follows it. They edit the same migration files, so the dry run waits for it.\n- **`docker-images/gaia/Dockerfile`:** `env-image` now notes in its README that this file is obsolete. The file itself is in the `docker-images` repo, which isn't a project I can plan in, so it needs deleting or marking there by hand.\n\n**Branching is still open.** Item 8 came through as the unfilled option (`[everything on dev / the upgradephp8512 branch …]`), so you haven't picked one yet. The plan below is on `dev`. If you want `upgradephp8512` instead, say so and I'll add the A Dev Tool issue for a per-issue base branch and point the new-stack issues at it.\n\nAlready in v2 and unchanged:\n- the alias shim, including `autoload.php`;\n- the `\\Throwable` catch-all with a check of the other 15 files;\n- deleting `UnitTestCase.php`;\n- the `/bulk` bug issue;\n- `response-diff` and `deprecation-log`;\n- dropping `phalcon/migrations` and `phalcon/devtools` in favour of `createTable()`;\n- the deprecation fixes;\n- Elasticsearch removal with no dependencies;\n- SMTP from Settings only.\n\nThe issues go in **Claude-v1**.	message	["Updating the knowledge map"]	5a8339b36afd-200a-42c4-6b37dad283b2	0.416697	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-18 10:47:55	f	\N
