9bf174996afd-c3e4-2996-8956b22b1408	d98352c16af4-9ee0-e9a2-4dddf1b444ee	All 14 issues now go in **aga-Upgrade8.5**. A Gaia doesn't have that milestone yet, so it gets created when you approve the plan; the plan card will show it as new. Nothing else changed from v3.\n\nBranching is still on `dev`. Tell me if you want `upgradephp8512` instead and I'll add the dev-tools issue.	message	["Gaia: list milestones agaia", "Gaia: project options agaia", "Updating the knowledge map"]	9b0ffe816afd-c3e4-2996-2b38e00ec6c1	0.468547	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-18 11:01:48	f	\N
7397c9946afd-7a77-8aba-c909e9ed2185	7281afa46afd-7a77-8aba-64fa90d6419b	There is one of the calls made for the ideas that are using rels: none, whereas we aren't providing that option in the backend. Each API call made from the client should have this knowledge about how to handle the API and what sort of nuances there are when querying the API.	message	[]	\N	\N	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	2026-11-18 12:43:31	f	[]
7cd216f26afd-7a77-8aba-3af1f5ecc7e4	7281afa46afd-7a77-8aba-64fa90d6419b	Agent Nestor is working on it.	working	\N	\N	\N	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	Agent Nestor	2026-11-18 12:43:40	f	\N
