ssly take them to a page showing permission denied, this can easily be handled by not show those issue references as links if the other does not have accesso the said project or issue. Also regarding creation of the issue cross-project. If the user was in the project for the front-end the Agent should of course create and issue for the front-end project as per normal, but if they need an API then it while creating an issue for the back-end project it must explicitly mention this is a request by another project and must be evaluated for implementation as a request.\n\nI need you to create the issue for Prometheus project only. I am handling the creation of issues in the other projects.	open	1	Hammad Hassan	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-10-24 06:06:40	2026-10-24 06:06:40	f
