c89b1b196aee-e15e-6d43-8adc416a487e	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	Query Builder	I want to replace jQuery QueryBuilder in Prometheus with a native Ember query builder plus a search bar with\nautocomplete. This idea goes in phases and I'll tell you when to move on. THIS phase covers only the reusable\ncomponent and the logic behind it. No page uses it yet: putting it on the Issue list is the next phase, and the\nother views come after that. Don't plan page integration or removing jQuery QueryBuilder now.\n\n\\#\\# Problems today \\(check them in the code\\)\n\\- The Issue list search input is readonly \\(templates/app/project/issue/index\\.hbs\\)\\. Focusing it opens the jQuery\n  panel, so nobody can type a query.\n\\- Two regex parsers: utils/query/parser\\.js keeps only the first AND/OR in a group; brackets inside a value break\n  both it and gaia core/mvc/models/query/Clause.php.\n\\- Every controller writes its own \\`filters: \\[\\.\\.\\.\\]\\` in the plugin's format \\(datepicker\\, MM/DD dates\\)\\.\n  utils/query/builder.js is a singleton holding one element.\n\\- Task Board\\, Gantt Cal and Calendar can only apply saved searches; Ideas has no search\\.\n\n\\#\\# Design \\(decided\\)\n1\\. One query\\, two editors\\. A query tree \\(Group \\{conjunction AND\\|OR\\, children\\}\\, Condition \\{field\\, operator\\,\n   value}) is the single state. The search bar and the visual builder both edit it and stay in sync live.\n   Gaia's wire format does NOT change: ((Issue.priority : High) AND (Issue.status !: done)). Saved searches,\n   ?query= URLs and the API stay as they are; existing saved searches are parsed into the tree.\n2\\. Search bar: type loosely\\, and on Enter or blur it is formatted to the exact format:\n   - \\`priority:high\\` -> (Issue.priority : High)\n   - \\`prio = hi status != done\\` -> ((Issue.priority : High) AND (Issue.status !: done))\n   - \\`assignee in rana, hammad\\` -> (assignedTo.name CONTAINS 'Rana Nouman','Hammad Hassan')\n   - \\`timezone\\` -> (Issue.subject CONTAINS timezone)\n   - \\`start between 05/01/2026 and 2026-08-31\\` -> (Issue.startDate BETWEEN 2026-05-01 AND 2026-08-31)\n   - \\`(type:bug OR type:story) milestone:v0.1.1\\` -> (((issuetype.name : Bug) OR (issuetype.name : Story)) AND (issuemilestone.name : v0.1.1))\n   Rules:\n   - Fields can be an alias, the label or the full id.\n   - Gaia operators plus = != >= <= \\~ IN are accepted.\n   - AND is implied between conditions; and/or work in any case; quoted values may contain them.\n   - Bare words search the schema's text field.\n   - A unique prefix of an enum or user value becomes the exact stored value.\n   - Dates accept YYYY-MM-DD, MM/DD/YYYY and today.\n   - Errors in plain words under the bar, with a position, e.g. "Choose an operator after Priority",\n     "'zzz' isn't a Status. Pick one of: …". Invalid queries never reach Gaia.\n   - Suggestion menu: fields -> operators valid for the field's type -> values -> AND / OR / ")".\n     Up/Down move, Tab/Enter accept, Enter with the menu closed runs, Esc closes.\n   - When the bar is not being edited it shows the formatted query with fields, operators and keywords\n     coloured. After formatting it shows the exact ids (Issue.priority), not labels.\n3\\. Builder panel: groups with an AND/OR switch\\, nested groups\\, rows of field / operator / value\\. The value input\n   depends on the field type: power-select for enums and users (avatars), multi-select for IN, FieldDate for\n   dates (two for BETWEEN), FieldText otherwise. Incomplete rows stay in the builder but are left out of the query.\n   It opens inline under the bar, closed by default, toggled by a Builder button.\n4\\. Serializer rules\\, so Gaia's Clause\\.php can parse every query:\n   - every group in brackets, one conjunction per group, nested groups with the same conjunction merged;\n   - IN written as CONTAINS 'a','b'; a one-value IN written as \\`:\\`;\n   - values with spaces quoted.\n   - Refuse brackets and apostrophes in values with a clear message: Clause.php concatenates values into SQL.\n     I'll plan the Gaia fix in the Issue list phase.\n   - Unknown Module.field ids in old saved searches still parse, as strings.\n5\\. Layering \\(verify against the code and adjust if it disagrees\\):\n   - app/utils/query/ast.js, operators.js: node types and ONE operator registry (Gaia symbol, label, number of\n     values, valid field types), replacing the maps in parser.js and utils/metadata/querybuilder-operators.js\n     (don't delete those yet).\n   - app/utils/query/lexer.js, parser.js (loose text -> tree, errors with positions), serializer.js\n     (tree -> Gaia string, the rules in 4). parser.js is new; leave the old one where it is until the removal phase.\n   - app/utils/query/schemas/issue.js, project.js + app/services/query-schema.js: fields (id, alias, label key,\n     type), text field, value sources (statuses, milestones, members, issue types), loaded asynchronously.\n   - app/utils/query/completer.js: pure; (text, cursor, schema) -> what comes next + ranked suggestions.\n   - app/utils/query/composer.js: AND a screen's fixed query with the user's query (used by boards later).\n   - app/components/query-builder/ (container holding the tree as tracked state; ::SearchBar; ::Panel;\n     ::Group; ::Condition; ::ValueEditor), app/styles/components/query-builder.scss.\n   - API: \\<QueryBuilder @schema @query @baseQuery @savedSearches @onApply @onSave @aclContext />\n   - Glimmer components; check isDestroying/isDestroyed after every await.\n6\\. Look: prometheus/docs/ui/design\\-system\\.md\\. Square edges\\, existing tokens\\, FormFields::\\* controls\\, strings in\n   translations. Groups are bordered blocks with a crimson (AND) or plum (OR) left edge.\n\n\\#\\# What I want from you now\n1\\. Screens first\\, on the Issue list page as the backdrop \\(only to show the component; integration is the next phase\\):\n   a) the toolbar (Saved Searches, the bar, Builder, Search, Clear) while typing \\`prio\\`, menu open;\n   b) the builder open: an AND group with a status IN row, a date BETWEEN row and a nested OR group;\n   c) an error under the bar.\n2\\. Then a plan\\, A Prometheus only:\n   - query core (tree, operators, lexer, parser, serializer; unit tests including a round trip of the board and\n     Gantt route queries in routes/app/project/board.js and gantt.js and of the saved-search formats);\n   - schemas + service;\n   - completer;\n   - SearchBar;\n   - Panel.\n   SearchBar and Panel can run in parallel. Each issue is verified by unit/integration tests; no page changes.	open	1	Hammad Hassan	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-06 21:08:24	2026-11-06 21:08:24	f
