de3303a86afa-5122-b3db-e6498ef24096	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	Using Component Library	Now that we have started to mature the UI Component Library, its time that we start to use it.\n\n<br>\nLets start with Avatar.  Identify all the places where Avatar is being displayed and replace that with the new component. Be mindful of the size. Examine the current size being used while replacing.	open	1	Hammad Hassan	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-16 11:11:26	2026-11-16 11:11:26	f
1ab1aae46afa-46e4-b3db-a3ebef9820fc	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	Customize Widgets	I need a way to customize the widgets inside the dashboard according to the user's preference. Right now there are fixed number of widgets available inside the application. So how can we have customize widgets.	open	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	2026-11-16 11:12:26	2026-11-16 11:12:26	f
1cecd6c76afb-1ee8-c328-6f16c99cd135	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	Issue Dependency	In the application currently the only thing that we have is parent and child issue. We need a more thorough dependency sections.\n\nRather than an issue just being a child/parent of another issue we need to support the following\n\n1) An issue might block another issue\n2) An issue might be blocked by another issue\n3) An issue might be related to another issue\n4) An issue might split into multiple issue\n5) An issue might be a Parent or Child of another issue\n\nIt is important to hold these values so we need to extend the current implementation. We need to be careful of cyclic complexities of such self-relationship.	open	1	Hammad Hassan	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-16 21:01:16	2026-11-16 21:01:16	f
368036d36afc-ae59-6053-37801a47463a	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	Navbar	The current implementation of the Navbar has multiple issue.\n1\\. The project selector is in the Navbar so when the navbar is hidden which project is currently loaded is not visible\\.\n2\\. There is the use image and live status\\, the profile image is redundant\\, the image is already available in the header\\, can should move the live status in the header as well\\.\n3\\. The Dashboard and Projects works across projects but Issues\\, Task Board\\, Gantt\\, Threads are project dependent\\. We should group the application wide actions like Dashboard and Projects up top and the rest below them\n4\\. The Dashboard\\, once opened sticks around\\, this is not very handy on mobile\\.\n\nLets create screens to see how the new navbar and header will work for both desktop and mobile phone.	open	1	Hammad Hassan	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-17 09:15:34	2026-11-17 09:15:34	f
411da3826afc-9a36-ac6f-3a7c323d23c4	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	Semantic Search	Let's have an implementation for setting up an architecture to allow users to search through semantics, fuzzy, and FTS. Following things should be take care while implementing this feature.\n<br>\n1. Have a separate search controller for searching that would get the search module e.g., issue and query to search and return the response of the given module.\n2. ACL should be taken into consideration. There is no need to apply ACL on the search controller. ACL should be checked for the module requested to be searched and the rest ACL checks should also be taken care.\n3. Embeddings will be generated using the nomic-embed-text model, and this should be added to Ares.\n4. Gaia will call the Ares endpoint to get the embeddings.\n5. For Storage of embeddings, pgvector will also be set up.\n6. Updating of the embeddings should be event-driven. A scheduler can be made to update the embeddings, which will be triggered every 24 hrs.\n7. Allow a structure in metadata that specifies which column the semantic, fuzzy, and FTS will be applied to, as below\n\n```\n// app/metadata/model/Issue.php\n'search' => [\n'type' => 'issue', // name in /search?types=…\n'fts' => ['subject' => 'A', 'description' => 'B'], // field => weight\n'fuzzy' => ['subject'],\n'semantic' => ['subject', 'description'], // in this order, cut to N characters\n'exact' => ['issueNumber'], // pinned first when the query matches exactly\n'display' => ['title' => 'subject', 'snippet' => 'description'],\n],\n```\n<br>\nGiven the above architecture, regardless of which module is being searched, semantic and other types of searching should be functional.	open	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	2026-11-17 13:44:33	2026-11-17 13:44:33	f
45e5a2256afc-2d64-3ed5-063c904309cb	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	Event Registry	Right now there are multiple events that are being thrown for Hermes to capture. We need to list the events that are currently being thrown.\n\nThese events are already being used by Workflows, they will be used be used by other services e.g. Ares, Integration, Talos, etc.  However, it is also quite important that we do not throw everything, that will overwhelm the system and is not required.\n\nIdeally we should be able to create a registry that records all the events we want to throw so that if we need to add or remove any event we can do so in the registry, the registry should not be in the database as it will be required in almost all the API calls.	open	1	Hammad Hassan	1	Hammad Hassan	2026-11-17 14:52:53	2026-11-17 14:52:53	f
6c7240d86afd-3eec-75db-a5acaf1064a6	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	Blank screen issue	<span class="colour" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);">blank screen is shown before the request has been made in any of the nested routes. Why does that occur? What is your investigation into that?</span>	open	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	2026-11-18 09:48:28	2026-11-18 09:48:28	f
7281afa46afd-7a77-8aba-64fa90d6419b	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	Rels option bug	There is one of the calls made for the ideas that are using rels: none, whereas we aren't providing that option in the backend. Each API call made from the client should have this knowledge about how to handle the API and what sort of nuances there are when querying the API.	open	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	Rana Nouman	2026-11-18 12:43:30	2026-11-18 12:43:30	f
\.
