e13cc3156a58-d48d-3aad-f7906d0b6ed7	Revamp Frontend Authorization Model	2026-07-16 14:55:29	2026-07-20 15:20:48	0	<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">The frontend authorization implementation is tightly coupled with the existing multi-level RBAC permission model, making permission checks unnecessarily complex and difficult to maintain.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">With the backend moving to a simplified binary authorization model, the frontend must also be updated to consume and enforce the new authorization behavior consistently across the application.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">Additionally, the frontend should properly handle hidden relationships (<code data-backticks="1">rels</code>) and field-level access without assuming all requested data will always be returned.</span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>Goal / Objective</strong></h2>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">Align the frontend authorization model with the new backend RBAC architecture by simplifying permission checks, improving UI consistency, and gracefully handling resources, relationships, and field-level authorization.</span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>Scope of Work</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>1. Simplify Permission Evaluation</strong></h3>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">Update the frontend permission handling to support only binary permissions.</span></p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<h4>Permission Values</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>0</strong>&nbsp;→ Access Denied</li>\n<li><strong>1</strong>&nbsp;→ Access Granted</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">Remove all logic related to legacy permission levels:</span></p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<ul>\n<li>2</li>\n<li>3</li>\n<li>9</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">Permission checks throughout the application should evaluate only whether access is granted or denied.</span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>2. Resource-Based UI Authorization</strong></h3>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">Update UI components to render based on resource-level permissions.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">Examples:</span></p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hide or disable:\n<ul>\n<li>Create buttons</li>\n<li>Edit actions</li>\n<li>Delete actions</li>\n<li>View actions</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Prevent navigation to unauthorized resources</li>\n<li>Display appropriate empty or unauthorized states where necessary</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>3. Relationship (<code data-backticks="1">rels</code>) Handling</strong></h3>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">The frontend should no longer assume that requested relationships are always included in API responses.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">If a related resource is omitted due to authorization:</span></p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Do not treat the response as an error</li>\n<li>Render the parent resource normally</li>\n<li>Gracefully hide UI sections dependent on the missing relationship</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Example</h4>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">If:</span></p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<pre><code>GET /api/v1/projects?rels=issues\n</code></pre>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">returns:</span></p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<pre><code>{\n  "projects": [\n    {\n      "id": 1,\n      "name": "Website Redesign"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">The application should:</span></p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Display the project details</li>\n<li>Omit the Issues section</li>\n<li>Avoid runtime errors caused by missing relationship data</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>4. Field-Level Authorization</strong></h3>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">Update UI components to support field-level authorization.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">If specific fields are excluded from the API response due to authorization:</span></p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Do not render placeholders or empty labels</li>\n<li>Hide unauthorized fields gracefully</li>\n<li>Prevent runtime errors caused by missing properties</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">Examples:</span></p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Budget</li>\n<li>Cost</li>\n<li>Internal Notes</li>\n<li>Profit Margin</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>5. Centralize Authorization Logic</strong></h3>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">Refactor permission evaluation into a shared authorization service or utility.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass="">Benefits include:</span></p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Consistent authorization behavior</li>\n<li>Reduced duplicate permission logic</li>\n<li>Easier maintenance and testing</li>\n<li>Simplified future enhancements</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>Expected Outcome</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Simplified frontend permission checks</li>\n<li>Consistent authorization behavior across all modules</li>\n<li>Graceful handling of hidden relationships</li>\n<li>Proper support for field-level authorization</li>\n<li>Improved maintainability and reduced complexity</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3906	2026-07-17	2026-07-16	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	1de107506a58-f3e9-094e-c2fc0df77006	\N	ae6454575acb-1902-6b9c-f2ffa11a2697	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	5b919d946a58-efbe-47b4-141098354909	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-07-20 15:13:11	aprom	0	0
