a64a3ac76a6a-11d2-e88d-02e1213f63d8	Remove Role Assignment from Project Membership UI	2026-07-29 14:48:06	2026-07-29 14:49:15	0	<p>Update the Prometheus frontend to reflect the new role assignment model by removing project-specific role assignment from project membership management.</p>\n<p>Currently, project members can be assigned a role as part of their project membership. Under the new authorization model, roles are assigned at the application level and are no longer associated with individual project memberships.</p>\n<p>Project membership screens should therefore focus only on managing a user's membership and access to the project. Role assignment and management should be handled separately through the application's global user or role management experience.</p>\n<p>This change ensures the frontend remains consistent with the new backend authorization model and avoids presenting users with an unsupported project-level role configuration.<br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<h3>Functional Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove role selection from project member invitation flows.</li>\n<li>Remove role selection from project member creation flows.</li>\n<li>Remove role selection from project member edit/update flows.</li>\n<li>Remove project-specific role information from project member lists and details where applicable.</li>\n<li>Remove project-level role assignment actions from project member management.</li>\n<li>Ensure project membership APIs are called without project-specific role information.</li>\n<li>Update frontend data models to remove the project membership → role relationship.</li>\n<li>Update project member forms and validation to no longer require a role.</li>\n<li>Ensure application-wide role management remains available through the appropriate global user or role management interface.</li>\n<li>Ensure users can have multiple application-wide roles through the global role management experience.</li>\n<li>Update affected frontend components, services, models, serializers, and API payload handling.</li>\n<li>Remove obsolete project-level role-related UI elements, labels, filters, and actions.</li>\n<li>Ensure the project membership experience remains functional after removing role assignment.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>UI/UX Considerations</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Project member management should clearly focus on adding, removing, and managing a user's membership in the project.</li>\n<li>Role selection should no longer appear when:\n<ul>\n<li>Inviting a user to a project.</li>\n<li>Adding an existing user to a project.</li>\n<li>Editing project membership.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Application-wide roles should be managed from the dedicated global user/role management experience rather than within a project.</li>\n<li>If users need to manage roles from the project context, provide a clear navigation path to the global role management area rather than duplicating role assignment functionality.</li>\n<li>Existing project member lists should not display project-specific roles.</li>\n<li>Ensure loading, empty, and error states continue to work correctly after removing role-related UI.</li>\n<li>The updated UI should remain responsive across supported screen sizes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Expected Behavior</h3>\n<p>When adding a user to a project, the flow should only manage project membership:<br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<pre><code>Add Member\n\nUser: John Doe\nProject: Project A\n\n[ Add Member ]\n</code></pre>\n<p>The role selection should no longer be displayed:<br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<pre><code>Role: [ Project Manager ▼ ]  ← Removed\n</code></pre>\n<p>Roles should instead be managed independently at the application level:<br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<pre><code>User: John Doe\n\nApplication Roles:\n- Project Manager\n- Developer\n\nProject Memberships:\n- Project A\n- Project B\n</code></pre>\n<p>A user's role assignment must not change when the user is added to or removed from a project.</p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3913	2026-07-30	2026-07-29	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	1de107506a58-f3e9-094e-c2fc0df77006	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-07-29 14:49:14	aprom	0	0
