7d4bc8c86adc-6ec6-f97e-f00082c45ef3	Notifications: backfill relatedTo and relatedId on notifications created before the columns existed	2026-10-24 14:06:53	2026-10-25 18:07:24	0	<p>agaia-4064 added <code>relatedTo</code>/<code>relatedId</code> to <code>system_notifications</code> and sets them on every new notification. Older rows still have NULL. Prometheus is about to use these columns to decide what a notification click opens, so every existing row needs them.</p><ul><li>Add a one-off, idempotent backfill that only touches rows where <code>relatedId</code> is NULL. Gaia has no data-migration mechanism yet (only <code>core/tasks/MigrationTask.php</code> for schema sync and <code>core/tasks/AdminTask.php</code>), so choose the smallest fitting form, for example a CLI task action next to these. Document how to run it in the PR and in the repo docs.</li><li>Use the same mapping as the modules in <code>app/api/v1/controllers/components/notifications/modules/</code>:<ul><li>Issue, comment and time-log notifications: <code>relatedTo = issue</code>, <code>relatedId</code> = the id in the description's <code>{{Issue@&lt;id&gt;}}</code> tag (every one has it).</li><li>Milestone notifications: <code>relatedTo = milestone</code>, with the milestone id from <code>context</code>.</li><li>Membership notifications: <code>relatedTo = project</code>, with the project id from <code>context</code> (or the membership it names).</li></ul>Tell them apart by <code>context.relatedTo</code>. If the context lacks an id, look it up from the related record.</li><li>Leave rows that can't be resolved as NULL and count them in the task output (updated, skipped, unresolved).</li><li>Don't change <code>context</code>, <code>description</code> or the recipient rows.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>After it runs, every resolvable old notification has the same <code>relatedTo</code>/<code>relatedId</code> a newly created one of its kind would have.</li><li>Running it again changes nothing.</li><li>Tests cover each kind (issue, comment, time log, milestone, membership) plus the unresolved case.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> changing how new notifications are created, and any API change.</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4117	2026-10-31	2026-10-24	deferred	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	92ae09c66ace-1e5c-2b63-d1da9630092c	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	6ad8b3c86ade-7317-1142-eff1dacdb82a	d293f53862c6-8e43-047e-1fffdc448fcf	2026-10-25 18:07:24	agaia	0	0
