066947536aee-a7e9-ca02-436c69e213e3	ezSearch: completer for search bar suggestions	2026-11-06 21:39:18	2026-11-07 00:14:19	0	<p>The ezSearch bar shows a suggestion menu while typing. This issue adds the pure logic behind it: given the text, the cursor and a schema, what comes next and what to suggest. No UI.</p><p><strong>Changes</strong></p><ul><li><code>app/utils/query/completer.js</code>: <code>complete(text, cursor, schema)</code> returns <code>{context, replaceStart, replaceEnd, suggestions}</code>. Context is field, operator, value or connector; built on the lexer from the parser issue.</li><li>Order of suggestions by context:<ul><li>At a field: fields, plus a "Search &lt;text field label&gt; for '&lt;word&gt;'" item.</li><li>After a field: only the operators valid for its type (registry from the query-model issue).</li><li>After an operator: the field's values (enum order, users alphabetical, <code>today</code> for dates; inside quotes too).</li><li>After a complete condition: <code>)</code> when a bracket is open, plus only the conjunction the current group already uses. Groups never mix AND and OR, and an implied AND counts. Both AND and OR are offered only when the group has one condition.</li></ul></li><li>Each suggestion is <code>{kind, label (translation key or text), insert, detail (e.g. the field id)}</code>, and accepting one replaces <code>replaceStart..replaceEnd</code>.</li><li>Ranking: exact match, then label prefix, then alias or id prefix, then word start inside the label, then substring; ties keep schema order. At most 8 items.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>Unit tests with the fixture schema (<code>tests/helpers/query-schema.js</code>):<ul><li><code>prio|</code> gives Priority first.</li><li><code>priority |</code> gives the enum operators only.</li><li><code>priority = h|</code> gives High.</li><li><code>start between 2026-05-01 and |</code> gives date values.</li><li><code>(type:bug |</code> gives AND, OR and <code>)</code>.</li><li><code>(type:bug OR type:story |</code> gives OR and <code>)</code> only.</li><li><code>status:new milestone:v1 |</code> gives AND only.</li><li>A cursor in the middle of the text replaces the right range.</li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> recent or saved queries as suggestions.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4294</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 3</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	4296	2026-11-14	2026-11-07	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Agent Agamemnon	7ba3a1476aee-dc4c-6482-40fd9139a29d	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-07 00:14:19	aprom	0	0
