e2d6d4e56a70-66d2-71b1-b194941ff0b8	Implement Field-Level ACL	2026-08-03 10:52:18	2026-08-04 11:43:15	0	<p>Extend Gaia's ACL system to support field-level access control, allowing permissions to be enforced on individual fields within a resource.</p>\n<p>Currently, ACL checks primarily determine whether a user can access or perform an action on an entire resource. This does not provide sufficient control for scenarios where users should be able to access a resource but only view or modify specific fields.</p>\n<p>Field-level ACL should allow permissions to be defined independently for individual fields while continuing to work alongside existing resource-level and group-based authorization.</p>\n<p>For the initial implementation, field-level access should support the following actions:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">Read</code> — Controls whether the field can be returned to the user.</li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">Create</code> — Controls whether the field can be provided when creating a resource.</li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">Update</code> — Controls whether the field can be modified when updating a resource.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3917	2026-08-04	2026-08-03	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	8d2dc2996a70-1635-52c1-7e0683d8ced6	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	2886ca916a71-65ba-0090-8c0887311a2c	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-08-04 11:43:14	agaia	0	0
