394f89b66a71-14ba-da79-7dcf8c968c23	Implement Field-Level ACL Administration and Enforcement in Role Permissions	2026-08-04 14:16:25	2026-08-05 10:54:17	0	<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Enterprise customers need finer-grained access control than module-level allow/deny. Today, roles only control module actions (get/create/update/delete). Sensitive attributes—emails, dates of birth, issue subjects—cannot be restricted independently of broader module access.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">This task introduces field-level ACL: administrators can set&nbsp;None,&nbsp;Read, or&nbsp;Write&nbsp;per field on the role permissions screen, and the application enforces those rules in UI contexts (<code data-backticks="1">&lt;span class="colour" style="color: inherit;"&gt;module.field.action&lt;/span&gt;</code>). Mode selections map to backend get/create/update triples so administration stays simple while runtime checks remain precise.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Business value: stronger data privacy, least-privilege roles, and alignment with enterprise ACL patterns used in Jira, Azure DevOps, and similar platforms.</span></p>\n<h3>Functional Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Split each module’s permission panel into&nbsp;Actions&nbsp;and&nbsp;Fields&nbsp;tabs</li>\n<li>Show field permissions only when the module has field catalog entries</li>\n<li>Support field access modes:&nbsp;None,&nbsp;Read Only,&nbsp;Write + Read</li>\n<li>Persist field modes via the permission API (backend expands to get/create/update)</li>\n<li>Extend ACL resolution to&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">{module}.{field}.{action}</code>&nbsp;and require the parent module action</li>\n<li>Enforce field ACL on representative UI surfaces (e.g. user email, date of birth, issue subject)</li>\n<li>Bind Estimates/Timelogs sections to&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">&lt;span class="colour" style="color: inherit;"&gt;timelog.read&lt;/span&gt;</code>&nbsp;instead of generic&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">&lt;span class="colour" style="color: inherit;"&gt;issue.read&lt;/span&gt;</code></li>\n<li>Hide “Not set” once a permission value is applied</li>\n<li>Keep save feedback (loading/success/error) and scroll-to-highlight across Actions/Fields tabs</li>\n<li>Update Mirage catalogs, permission handlers, and acceptance coverage for actions vs fields</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Expected Behavior</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Admins open a role module, manage actions and fields in separate tabs, save, and see clear status feedback</li>\n<li>Field mode&nbsp;None&nbsp;hides the field;&nbsp;Read&nbsp;allows view only;&nbsp;Write&nbsp;allows view and edit where supported</li>\n<li>Field access is denied if the parent module action is denied</li>\n<li>Timelog-related issue detail sections respect&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">&lt;span class="colour" style="color: inherit;"&gt;timelog.read&lt;/span&gt;</code></li>\n<li>Close collapses the module accordion without discarding unsaved-change semantics beyond existing save flow</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3918	2026-08-05	2026-08-04	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	47bbd3346a70-66d2-71b1-55cb7c9e5974	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	bac643d76a71-88d1-de3c-46ce7ff7ac0d	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-08-05 10:54:17	aprom	0	0
