55666d426ad8-aece-ca06-0b9ef5200e44	Talos: cheaper Odysseus runs (fresh ship session, trimmed tools, foreground subagents, cost budget)	2026-10-21 16:20:37	2026-10-21 22:46:55	0	<p>From the agaia-4069 token analysis. Every call re-reads the whole conversation, so cost ≈ calls × context. Prices from the run logs: cache read $0.20/M, 1-hour cache write $8/M, output $20/M. The run overhead came to about $1.2–1.5:</p><ul><li>The ship phase (26 calls) ran at 170–200K context: $1.44.</li><li>About 30K of fixed context on every call (system prompt, skills, all tool definitions): about $0.73 over the issue.</li><li>The test-runner and design-reviewer subagents ran in the background. The agent waited with three <code>sleep 590</code> calls, and four notifications arrived after it had finished (four extra StructuredOutput turns at about 200K context each).</li><li>The 80-turn cap stopped run 1 partway through, so the engineer had to reassign the issue.</li></ul><p>Changes:</p><ul><li><strong>Ship in a fresh session:</strong> when the implementation is done, Talos starts a new session with a short handoff note (branch, files, decisions, follow-ups) that runs <code>ai test</code> and <code>ai ship</code>.</li><li><strong>Trim Odysseus's tool list:</strong> use <code>--tools</code>/<code>builtinTools</code> as for Nestor, which went from about 41K to 14K tokens of fixed context.</li><li><strong>Run subagents in the foreground</strong> in headless runs. After a <code>done</code> outcome, Talos ignores or suppresses late task notifications.</li><li><strong>Budget:</strong> for complex issues, use a cost budget (USD per iteration) in place of the turn cap, or alongside a higher one.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> a re-run of an issue like agaia-4069 shows a lower peak context in the ship phase, no sleep or wait turns, no turns after <code>done</code>, and a cost per issue in the Talos log that can be compared with $6.72.</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4077	2026-10-28	2026-10-21	done	medium	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	84aeed166ad8-5eae-b551-f3f3cea8503c	\N	a13debc86ad7-404c-ce18-75327b747d1b	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	9fb8c2126ad9-0f3c-d11b-769295158e62	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-21 22:46:55	adt	0	0
