320f90426a73-a81e-1952-6f5be3ed9069	Revamp Role Detail Permissions UI — Flat Module Rows, Inline Role Members	2026-08-05 14:44:02	2026-08-10 20:45:50	0	<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">The Role detail Permissions experience is too heavy for day-to-day administration. Module permissions sit behind an accordion, Actions/Fields live in nested table layouts that consume vertical space, and role–user assignment is isolated in a separate Users tab. That splits context: admins configure ACL in one place and people assignment in another, slowing role setup and review.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">This work redesigns the&nbsp;role detail permissions section only&nbsp;(role cards / list remain unchanged). Remove the accordion so all modules render as a compact, row-based list under Actions and Fields tabs. Move assigned users out of the Users tab and place them directly under the role description—mirroring the project members pattern (avatar list + dotted “+” add control).</span></span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);" data-tomark-pass=""><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Business value: faster role configuration, clearer ownership of who holds the role, and a denser admin layout aligned with familiar project-member UX.</span></span><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<h3>Functional Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Keep role cards / left-side role list behavior unchanged</li>\n<li>Remove the Permissions↔Users top-level tab structure for role detail</li>\n<li>Remove the per-module accordion; first view shows all modules’ permissions without expand/collapse</li>\n<li>Retain&nbsp;Actions&nbsp;and&nbsp;Fields&nbsp;tabs for permission configuration</li>\n<li>Render Actions and Fields as&nbsp;row-based&nbsp;permission lists (resource/field + control + status), not wide multi-column / space-heavy tables</li>\n<li>Show users assigned to the role&nbsp;directly below the role description, using the project members visual pattern (<code data-backticks="1">users-list</code>&nbsp;/ avatars)</li>\n<li>Provide a&nbsp;DottedAddButton (“+”)&nbsp;in that members-style section to attach a user to the role (same interaction pattern as project members add)</li>\n<li>Preserve existing permission save feedback (loading / success / error) and ACL gating for assign/remove userrole</li>\n<li>Remove the dedicated Users tab UI (search toolbar + users table as a separate section); search may be deferred unless needed for long member lists</li>\n<li>Empty state for no assigned users (consistent with project members / nothing-found patterns)</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3920	2026-08-06	2026-08-05	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	47bbd3346a70-66d2-71b1-55cb7c9e5974	\N	ae6454575acb-1902-6b9c-f2ffa11a2697	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	bc4e61306a74-343a-a58d-3f218770c486	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-08-10 20:45:45	aprom	0	0
