a75f66026ad8-d753-535b-2c9f7d459d82	Ideas: project-scoped Idea, Ideamessage, Ideaplan and Ideaplanissue resources	2026-10-21 14:56:39	2026-10-21 16:08:44	0	<p>Projects4Me is getting an Ideas section: inside a project, users brainstorm an idea in a conversation, the plan for it is revised in versions, and an approved version becomes issues. Gaia must store all of it. The local stand-in <code>dev-tools/sim</code> (<code>lib/store.py</code>, <code>README.md</code>) shows the shape; this issue makes it real, scoped to a project, with no knowledge of agents.</p><ul><li><strong>Idea</strong> (<code>ideas</code>): <code>id</code>, <code>projectId</code> (required), <code>title</code> (varchar 200, required), <code>description</code> (text, nullable), <code>status</code> (open|archived, default open), <code>createdUser</code>, <code>modifiedUser</code>, <code>dateCreated</code>, <code>dateModified</code>, <code>deleted</code>. hasOne project, createdBy; hasMany messages, plans, planissues.</li><li><strong>Ideamessage</strong> (<code>idea_messages</code>): <code>ideaId</code>, <code>body</code> (text, markdown, required), <code>kind</code> (message|system|error, default message), <code>steps</code> (text, JSON array, nullable), <code>ideaplanId</code> (nullable, the plan version a message refers to), <code>costUsd</code> (numeric, nullable), <code>createdUser</code>, <code>dateCreated</code>, <code>deleted</code>. hasOne createdBy.</li><li><strong>Ideaplan</strong> (<code>idea_plans</code>): <code>ideaId</code>, <code>version</code> (int; assigned by Gaia on create as the idea's max + 1, unique per idea), <code>body</code> (text, JSON <code>{summary, issues:[{key, project, subject, description, type, priority, complexity, dependsOn}]}</code>), <code>status</code> (proposed|superseded|approved|creating|failed|created, default proposed), <code>error</code> (text, nullable), user and date fields, <code>deleted</code>.</li><li><strong>Ideaplanissue</strong> (<code>idea_plan_issues</code>): <code>ideaId</code>, <code>ideaplanId</code>, <code>key</code> (the plan item key), <code>issueId</code> (hasOne Issue), <code>dateCreated</code>, <code>deleted</code>; unique (<code>ideaplanId</code>, <code>key</code>).</li><li><strong>ACL:</strong> each model is its own ACL module with standard actions and field ACL. <code>Idea</code> uses <code>'acl' =&gt; ['groups' =&gt; ['Project'], 'groupKeys' =&gt; ['Project' =&gt; 'projectId']]</code>; the three children reach the project through <code>Idea</code> with <code>groupKeys</code> <code>paths</code> metadata the way <code>app/metadata/model/Comment.php</code> does, so the project.get membership record scope cascades. Seed permissions for the new modules on existing roles in line with Issue/Comment.</li><li>Follow the new-entity recipe in <code>gaia/CLAUDE.md</code>: metadata in <code>app/metadata/model/</code>, empty models in <code>app/models/</code>, controllers extending <code>RestController</code>, entries in <code>core/config/routes.php</code> and <code>core/config/models.php</code>, migration, regenerate the <code>tools/api-tester</code> catalog. Standard CRUD only, no custom actions. Version assignment belongs in the domain layer (behaviour or model), not the controller.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> CRUD for all four via JSON:API with <code>rels</code> (an idea with its messages, plans and planissues in one request); a user who is not a member of the project cannot list or read any of them, including through <code>rels</code>; api-tester <code>acl</code> cases per resource; versions number 1, 2, 3 per idea; migration runs on a fresh DB.</p><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> any notion of an agent, status transition rules, Hermes events (<code>idea.*</code> in <code>EventNames.php</code>), cross-project ideas, changes to Talos or the sim.</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4069	20