baddc6e86a79-b598-2459-dea171bcc6db	Remove Global role and enforce security-core lockout	2026-08-10 09:36:58	2026-08-10 20:42:12	0	<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">ACL administration historically relied on an implicit&nbsp;Global&nbsp;role membership and a role-name–based admin bypass. That created silent, unaudited access grants and a second privilege path outside the permission store—misaligned with action-based RBAC.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">This work retires the Global default role and makes ACL admin fully capability-based. A bootstrap&nbsp;Admin&nbsp;role is seeded with explicit full-catalog allows (no&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">Acl</code>&nbsp;name bypass). A&nbsp;security-core lockout&nbsp;invariant ensures the system always retains at least one non-deleted, security-core–capable role with an active membership, so administrators cannot lock themselves out of managing roles, permissions, or memberships.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Business value:&nbsp;auditable role assignment, a single enforcement path for all modules including ACL admin, and production-safe guardrails against irreversible admin lockout—without introducing an&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">isSystem</code>&nbsp;role flag.</span></p>\n<h3>Functional Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove implicit Global role assignment on user create (<code data-backticks="1">GlobalroleComponent</code>&nbsp;and wiring).</li>\n<li>Provide CLI to remove existing Global role, memberships, and permission rows.</li>\n<li>Ensure an&nbsp;Admin&nbsp;bootstrap role exists and holds explicit&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">allowed=1</code>&nbsp;for every module-action and field-mode catalog entry (idempotent, re-runnable as catalog grows).</li>\n<li>Authorize Permission APIs like any other module via&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">permission.{get|create|update|delete}</code>&nbsp;(remove&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">AclAdminController</code>&nbsp;role-name bypass).</li>\n<li>Define security-core capability from permissions on&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">{permission,role,userrole}.{get,create,update,delete}</code>&nbsp;(missing row = capable under permissive resolution; explicit deny/<code data-backticks="1">0</code>/<code data-backticks="1">''</code>&nbsp;= not capable).</li>\n<li>Block operations that would leave zero security-core–capable roles with at least one membership:\n<ul>\n<li>deleting such a role</li>\n<li>demoting a security-core permission to explicit deny</li>\n<li>removing the last membership of the last capable role</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Keep role assignment on user create optional (zero roles allowed until explicitly assigned).</li>\n<li>Reject violating mutations with a clear permission error (422), naming the invariant—not a specific role.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3921	2026-08-17	2026-08-14	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	8d2dc2996a70-1635-52c1-7e0683d8ced6	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	a07448e06a79-03d2-14eb-151ce4c510b0	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-08-10 20:42:11	agaia	0	0
