41e76f856a79-80e9-837f-08c372afafac	Add Role Delete from Detail Page with Lockout Error Handling	2026-08-10 10:43:13	2026-08-11 15:09:06	0	<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Administrators can create and configure roles, but deleting a role from the role detail experience is missing. Without a clear delete path on the detail toolbar, role lifecycle management is incomplete and forces workarounds outside the primary admin flow.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">This task adds delete on the role detail toolbar with confirmation, list cleanup, and navigation back to the role list. It also surfaces backend lockout rejections (when deletion would leave the system without a role retaining permission/role/userrole access), so admins get both the error and a recovery suggestion—aligned with existing permission-write error handling.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Business value: complete role lifecycle in one place, safer deletions, and clearer guidance when a role is protected.</span></p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3922	2026-08-11	2026-08-10	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	47bbd3346a70-66d2-71b1-55cb7c9e5974	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	5fa8d9436a79-03d2-14eb-0e98d78c38b5	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-08-11 15:09:06	aprom	0	1
