593d9ea76ad8-aece-ca06-a89b64be945f	ai test --changed: regenerate api-tester backend.json when Gaia metadata or routes change	2026-10-21 16:20:41	2026-10-21 22:53:25	0	<p>On agaia-4069, <code>ai test gaia --changed</code> reported <code>api backend: 0 passed</code> for the new resources. <code>tools/api-tester/apis/backend.json</code> hadn't been regenerated, so the filter matched nothing. The agent then ran <code>tools/api-tester/bin/generate-backend-apis.php</code> by hand through <code>docker run</code> against the test image. That added environment-debugging calls at about 130K context.</p><ul><li>When the changed files include <code>app/metadata/model/*</code> or <code>core/config/routes.php</code>, <code>ai test gaia</code> (both <code>--changed</code> and the full run) runs the generator in the test container first. It reports <code>regenerated backend.json (N APIs)</code>.</li><li>It warns when an API filter matches 0 cases for a changed resource, instead of reporting 0 passed as success.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> adding a resource's metadata and routes, then running <code>ai test gaia --changed</code>, runs that resource's generated backend cases.</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4078	2026-10-28	2026-10-21	done	low	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	84aeed166ad8-5eae-b551-f3f3cea8503c	\N	a13debc86ad7-404c-ce18-75327b747d1b	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	ea30b1626ad9-f8e2-3816-27ea9bd3b478	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-21 22:53:26	adt	0	0
