e85dc6556aee-88b0-a4f9-6bf743ce73c6	EzSearch: report the picked saved search and accept the active one	2026-11-07 02:03:20	2026-11-07 02:57:38	0	<p><code>&lt;EzSearch&gt;</code> (aprom-4300) loads a picked saved search into its tree and marks it active internally. The Issue list keeps the active saved search in its <code>searchId</code> URL parameter (<code>controllers/prometheus/list.js</code> <code>toggleSearch</code> ~l.974, route <code>routes/app/project/issue/index.js</code> ~l.278), so the page must be told when one is picked or cleared and must be able to set the active one when the page loads. This issue adds that to the component only; no page uses it yet.</p><p><strong>Changes</strong></p><ul><li><code>app/components/ez-search/index.{js,hbs}</code>:<ul><li>New optional <code>@activeSavedSearchId</code>: when it is set, that saved search is marked active (<code>fa-check</code>) and its query is loaded, unless <code>@query</code> is also given, in which case <code>@query</code> wins.</li><li>New optional <code>@onSavedSearchChange(search|null)</code>: called when the user picks a saved search, when they pick the active one again (which deselects it, as <code>toggleSearch</code> does today: called with null, tree emptied), and when Clear is used (called with null). Picking a search still applies it through <code>@onApply</code>, as 4300 does.</li><li>Editing the query in the bar or the builder after picking a search keeps the mark until the query is applied. Once it is applied and differs from the saved query, the mark is removed and <code>@onSavedSearchChange(null)</code> is called.</li><li>Without the new arguments the component behaves exactly as 4300 shipped it. Use the <code>@savedSearches</code> item shape 4300 defined (<code>{id, name, query}</code> or whatever it actually uses).</li></ul></li><li>Extend the component's integration test.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong> (integration tests)</p><ul><li><code>@activeSavedSearchId</code> marks the search and loads its query.</li><li>Picking a search calls <code>@onSavedSearchChange(search)</code> and <code>@onApply</code>.</li><li>Picking it again calls <code>@onSavedSearchChange(null)</code>.</li><li>Clear calls <code>@onSavedSearchChange(null)</code>.</li><li>Applying an edited query drops the mark.</li><li>All existing EzSearch tests pass unchanged.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> editing or deleting saved searches, page integration.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4300</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 3</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	4304	2026-11-14	2026-11-07	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Agent Agamemnon	b2872fe36aee-c790-a4f9-8d80bd17ed64	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-07 02:57:39	aprom	0	0
