3b4caae76a20-8e10-a2da-b853e31d678d	Limit Gantt Timeline Range to Relevant Planning Window	2026-06-03 13:50:51	2026-06-03 14:24:19	0	<p>Update the Gantt chart timeline rendering logic to display a practical and relevant planning window instead of rendering dates far into the future.</p>\n<p>Currently, the timeline extends until <strong>2046</strong>, which creates unnecessary horizontal scrolling, reduces usability, and makes project planning difficult. Most project planning activities focus on near-term work, making such an extensive timeline range impractical.</p>\n<p>The Gantt view should render a timeline based on a reasonable date range relative to the current date, improving readability and navigation.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>Functional Requirements</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Limit the timeline rendering range to a relevant planning window</li>\n<li>Render approximately <strong>6 months from the current date</strong></li>\n<li>Ensure the timeline automatically adjusts as time progresses</li>\n<li>Prevent unnecessary rendering of distant future dates</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>Current Behavior</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Timeline is rendered until 2046</li>\n<li>Excessive horizontal scrolling</li>\n<li>Poor visibility of relevant milestones and issues</li>\n<li>Reduced usability for project planning</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>Expected Behavior</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Timeline displays a practical planning horizon</li>\n<li>Users can focus on upcoming milestones and tasks</li>\n<li>Reduced scrolling and improved readability</li>\n<li>Consistent timeline rendering performance</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Timeline no longer renders years into the future</li>\n<li>Timeline range is limited to approximately 6 months from the current date</li>\n<li>Existing milestone and issue rendering remains unaffected</li>\n<li>Timeline navigation and scrolling continue to function correctly</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>Expected Outcome</strong></h3>\n<p>The Gantt chart provides a focused and usable planning experience by displaying only relevant dates, making milestones, dependencies, and issue schedules easier to understand and manage.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3900	2026-06-04	2026-06-03	deferred	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	0a337ec36a1d-0176-a590-3f299fa1b9ce	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	f70aa2306a20-f785-bbc4-47a916b155fe	d293f53862c6-8e43-047e-1fffdc448fcf	2026-06-03 14:24:19	aprom	0	0
