e2dae9186ad9-192a-43e2-a7a4ec87cd46	Ideas: screens on Ideamessage, stored as Uploads related to the idea	2026-10-22 00:25:06	2026-10-22 09:09:09	0	<p>Agent Nestor designs UI screens that Talos renders to PNG; they appear in the idea's conversation and are attached to the issues created from an approved plan. Today they live in the sim. In Gaia they become ordinary Uploads, referenced from the message that introduced them, so one <code>idea.message.created</code> event carries them.</p><ul><li><code>Ideamessage</code>: new nullable text field <code>screens</code>, a JSON array of <code>{uploadId, key, title, version, width, height}</code>; migration.</li><li>Uploads for screens use the existing upload endpoint with <code>relatedTo</code> <code>idea</code> and <code>relatedId</code> = idea id. Make sure such uploads are only listed and downloaded by users who can see the idea (resolve the project through the idea, the way issue uploads resolve through the issue); add <code>idea</code> to the <code>relatedTo</code> mapping in <code>support/ProjectIdResolver.php</code>.</li><li>Validation on create: every <code>uploadId</code> in <code>screens</code> must be an upload related to the same idea.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> a message created with screens returns them; uploads of an idea are not readable by a non-member (api-tester case); invalid upload ids are rejected; migration runs on a fresh DB.</p><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> rendering screens (Talos), showing them (Prometheus issue), new permission seeds.</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4090	2026-10-29	2026-10-22	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	a66851e96ad8-d753-535b-55dc78bc78d9	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	20e26ec06ad9-dc19-7969-46d0e19b21a7	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-22 09:09:10	agaia	0	0
