e1bdb5446af7-7919-f6fb-7f63a8f9e907	PowerSelect: one AppUi::Select wrapper, and move the 4 direct uses behind it	2026-11-13 13:34:25	2026-11-13 19:23:59	0	<p>Contain ember-power-select so it is rendered in one place. Today about 65 uses go through the FormFields fields (<code>field-relate</code>, <code>field-relate-multi</code>, <code>field-multi-select</code>), but 4 places render <code>&lt;PowerSelect&gt;</code> directly:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>app/components/app-layouts/application-header.hbs</code></li>\n<li><code>app/components/app-ui/nav-bar.hbs</code></li>\n<li><code>app/components/conversation/edit-thread-modal.hbs</code> (linked issue)</li>\n<li><code>app/templates/app/project/issue/create.hbs</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Scope</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <code>AppUi::Select</code> (single and multiple), the only component that renders <code>PowerSelect</code>/<code>PowerSelectMultiple</code>. Its own small API covering what the app uses: options, selected, onChange, search/searchEnabled/searchField/matcher, placeholder, allowClear, disabled, closeOnSelect, onOpen/onClose/onFocus/onBlur/onKeydown, render in place (for modals, see #4516), option block, <code>data-test-*</code> hooks. No pass-through of every PowerSelect argument.</li>\n<li>FormFields <code>field-relate</code>, <code>field-relate-multi</code> and <code>field-multi-select</code> render <code>AppUi::Select</code> instead of PowerSelect; their own API does not change.</li>\n<li>Move the 4 direct uses to the FormFields fields (form inputs) or <code>AppUi::Select</code> (header/sidebar switchers). Keep their look and behaviour.</li>\n<li>Component Library entry for <code>AppUi::Select</code>.</li>\n<li>Done when <code>git grep -E "PowerSelect|power-select" app/components app/templates</code> only finds <code>app/components/app-ui/select*</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Order: after #4520 (it also edits <code>edit-thread-modal</code>). Existing tests keep using the power-select helpers here; the test-helper issue follows.</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4523	2026-11-20	2026-11-13	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	70a8ecd06af3-1487-2734-22a7ca0b5d62	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	af23a2196af7-9b3a-ef05-e09edda996ef	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-13 19:23:59	aprom	0	0
