72c6fcf36ad8-8856-55d8-c307cb001ddf	Migration on an empty database fails at issues.issueNumber (conflicting NULL/NOT NULL)	2026-10-21 15:17:06	2026-10-28 18:33:39	0	<p>Found while working on agaia-4069. <code>php cli.php migration migrate</code> against a new, empty Postgres database fails on <code>dev</code> (ad7511c):</p><pre>Failed to create table 'issues' ... ERROR: conflicting NULL/NOT NULL declarations for column "issueNumber" of table "issues"</pre><p><code>app/metadata/model/Issue.php</code> declares <code>issueNumber</code> with <code>'autoIncrement' =&gt; 'true'</code> and <code>'null' =&gt; true</code>; on Postgres the auto-increment column becomes SERIAL (NOT NULL), which conflicts with the explicit NULL. Tables that sort after <code>issues</code> are not created. Also prints <code>Invalid argument supplied for foreach() in core/libs/meta/manager.php on line 194</code> twice (metadata without <code>fields</code>, probably views). Existing databases are not affected because they take the sync-existing-table path.</p><p>To reproduce: create an empty database, run the migration with <code>DB_NAME</code> pointing at it.</p><p>Complexity: complex because the fix is in the migration layer (how autoIncrement and null combine on Postgres vs MySQL) and the root cause needs checking.</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4074	2026-10-28	2026-10-21	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	92ae09c66ace-1e5c-2b63-d1da9630092c	\N	cb9597e45acd-06d6-1141-34137d85f7a9	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	57648e706ae2-5b7d-26f7-e48302a7325a	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-28 18:33:39	agaia	0	0
