040c03356a7d-e6e3-a147-a41665bf7819	Exclude Assigned Users and Support Multi-Select When Adding Role Members	2026-08-13 09:27:32	2026-08-13 19:21:01	0	<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Role member assignment currently uses a single-user picker. Already assigned users can still appear in the selectable list, which risks duplicate assignments and slows admins who need to attach several people at once.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">This work updates the add-member flow to match project membership: support selecting&nbsp;multiple users&nbsp;in one action, and&nbsp;exclude users already attached&nbsp;to the role from the picker options.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Business value: faster role setup, fewer duplicate assignment errors, and consistent admin UX across projects and roles.</span></p>\n<h3>Functional Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Replace single-user&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">FieldRelate</code>&nbsp;with multi-select (<code data-backticks="1">FieldRelateMulti</code>&nbsp;/ same pattern as project add members)</li>\n<li>Allow assigning multiple users to the role in one confirm action</li>\n<li>Exclude users already assigned to the role from the selectable options</li>\n<li>After successful assign, newly added users no longer appear in the picker on subsequent opens</li>\n<li>Preserve existing ACL (<code data-backticks="1">&lt;span class="colour" style="color: inherit;"&gt;userrole.create&lt;/span&gt;</code>), validation, success messaging, and members list/preview updates</li>\n<li>Handle partial failures gracefully if one of several creates fails (clear feedback; do not silently ignore)</li>\n<li>Keep add modal UX aligned with project members (searchable multi-select, close-on-select off)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Expected Behavior</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Opening “+” shows only users&nbsp;not&nbsp;already on the role</li>\n<li>Admin can select multiple users and confirm → all selected users are assigned</li>\n<li>Assigned users appear in the inline members list / View All modal as today</li>\n<li>Reopening the add modal does not list newly assigned users</li>\n<li>Attempting to select an already-assigned user is not possible via the filtered options list</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>UI/UX Considerations</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Mirror project members add modal: multi-select user relate, searchable options</li>\n<li>Empty eligible-user state: clear message when every available user is already assigned</li>\n<li>Loading/saving: disable confirm or show progress while batch assign runs</li>\n<li>Error: surface create failures clearly (including duplicate/backend rejection if it still occurs)</li>\n<li>Do not change View All / search-members modal scope under this ticket beyond reflecting new members after add</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Acceptance Criteria</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add-member control uses multi-select and can assign more than one user in a single submit</li>\n<li>Users already attached to the role do not appear in the add-member options</li>\n<li>After assignment, members list updates and those users are excluded from the next add session</li>\n<li>ACL still gates add via&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">&lt;span class="colour" style="color: inherit;"&gt;userrole.create&lt;/span&gt;</code></li>\n<li>Acceptance coverage for: multi-add success, exclusion of existing members, and empty eligible list when all users are already assigned</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Expected Outcome</h3>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Admins can quickly attach multiple eligible users to a role without seeing or re-selecting people who are already members.</span></p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3928	2026-08-14	2026-08-13	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	47bbd3346a70-66d