e79656116ad9-192a-43e2-6b79906dca22	gaia-mcp: idea tools (read idea, post message, propose and update plans, record plan issues, upload screens)	2026-10-22 00:25:11	2026-10-22 09:17:30	0	<p>Talos and Agent Nestor must work on ideas stored in Gaia (resources from agaia-4069) instead of the sim. gaia-mcp's <code>Tools</code> class in <code>gaia-mcp/server.py</code> is used both as the MCP server and in-process by Talos (<code>talos/lib/tracker.py</code>), so the idea operations go there once.</p><ul><li>New methods on <code>Tools</code> plus entries in the MCP tool table: <code>gaia_get_idea</code> (idea with messages, plans and plan issues via <code>rels</code>, plus the idea's project short code), <code>gaia_list_ideas</code> (a project's ideas, optional status), <code>gaia_add_idea_message</code> (idea, body, kind, optional steps, ideaplanId, costUsd, screens), <code>gaia_add_idea_plan</code> (idea, body JSON; returns id and version), <code>gaia_update_idea_plan</code> (plan, status, optional error), <code>gaia_add_idea_plan_issue</code> (plan, key, issue number + project; resolves the issue id), <code>gaia_upload_idea_screen</code> (idea, key, PNG bytes or path; returns the upload id for a message's <code>screens</code>).</li><li>Errors surface Gaia's message as <code>GaiaError</code>, like the existing tools. Follow <code>dev-tools/CLAUDE.md</code> (Windows and Linux, no fixed ports in tests).</li><li>Unit tests in <code>gaia-mcp/tests/test_server.py</code> against a fake Gaia, like the existing tools.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> each tool works against the local Gaia as Agent Nestor; tests pass on Windows and Linux.</p><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> Talos changes (separate issue), deleting ideas or messages.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> agaia-4090</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4091	2026-10-29	2026-10-22	done	high	9f00a9366ad7-404c-