484f881169f8-6b2e-3935-dbfec1eb4c0b	Restrict Issue Assignment for Invited and Inactive Users	2026-05-04 12:59:52	2026-05-12 08:17:09	0	<p>Prevent users with <strong>“Invited”</strong> or <strong>“Inactive”</strong> status from being assigned to issues across the application.</p>\n<p>Currently, all users may appear selectable during issue assignment, which can lead to invalid assignments and workflow inconsistencies. This enhancement ensures that only <strong>active users</strong> can be assigned to issues, improving data integrity and task ownership clarity.</p>\n<h3><strong>Functional Requirements</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Users with the following statuses must <strong>not be assignable</strong>:\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Invited</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Inactive</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3882	2026-05-07	2026-05-06	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	8c75ede669f8-20b5-691e-46bc7838c29f	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	23deb23569fc-7b4b-3796-7e0a33c5dae3	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-05-12 08:17:07	aprom	0	0
