47116a636aee-19e9-5a2a-5ead4acde007	Agamemnon merges: up to 3 CI re-runs per head, a failing re-run is counted and handed back	2026-11-07 08:11:51	2026-11-07 08:46:39	0	<p>On agaia-4301 (PR gaia#245) CI failed on a GitHub-side timeout. <code>_ci_failed</code> (<code>talos/lib/orchestrator/merging.py</code> ~l.113) called <code>merge.py</code> <code>rerun</code>, and <code>gh run rerun --failed</code> exited 1 on every sweep for hours. The exception comes before <code>store.note_merge</code>, so the re-run was never recorded and there was no comment and no handback; the engineer re-ran it by hand. The likely cause is that the Agamemnon token has no Actions permission. Also, one re-run per head is too few for flaky external fetches.</p><ul><li><code>merge.py</code> <code>rerun</code>: keep gh's stderr in the error.</li><li><code>_ci_failed</code>: a re-run that errors is recorded (count plus error) and logged with the error. After <code>ciRerunErrors</code> (default 2) errors on the same head, hand back with the error text, which goes to triage first as today.</li><li><code>policy.ci_step</code> and <code>state.py</code> (auto_merges): count re-runs per head. RERUN while the count is below <code>ciRerunAttempts</code> (agent.json, default 3), WAIT for the grace minutes after each, HAND_BACK after the last one. The comment says "attempt n of 3".</li><li><code>agamemnon/README.md</code>: add <strong>Actions: Read and write</strong> (re-run failed jobs) to the token's permission table. Talos README: the new settings.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> unit tests for 1, 2 and 3 re-runs at a head, a new head starting over, a rerun command that errors (counted, then handed back with stderr, never looping), and the dry run. <code>agamemnonProtected</code> paths: manual merge.</p><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> deciding whether the failure is temporary (ci-triage issues).</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 8</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4312	2026-11-14	2026-11-07	done	high	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	7edc8c366ae8-0360-4071-f0d5103ebc86	\N	a0df54476ad7-404c-ce18-8b3ef9fc16e9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	63870bb16aee-73fb-80cc-58065413c014	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-07 08:46:39	adt	0	0
