5bbd81876aee-19e9-5a2a-c4b7d53688f9	aga: file-bug verb (Agamemnon files a Bug for a failure already on the base branch)	2026-11-07 08:12:11	2026-11-07 10:45:30	0	<p>When CI fails on something already broken on the base branch (e.g. an earlier image preview test failing for every PR), the fix is a separate bug issue, after which the blocked PR merges the base branch and carries on. Agamemnon should be able to file that bug itself. This is a new, visible power, so it is tightly limited.</p><ul><li><code>verbs.py</code>: <code>file-bug</code> (new tier <code>file</code>, level VISIBLE, added to the tier list in <code>premise.json</code>). Args: <code>--title</code>, <code>--signature</code> (the failing job plus test name), <code>--body</code> (what fails, the log excerpt, the base commit where it also fails, the blocked issue).</li><li><code>tool.py</code>: create a Bug through the tracker (gaia-mcp, as Talos does elsewhere) in the blocked issue's project and milestone, priority high, assigned to the worker. The description opens with "Filed by Agent Agamemnon: blocks #N" and ends with acceptance criteria (the job passes on the base branch). Post a comment on the blocked issue linking it.</li><li>Refused when the base-ci read in this incident did not show the job failing on the base branch too; when the same signature already has an open Agamemnon-filed bug (link that one instead, recorded in the journal); or when <code>agaFileBugsPerDay</code> (agent.json, default 3) is reached.</li><li>Undo: none on GitHub. Undo sets the filed bug to won't fix with a comment.</li><li>Talos README: the verb and its limits.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> unit tests for creation, every refusal, dedupe by signature, the daily cap and undo. <code>agamemnonProtected</code> paths: manual merge.</p><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> holding and resuming the blocked issue (hold-until-done issue), fixing the bug (the worker does that like any issue).</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> adt-4313</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 7</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4314	2026-11-14	2026-11-07	done	medium	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	7edc8c366ae8-0360-4071-f0d5103ebc86	\N	a13debc86ad7-404c-ce18-75327b747d1b	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	71319e196aee-5721-a299-d9d9fdd1dea9	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-07 10:45:30	adt	0	0
