fbb104946af7-7919-f6fb-bfc27bf4f695	PowerSelect: collect all its styling in styles/components/power-select.scss	2026-11-13 13:34:51	2026-11-13 20:28:27	0	<p>PowerSelect styling is spread over five files. Collect it in <code>app/styles/components/power-select.scss</code>, themed to AdminLTE (square edges, design-system colours), and import that from <code>app.scss</code>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Move the <code>@import 'ember-basic-dropdown'</code> / <code>@import 'ember-power-select'</code> lines (<code>app.scss:33-34</code>) into it, keeping their position in the cascade.</li>\n<li>Move the overrides from <code>modules/document.scss</code> (<code>.ember-basic-dropdown-content</code>, trigger, selected item), <code>modules/form-fields.scss</code> (options, trigger, multiple option), <code>modules/nav.scss</code> (sidebar switcher) and <code>modules/wiki.scss</code> (wiki detail trigger, dropdown, search input, multiple). Context-specific rules stay scoped under their context selector inside the new file.</li>\n<li>Prefer power-select's theme variables over overriding its selectors where they cover the case.</li>\n<li>No visual change: compare the header and sidebar switchers, a relate field, a multi-select and the wiki detail before and after.</li>\n<li>Done when <code>ember-power-select</code>/<code>ember-basic-dropdown</code> selectors appear only in <code>app/styles/components/power-select.scss</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Order: after #4523 (the wrapper may adjust markup classes). Not in parallel with #4522, which also edits <code>document.scss</code>.</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4525	2026-11-20	2026-11-13	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	70a8ecd06af3-1487-2734-22a7ca0b5d62	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	4925bc076af7-5b5b-7458-d2fc4a6149e4	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-13 20:28:27	aprom	0	0
