561ff99669de-99ea-e9ba-c134b5cf43f2	Add API for milestone overview	2026-04-14 13:59:50	2026-04-23 06:45:01	0	<p>Create an API endpoint to provide a summarized overview of a milestone based on the provided milestone ID. This API will help surface key metrics required for milestone tracking and reporting.</p>\n<p>The API should accept a <strong>milestone ID as a required parameter</strong> and return essential information such as the count of open and closed issues within the milestone. Additionally, it should support returning aggregated <strong>estimated vs. spent hours</strong> for all issues under the milestone when explicitly requested.</p>\n<p>This will enable frontend components (e.g., Taskboard, Widget, Project milestones list) to display milestone-level insights without requiring multiple API calls.</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>Functional Requirements</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Milestone ID must be required to fetch data</li>\n<li>Return:\n<ul>\n<li>Total number of <strong>open issues</strong></li>\n<li>Total number of <strong>closed issues</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Optionally return (on request/flag):\n<ul>\n<li>Total <strong>estimated hours</strong></li>\n<li>Total <strong>spent (logged) hours</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>Expected Outcome</strong></h3>\n<p>A single, efficient API that provides a quick summary of milestone progress and effort tracking, improving performance and enabling better visualization across the application.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3875	2026-04-15	2026-04-14	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	63413fd6673b-6180-ffb0-440801685dd8	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	260aa9c369e8-94b1-bf98-9db94f162b1a	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-04-23 06:45:00	agaia	0	0
