229b29726a9e-c65a-2ecc-98377b05fc3b	Show Empty State When Project Has No Activities	2026-09-07 10:00:02	2026-09-07 11:26:26	0	<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">On the project detail view, Project Activities always renders the timeline chrome (including the trailing clock marker) even when the project has no activities. Users see an empty-looking timeline instead of a clear “nothing here” message.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">This task shows a proper empty state—“No activities found”—when a project has zero activities, matching patterns already used in&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">AppUi::Timeline</code>&nbsp;and user-profile recent activities.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Business value: clearer project dashboard feedback and consistent empty-state UX across the product.</span></p>\n<h3>Functional Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>When the project has no activities, show an empty state in Project Activities (e.g. “No activities found”)</li>\n<li>When activities exist, continue rendering the timeline as today</li>\n<li>Reuse existing empty-state pattern (<code data-backticks="1">Exceptions::NothingFound</code>) and i18n where possible (<code data-backticks="1">&lt;span class="colour" style="color: inherit;"&gt;views.app.components.timeline.noActivitiesFound&lt;/span&gt;</code>&nbsp;or project-specific copy)</li>\n<li>Do not show the empty timeline/clock-only UI when there are no activities</li>\n<li>Keep ACL gating (<code data-backticks="1">&lt;span class="colour" style="color: inherit;"&gt;project.read&lt;/span&gt;</code>) unchanged</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Current Behavior</h3>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Project detail always renders&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">{{time-line activities=this.activities}}</code>. With an empty activities collection, users still see timeline structure/clock chrome instead of a meaningful empty message.</span></p>\n<h3>Expected Behavior</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Projects with activities: timeline lists activity groups as today</li>\n<li>Projects with no activities: Project Activities shows “No activities found” (or equivalent) via&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">Exceptions::NothingFound</code></li>\n<li>No blank/ambiguous timeline UI in the empty case</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>UI/UX Considerations</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Align with existing empty states on the same page (conversations, issues, members)</li>\n<li>Keep section header “Project Activities” visible; only the body switches to empty state</li>\n<li>Prefer migrating to&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">AppUi::Timeline</code>&nbsp;(already supports this empty state) over a one-off conditional, if low-risk</li>\n<li>Spacing should remain consistent with the activities box; empty state should be centered/readable inside the section</li>\n<li>Loading/error: out of scope unless current page already distinguishes loading from empty</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Acceptance Criteria</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>A project with zero activities shows “No activities found” (or approved i18n equivalent) in Project Activities</li>\n<li>A project with one or more activities still shows the timeline correctly</li>\n<li>Empty state does not render the trailing clock-only timeline marker alone</li>\n<li>Copy is translated via i18n (not hardcoded in the template)</li>\n<li>Visual consistency with other&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">Exceptions::NothingFound</code>&nbsp;usages on project detail</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3936	2026-09-08	2026-09-07	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	a5c362b86a91-2952-7d17-301ac1af4e15	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	\N	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-09-07 11:26:25	aprom	0	0
