8e6703226adc-6ec6-f97e-27e12a1cd0b6	Notifications: issue list and gantt open a notification's issue in their quick views	2026-10-24 14:07:10	2026-10-25 19:01:17	0	<p>The <code>issue-preview</code> service (previous issue) lets the open screen take a notification click by issue id and show the issue in its quick view; the task board already uses it. This issue registers the issue list and the gantt as preview views.</p><ul><li><strong>Issue list:</strong> <code>routes/app/project/issue/index.js</code> registers in <code>setupController</code> and disposes in <code>resetController</code> on exit. <code>hasIssue(issueId)</code> checks the rows currently loaded in <code>controllers/app/project/issue/index.js</code>. <code>open</code> calls its <code>selectIssue(issue)</code>.</li><li><strong>Gantt:</strong> <code>routes/app/project/gantt.js</code> registers and disposes in the same way. <code>hasIssue</code> checks the loaded gantt issues. <code>open</code> calls <code>openIssuePanel(issue)</code> in <code>controllers/app/project/gantt.js</code>.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>On the issue list or the gantt, clicking a notification whose issue is shown there opens that screen's quick view or panel.</li><li>Otherwise the click opens the issue detail page.</li><li>Tests for each screen: registration is disposed, and both the quick view and fallback paths are covered.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> loading issues that aren't on the current page or filter, and other screens.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4118</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4119	2026-10-31	2026-10-24	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	6ba71de26ace-1e5c-2b63-25d38169aba6	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	badc1e926ade-ae56-061d-f0a5b2576460	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-25 19:01:17	aprom	0	0
