7193b6d168f0-1c6a-eaeb-889449c975dd	Issue Planning Feature Enhancements	2025-10-16 13:04:49	2025-11-04 07:00:35	0	<h3><strong>Problem Statement</strong></h3>\n<p>Currently, the <strong>Issue Planning</strong> feature lacks proper handling of loading states and user actions during asynchronous AI-based plan creation.<br>\nWhen users trigger plan generation, the interface allows repeated actions or premature interruptions (e.g., closing the modal while loading), which can cause duplicated requests, inconsistent states, or broken user experience.</p>\n<p>These issues disrupt workflow stability and lead to potential API overload, failed plan creations, or user confusion.</p>\n<h3><strong>Scope of Work</strong></h3>\n<p>This Epic covers the following functional and UX improvements for the <strong>Issue Planning modal and workflow</strong>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Disable “Create Plan” Button</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Prevent users from creating the plan creation process while AI is still generating the plan.</li>\n<li>When sub-tasks are being created, temporarily disable the button to prevent duplicate requests or state conflicts.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Cancel API Request When Modal is Closed Mid-Load</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>If the Issue Planning modal is closed while the AI plan generation is still in progress, automatically cancel the in-progress API call.</li>\n<li>Ensure clean cancellation and prevent any unwanted memory or network issues.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3722	2025-11-27	2025-10-16	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	f79e81a568f0-f6b3-5cb9-e5a2c76ef237	\N	ae4ca1725acb-1902-6b9c-1a5d19be2920	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	\N	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2025-11-04 07:00:35	aprom	1	0
