864a5c576ad7-b7ec-4943-13e891fa3ea1	Agents: first-class AI agents in Projects4Me	2026-10-20 11:37:42	2026-11-09 15:00:14	0	<p>Umbrella for the Agents milestone in A Gaia, A Prometheus, A Ares and A Dev Tool.</p><p><strong>Design decisions (from the Agents brainstorm, 2026-10-20):</strong></p><ul><li>Class Table Inheritance: every agent is a <code>users</code> row (<code>users.type</code> = Human | Agent) extended 1:1 by an <code>agents</code> row. Agents therefore work like team members: ACL roles, project membership, assignment, time logs, comments.</li><li>An agent may have a <em>sponsor</em> (the user it acts on behalf of) or none; either way it is governed by its own ACL. 'Agent admin' is not a role, just ACL permission on the <code>agent.*</code> resources.</li><li>Agents keep an email for now (the OAuth tables key tokens by email).</li><li>Gaia holds the full runtime config and the tool/skill catalogs and grants; Projects4Me-owned server-side tools are implemented in Ares as an MCP server; workspace tools (Read/Edit/Bash, git) run in the agent runtime; external MCP servers are referenced by URL.</li></ul><p><strong>Issues:</strong> Gaia agaia-4027 agaia-4028 agaia-4029 agaia-4030 agaia-4031 agaia-4032 agaia-4043; Prometheus aprom-4044 aprom-4045 aprom-4036 aprom-4037 aprom-4038; Ares aa-4039; dev-tools adt-4046 adt-4041 adt-4047.</p><p>Out of scope for now: <code>agent_executions</code> (run history), personal access tokens for humans.</p><h4>Changes after the UI mockups (2026-10-20)</h4><ul><li>The per-agent workflow design is replaced by a generic Workflows module: agaia-4048. agaia-4043 now covers only the agent spec, aprom-4038 is the workflow editor, adt-4047 makes Talos run 'Run agent' steps.</li><li>Field help in the UI is an info-icon tooltip next to the label, never text under the field.</li></ul><p>Mockups: the screenshots attached to this issue (from the 'Agents Screens' design canvas, https://claude.ai/artifact/9WYrFcT3LacRG9QLeBSQUL, private until shared).</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	1	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	1	4026	2026-12-18	2026-10-20	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	7a626c876ad7-b7ec-4943-0da4f6053570	\N	cb9835c25acd-06d6-1141-d64018bb91b3	Agent Odysseus	Hammad Hassan	5f5f77c66ade-84af-e3d0-c0876c07bbf0	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-09 15:00:14	agaia	0	0
