7f53bcb86ace-34bf-02fa-83a17db4682e	Application Settings (admin area)	2026-10-13 17:38:07	2026-10-25 20:44:37	0	<p>A Settings area for admins, following <code>docs/ui/design-system.md</code>: grouped side navigation, AdminLTE boxes, existing form components and the bootstrap-modal add/edit pattern. First release: Email, Issue Types, Issue Statuses, plus Users and Roles moved into the settings nav.</p><p><strong>Decisions (agreed 2026-10-13)</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Admin access is a new ACL resource <code>setting</code> (read/update), granted on the Roles screen. No role-name checks.</li>\n<li>The main sidebar's Admin section is consolidated into a single <strong>Settings</strong> entry. Users and Roles move into the settings side nav.</li>\n<li>Settings navigation is a grouped side nav (System, Issues, Users &amp; Access, later Integrations, Plugins), GitLab/Jira style. Only built pages are shown; no "planned" placeholders ship.</li>\n<li>Email settings: values saved in the database win; unset values fall back to the current env vars.</li>\n<li>Issue statuses get a colour (from the existing status palette) and a sort order that drives task board columns.</li>\n<li>Issue types managed here are the defaults copied into new projects; existing projects keep their own copies.</li>\n</ul><p>Backend: epic #3956 in A Gaia.</p><p><em>Mockups:</em> attached in Files. Source: <code>dev-tools/mockups/settings/</code> (built from the real Prometheus CSS and shell; the footer position in the mockups is not part of the design).</p>	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	1	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	1	3962	2026-10-20	2026-10-13	done	high	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	6ba71de26ace-1e5c-2b63-25d38169aba6	\N	ae4ca1725acb-1902-6b9c-1a5d19be2920	Agent Odysseus	Hammad Hassan	e85980916ace-34bf-02fa-f49dbf3a1ad1	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-25 20:44:37	aprom	0	0
