ef4529456ae9-46a8-04cf-3e27b4db8944	Talos/gaia-mcp: support password-grant agents alongside client-credentials agents	2026-11-03 05:58:07	2026-11-03 06:03:55	0	<p>adt-4041 (b129862) switched gaia-mcp to the OAuth client_credentials grant and removed the password grant. Agents whose env file still holds GAIA_EMAIL/GAIA_PASSWORD with the shared app client (Odysseus, Nestor, Agamemnon) now fail to sign in with <code>401 Client credentials are only for active agents</code>, so Talos can't start any of them.</p><p>Talos must run both kinds of agents at the same time.</p><ul><li>gaia-mcp <code>Gaia</code>: GAIA_PASSWORD set → password grant (needs GAIA_EMAIL); unset → client_credentials.</li><li>Talos tracker reads GAIA_PASSWORD from the agent's gaiaEnv again.</li><li><code>ai call</code> (dev target) follows the same rule.</li><li>gaia-mcp.env.example documents both modes.</li><li>Unit tests for picking the grant.</li></ul><p>Follow-up (separate issue): <code>p4m configure</code> only writes client credentials, so re-running it drops GAIA_PASSWORD.</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4264	2026-11-10	2026-11-03	done	blocker	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	84aeed166ad8-5eae-b551-f3f3cea8503c	\N	a0df54476ad7-404c-ce18-8b3ef9fc16e9	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	c4b6e9546ae9-acca-04cf-cc59696eb7c8	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-03 06:03:55	adt	0	0
