eb5e73936ad9-192a-43e2-9469636c6099	Talos: Agent Nestor on Gaia idea events instead of the sim	2026-10-22 00:25:15	2026-10-22 09:39:02	0	<p>Ideas now live in Gaia and Gaia publishes idea events through Hermes. Talos must answer an idea when someone sends a message and create the issues when a plan is approved, reading and writing through the gaia-mcp idea tools, so the sim is no longer needed for ideas. Gaia and Prometheus know nothing about agents: Talos decides that Agent Nestor handles ideas.</p><ul><li><strong>Listener:</strong> generalize <code>lib/hermes.py</code> <code>Listener</code> so each agent declares its events and handler (Odysseus keeps <code>issue.assignee.changed</code>). Agent Nestor subscribes to <code>idea.message.created</code> and <code>idea.plan.status.changed</code> in every project he is a member of. Events whose <code>actorId</code> is Agent Nestor are ignored.</li><li><strong>Client:</strong> replace the sim client in <code>lib/ideas/client.py</code> with one on the gaia-mcp <code>Tools</code> (as <code>lib/tracker.py</code> does). Map the sim fields: <code>role</code> becomes <code>kind</code> plus author (agent = Nestor's user id), <code>plan_id</code> becomes <code>ideaplanId</code>, <code>cost_usd</code> becomes <code>costUsd</code>, <code>ideaissue</code> becomes <code>ideaplanissue</code> (by issue id), <code>ideascreen</code> becomes an upload plus the message's <code>screens</code>. Idea ids are GUIDs.</li><li><strong>Message:</strong> on <code>idea.message.created</code> with kind message from someone else, post a <code>kind: system</code> message (Agent Nestor is working on it), run the existing conversation turn (<code>lib/ideas/conversation.py</code>), then post the reply (with steps, cost, screens) and any plan as a new <code>Ideaplan</code>.</li><li><strong>Approve:</strong> on <code>idea.plan.status.changed</code> to approved, run <code>lib/ideas/approval.py</code> against Gaia: status creating, create each issue in its milestone, attach its screens, record an <code>Ideaplanissue</code>, then created or failed with the error.</li><li><strong>Reconcile</strong> on every (re)connect: per project, open ideas whose last kind message is not followed by an agent reply get a turn; plans left approved or creating resume.</li><li>Drop <code>idea.agent.progress</code> publishing for the Gaia path (Hermes has no agent publish path); keep the sim path working until it is retired.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> end to end on the local stack: Send in Prometheus produces a working notice and then Nestor's reply; Approve creates the issues with screens attached and plan issues recorded; restarting Talos mid-turn answers on reconnect; unit tests for the listener filtering, field mapping and reconcile; Windows and Linux.</p><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> live progress streaming, Stop, deleting the sim and the standalone Nestor UI.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> agaia-4088, ah-4089, adt-4091</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4092	2026-10-29	2026-10-22	done	high	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	e6b8c9706ad9-192a-43e2-651b129a8936	\N	a0d690f56ad7-404c-ce18-27bd5d2a1517	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	72c259306ad9-3c46-c4b2-2f269efe94df	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-22 09:39:02	adt	0	0
