5168ab186ae9-025d-5952-56a4aa4df817	Idea browser: show a loading label until plan statuses have loaded	2026-11-03 12:53:37	2026-11-11 10:38:12	0	<p>Every open idea in the idea browser shows <strong>Brainstorming</strong> while its status loads, then switches to its real status (Proposed, Created, ...). The cause: <code>progressByIdea</code> in <code>app/controllers/app/project/idea.js</code> treats a missing entry in <code>planStatuses</code> as brainstorming, but <code>planStatuses</code> is empty until <code>loadPlanStatuses</code> (called without waiting from <code>app/routes/app/project/idea.js</code> <code>setupController</code>) resolves.</p><ul><li>In <code>app/controllers/app/project/idea.js</code> add a <code>@tracked</code> flag (e.g. <code>planStatusesLoaded</code>, YUIDoc'd), initially false. Set it to true when <code>loadPlanStatuses</code> finishes: after it fills <code>planStatuses</code>, when <code>loadPlans</code> returns nothing, and when it rejects (catch the rejection so it isn't unhandled). Keep the existing sequence check, so a stale load never overwrites newer state, and check <code>isDestroying</code>/<code>isDestroyed</code> after the await. Reset the flag when the route loads a different project's ideas, so the old project's labels aren't shown.</li><li>In <code>progressByIdea</code>, while the flag is false, give non-archived ideas a loading entry (e.g. <code>{ label: 'views.app.idea.progress.loading', class: 'default', loading: true }</code>). Archived ideas keep the Archived label immediately.</li><li>In <code>app/templates/app/project/idea.hbs</code>, render the loading entry in the same <code>label pull-right</code> span (<code>data-idea-status</code>) with the existing spinner <code>&lt;i class="fa fa-spinner fa-spin" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;</code> before the text, as in <code>app/components/idea/plan-box.hbs</code>. No other icon and no new styles. See the attached screens for the loading and loaded states.</li><li>Add <code>views.app.idea.progress.loading</code>: "Loading" to <code>translations/en-us.json</code>.</li><li>Reloads triggered by the Hermes handlers (<code>idea.plan.created</code>, <code>idea.plan.status.changed</code>) and <code>setPlanStatus</code> do not reset the flag: the current labels stay while the reload runs.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>While the plans request is pending, open ideas show the spinner and "Loading", never "Brainstorming". Archived ideas show "Archived".</li><li>Once it resolves, each idea shows its real status. Ideas with no plan show "Brainstorming".</li><li>If the plans request fails or returns nothing, the labels fall back to the current behaviour instead of loading forever.</li><li>A live plan event does not bring the spinner back.</li><li>Unit tests in <code>tests/unit/controllers/app/project/idea-live-test.js</code> cover the loading entry before the load, the real status after it, and the failed-load fallback. Each test must fail if its line is reverted. The idea browser acceptance steps (<code>tests/acceptance/steps/ideas/idea-browser-steps.js</code>) still pass.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> loading indicators elsewhere on the idea page, and changing how plans are queried.</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 4</p><p><strong>Screens:</strong> idea-browser-loading.png, idea-browser-loaded.png</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	4267	2026-11-10	2026-11-03	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	b43cc5046ae8-20b5-32a1-13b222266c79	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Agent Nestor	Rana Nouman	32bdd6a06ae9-a6da-769c-57dacdb45405	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-04 07:25:44	aprom	0	0
