0268cfc86ad7-25a4-2b49-424870a38a20	Update stale role/card integration test after the role card redesign (#524)	2026-10-20 17:21:06	2026-10-20 17:32:26	0	<h3>Problem</h3>\n<p>The ember suite reports <code>FAIL Integration | Component | role/card: it renders (known)</code> on every run (for example <code>ember: pass 508, fail 1</code>). The <code>(known)</code> tag hides it because the same test also fails on <code>dev</code>: it is in the base-commit baseline (<code>dev-tools/ai/state/baseline-prometheus.json</code>, sha <code>532da37</code>), not in <code>config.json</code> <code>knownFailures</code>.</p>\n\n<h3>Root cause</h3>\n<p>Commit <code>8ee771fb</code>, <em>feat(role-cards): add access summary, members, and card layout redesign (#524)</em>, rewrote <code>app/components/role/card.hbs</code> and <code>card.js</code>. It did not update <code>tests/integration/components/role/card-test.js</code>, which still asserts the markup from before the redesign:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>[data-role-field="name"]</code> has text <code>admin</code>: <strong>passes</strong>.</li>\n<li><code>[data-role-field="description"] h5</code>: <strong>fails</strong>. The description is now plain text inside the div (<code>role-card__description</code>), with no <code>&lt;h5&gt;</code>.</li>\n<li><code>[data-role-field="dateCreated"]</code> = <code>21st Sep, 2016</code>: <strong>fails</strong>. That element no longer exists. The card now renders <code>[data-role-field="dateModified"]</code> as "Modified" (translation <code>views.app.role.card.modified</code>) plus <code>moment-format … 'DD MMM YYYY'</code>, using <code>dateModified</code> and falling back to <code>dateCreated</code>.</li>\n<li><code>[data-btn="delete-role"]</code> does not exist: <strong>passes</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The component itself works correctly. Only the test is out of date.</p>\n\n<h3>How to fix</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>In <code>card-test.js</code>, assert the description text directly: <code>assert.dom('[data-role-field="description"]').hasText('this is the admin role')</code>.</li>\n<li>Replace the <code>dateCreated</code> check with <code>[data-role-field="dateModified"]</code>, expecting the translated "Modified" label plus <code>21 Sep 2016</code>. This covers the fallback to <code>dateCreated</code>. Add a second case where <code>dateModified</code> is set and takes precedence.</li>\n<li>Add cases for the new behaviour:\n<ul>\n<li>initials in <code>.role-card__icon</code>;</li>\n<li>the <code>[data-role-field="coverage"]</code> states (no <code>@coverage</code> → unknown label; for example <code>@coverage={{60}}</code> → granted 60% / denied 40%; <code>@coverage={{100}}</code> → no denied label);</li>\n<li>the tier classes (<code>role-card--no-coverage/low/medium/elevated/high</code>);</li>\n<li>the empty description → <code>noDescription</code> label with <code>role-card__description--empty</code>;</li>\n<li>no <code>@members</code> → <code>noMembers</code> label.</li>\n</ul></li>\n<li>Run the ember suite and confirm 0 failures. Once the fix is on <code>dev</code>, refresh the prometheus baseline so the test no longer counts as known.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>No production code changes.</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4060	2026-10-27	2026-10-20	done	low	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	6ba71de26ace-1e5c-2b63-25d38169aba6	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	499162496ad7-b290-f013-b61d174e9c84	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-20 17:32:26	aprom	0	0
