1381ad096ad6-89d7-93af-a0cdbf342cd4	CLAUDE.md: always reuse an existing component; ask when it's unclear which one	2026-10-19 20:44:03	2026-10-20 17:22:52	0	<p>The Email settings page was built with a raw <code>PowerSelect</code> and a hand-styled label, although <code>FormFields::FieldRelate</code> exists for exactly that (see the Encryption bug). The repo <code>CLAUDE.md</code> only says "Reuse … components"; make it a hard rule for agents.</p>\n<p><strong>Scope:</strong> in <code>CLAUDE.md</code> → UI and design system: if a component for the job exists (<code>components/form-fields</code>, <code>app-ui</code>, <code>widgets</code>, or one listed in <code>docs/ui/design-system.md</code>), use it. Never build your own markup, styling or component for the same purpose. If it's unclear which component fits, or none quite does, ask the reviewer before building (headless: <code>needs_input</code>) instead of inventing one.</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	1	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	1	4025	2026-10-27	2026-10-20	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	6ba71de26ace-1e5c-2b63-25d38169aba6	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Odysseus	Hammad Hassan	44c6e1f36ad6-89d7-93af-de51bd7c3aaa	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-20 17:22:52	aprom	0	0
