097dfe586ab5-280e-15e3-42d87080d964	Block Inactive User Sign-In and Harden Account-Status Update Errors	2026-09-24 13:52:09	2026-09-24 18:54:45	0	<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Inactive users must not gain an authenticated session. Today, sign-in error handling does not reliably read the token API error payload, so an&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">account_inactive</code>&nbsp;response can fall back to a generic message—or fail to communicate why access was denied. Separately, User Management account-status toggles (single and bulk) do not recover cleanly when the API rejects an update, leaving the UI and model out of sync.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">This work blocks inactive (non-authenticatable) accounts at the token layer in Mirage, shows a clear inactive-account message on sign-in, and rolls back failed status updates with an error toast in User Management.</span></p>\n<p><span class="colour" style="color: rgb(20, 20, 20);" data-tomark-pass="">Business value: stronger account-lifecycle enforcement, clearer admin/user feedback, and fewer false “logged in” or stuck-toggle states.</span></p>\n<h3>Functional Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Reject sign-in when the user’s account status is not authenticatable (<code data-backticks="1">active</code>&nbsp;/&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">invited</code>&nbsp;only)</li>\n<li>Reject refresh-token flows for inactive accounts the same way</li>\n<li>Surface a dedicated inactive-account sign-in error (<code data-backticks="1">&lt;span class="colour" style="color: inherit;"&gt;views.signin.account\\_inactive&lt;/span&gt;</code>)</li>\n<li>Safely resolve sign-in error keys from the token response payload (fallback to generic sign-in error)</li>\n<li>On single or bulk account-status update failure in User Management: rollback model/UI switch state and show an error toast</li>\n<li>Prefer backend error text when available; otherwise use&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">statusUpdateFailed</code>&nbsp;i18n</li>\n<li>Cover inactive sign-in with an acceptance feature (Mirage token behavior)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Current Behavior</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Sign-in error toast may not correctly use&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">account_inactive</code>&nbsp;from the API response shape</li>\n<li>Inactive users are not clearly blocked/messaged in the frontend auth test double</li>\n<li>Failed status toggles can leave switches/models inconsistent without user-facing error feedback</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Expected Behavior</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Inactive user submits valid credentials → stays on sign-in, remains unauthenticated, sees inactive-account error</li>\n<li>Active/invited users continue to authenticate as today</li>\n<li>Failed activate/deactivate (single or mass) restores prior status in UI and shows an error message</li>\n<li>Successful status updates behave unchanged</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>UI/UX Considerations</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Sign-in: error Messenger toast with close control; message must clearly say the account is inactive and to contact an administrator</li>\n<li>User Management: revert toggle checked state after failure; re-enable control after request completes</li>\n<li>Loading: keep existing disabled/wait cursor while status save is in flight</li>\n<li>Do not redesign sign-in or user-management layouts under this ticket</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Acceptance Criteria</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Inactive user cannot authenticate via password grant; remains on&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">&lt;span class="colour" style="color: inherit;"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="colour" style="color: inherit;"&gt;signin&lt;/span&gt;</code>&nbsp;with inactive-account toast</li>\n<li>Refresh-token grant for an inactive user is rejected with&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">account_inactive</code></li>\n<li>Sign-in maps known error keys via i18n and falls back safely for unknown keys</li>\n<li>Single-user status toggle failure rolls back and shows an error toast</li>\n<li>Bulk status update failure rolls back changed users and shows an error toast</li>\n<li>Acceptance feature&nbsp;<code data-backticks="1">inactive-user-sign-in</code>&nbsp;passes</li>\n<li>Related test hygiene (Messenger cleanup / autofocus settle) does not break existing suites</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3953	2026-09-25	2026-09-24	in_review	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	d766f5c36aa7-8d4d-98f6-5dd803999bdf	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	f5924f106ab5-2bfb-3caa-8a97c92883cc	f605b4e862c6-4e44-047e-0b80b34dd385	2026-09-24 18:54:34	aprom	0	0
