80c5cfa16a06-3b3f-764d-64750da75029	Update index type of email field	2026-05-15 09:46:40	2026-05-26 12:15:28	0	<p>We can't rely on the email field of the user model as a unique index because when the user is deleted, the soft deletion of the user will be happened. So when the user is created with the same email address, we'll get a data integrity error at the database level.</p>\n<p>That's why we're going to make the email a plain index.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3891	2026-05-16	2026-05-15	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	63413fd6673b-6180-ffb0-440801685dd8	\N	cb9597e45acd-06d6-1141-34137d85f7a9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	47310ad46a06-f8f7-764d-d0062cccecbf	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-05-26 12:15:15	agaia	0	0
