2876e6d46af2-9f9a-36e2-a5f37471987d	State toolkit: UrlState for query-param-backed page state (defaults, reset, back/forward)	2026-11-09 17:17:28	2026-11-09 17:50:14	0	<p>Pages keep list and view state in query params (idea browser: query, page, sort, order, group, archived; board/gantt: query) and either refresh the whole route on every change (<code>refreshModel: true</code>) or juggle the params by hand. This issue adds <code>UrlState</code> to the toolkit in <code>app/utils/state/</code>, so a page can keep its state in the URL without refreshing the route. <code>AsyncResource</code>/<code>ListLoader</code> are a separate issue built in parallel.</p><ul><li><code>app/utils/state/url-state.js</code>, class <code>UrlState</code>: built in a controller with a schema <code>{ name: { default, type: 'string'|'number'|'boolean' } }</code> for that controller's query params. It exposes typed <code>values</code>, <code>set(changes)</code> (updates the params; resets <code>page</code> to its default when another list param changes, if the schema says so), <code>resetToDefaults()</code>, and <code>isDefault(name)</code>.</li><li>Change detection: <code>onChange(callback)</code> is called with <code>(values, changedNames)</code> whenever the params differ from the last values handled, whether the change came from <code>set</code>, a link, or browser back/forward (listen to the router service's <code>routeDidChange</code> for the owning route; clean up on destroy). Calling <code>set</code> with the same values does nothing.</li><li>Helpers for routes: <code>UrlState.queryParamsConfig(schema)</code> returns the route <code>queryParams</code> with <code>refreshModel: false</code> for every entry. A documented reset hook for <code>resetController</code> (leaving the route or switching project).</li><li>YUIDoc. Unit tests with a stubbed router and controller: typed parsing and defaults, set + page reset, same-value no-op, external change (simulated routeDidChange) reports only the changed names, reset, cleanup on destroy.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance</strong>: unit tests pass.</p><p><strong>Out of scope</strong>: using it in any page.</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 3</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4426	2026-11-16	2026-11-09	done	high	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	3b34c2b96af0-b3ed-60c0-369a444a326a	\N	ae459c625acb-1902-6b9c-4dab4f2a0678	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	a86631416af2-9f9a-36e2-882e0dd23c18	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-09 17:50:15	aprom	0	0
cb0df8236afb-aad0-b515-c58d7a35c87a	Make the gantt bar keyboard-accessible (clear the no-invalid-interactive todos)	2026-11-16 16:48:11	2026-11-16 17:40:46	0	<p><code>app/components/app-ui/gantt-chart/gantt-bar.hbs</code> puts <code>mousedown</code>, <code>mousemove</code> and <code>click</code> handlers on a plain <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> (lines 5-7), which <code>ember-template-lint</code> reports as <code>no-invalid-interactive</code>. The three violations are recorded in <code>.lint-todo</code>. Their hash covers the whole bar element, so any edit inside the bar makes them stale and blocks lint (aprom-4611 had to re-record them).</p><ul><li>Give the bar an interactive role and focus (e.g. <code>role="button"</code> + <code>tabindex="0"</code>, or a <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>), with an accessible name (issue number and subject).</li><li>Keyboard equivalents for click (Enter/Space opens the issue) and, if feasible, for move/resize (arrow keys), without breaking mouse drag and resize.</li><li>Remove the three <code>no-invalid-interactive</code> entries from <code>.lint-todo</code>, and the <code>no-pointer-down-event-binding</code> one if the change resolves it.</li><li>Integration tests for the keyboard behaviour; the gantt acceptance tests still pass.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> gantt bars are focusable and operable from the keyboard, mouse drag/resize work as before, and <code>gantt-bar.hbs</code> has no <code>no-invalid-interactive</code> todos.</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	4621	2026-11-23	2026-11-16	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	69b873786af9-1368-4631-55b621317e73	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Achilles	Agent Agamemnon	5994d4546afb-af1a-b408-a1d177ca3b01	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-16 17:40:46	aprom	0	0
