8f7652076a0f-1907-e544-e8f724e822dc	Add user_qualifications and user_skills Tables	2026-05-21 13:28:47	2026-05-26 13:35:00	0	<p>Introduce two new database tables — <b data-tomark-pass=""><code data-backticks="1">user_qualifications</code></b> and <b data-tomark-pass=""><code data-backticks="1">user_skills</code></b> — to support structured storage and management of user profile information related to education, certifications, and skills.</p>\n<p>Currently, qualification and skill-related data is either not normalized or lack dedicated structures for future scalability. This enhancement will improve data organization, flexibility, and extensibility for profile management features.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>Scope of Work</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>1. Create <code data-backticks="1">user_qualifications</code> Table</strong></h3>\n<p>This table will store user qualification-related information, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Education</li>\n<li>Certifications</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Suggested Fields</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">id</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">userId</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">type</code> (e.g., <code data-backticks="1">education</code>, <code data-backticks="1">certification</code>)</li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">title</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">institution</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">endDate</code> (optional)</li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">created_at</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">updated_at</code></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>2. Create <code data-backticks="1">user_skills</code> Table</strong></h3>\n<p>This table will specifically handle user skill entries.</p>\n<h4>Suggested Fields</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">id</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">userId</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">name</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">proficiency_level</code> (optional)</li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">created_at</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">updated_at</code></li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3894	2026-05-22	2026-05-21	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	63413fd6673b-6180-ffb0-440801685dd8	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	fc322e956a15-fc8d-1060-0e4ea0e71038	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-05-26 13:34:59	agaia	0	0
