0f78f4686aee-8d2e-aab0-224cbd7f3191	ezSearch: remove the 3rem form-field margin from the search bar input	2026-11-07 07:36:47	2026-11-07 09:05:32	0	<p>On the Issue list the ezSearch toolbar takes about three rows instead of one: the formatted query drops below the buttons and leaves empty space around it. Cause (found by the engineer): the bar's input (<code>data-field="ez-search-input"</code>) is a <code>FormFields::FieldText</code>, which renders a <code>div.form-field</code> wrapper, and <code>styles/modules/form-fields.scss</code> l.11-13 gives every <code>.form-field</code> <code>margin: 3rem</code>. That margin is right for form layouts but not for this toolbar field.</p><p><strong>Changes</strong></p><ul><li>In the ezSearch bar styles (<code>app/styles/components/ez-search-bar.scss</code>, scoped under the bar's root class), set the margin of the bar's <code>.form-field</code> to 0. Also remove any other form-layout spacing that makes the row taller, such as label space. Don't change the global <code>.form-field</code> rule or <code>FormFields::FieldText</code>.</li><li>Result: one row with Saved Searches, the bar filling the remaining width, then Builder, Search and Clear, vertically aligned. The coloured query sits inside the bar on its single underline, and the box header has the old toolbar's height (<code>docs/ui/screens/issue-list.png</code>).</li><li>An error message and the suggestion menu still show under the bar. Mobile (below 768px) still wraps to two rows (bar, then buttons), without extra gaps.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>An integration test for <code>&lt;EzSearch&gt;</code> asserts that the bar's <code>.form-field</code> has no margin and that the bar and the Search button share one row (same top within a few px).</li><li>Other forms using <code>FieldText</code> (e.g. issue create) are unchanged.</li><li>Checked in the browser on the Issue list at desktop width and at 390px, with and without a query.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> the Saved Searches menu alignment (separate issue), long-query behaviour.</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 2</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	4308	2026-11-14	2026-11-07	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Agent Nestor	Agent Agamemnon	6ddd81b76aee-f0ca-80cc-525e8bd7442e	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-07 09:05:32	aprom	0	0
