40335a016af2-9f9a-36e2-25694c670172	Ideas: page, sort, group and search reload only the list, not the whole page	2026-11-09 17:17:52	2026-11-09 19:02:52	0	<p>In the idea browser, changing page, sort, group or search reloads the whole page. Likely cause (confirm first): the list is loaded in the layout route's <code>model()</code> (<code>routes/app/project/idea.js</code>) with <code>refreshModel: true</code> query params, and there is no <code>idea-loading.hbs</code>, so the parent loading screen replaces the content and the open idea page redraws. Move the browser onto the state toolkit (<code>UrlState</code>, <code>ListLoader</code>).</p><ul><li>Route: <code>queryParams</code> from <code>UrlState.queryParamsConfig</code> for <code>query</code>, <code>page</code>, <code>sort</code>, <code>order</code>, <code>group</code>, <code>archived</code> (all <code>refreshModel: false</code>). The route still loads the first page for the initial render, using the controller's shared <code>buildRequest</code>, and seeds the controller's <code>ListLoader</code>; schema and saved searches load as today.</li><li>Controller: a <code>UrlState</code> for those params and a <code>ListLoader</code> for the ideas. Actions (page, sort, group, search apply/clear, saved search pick, archived toggle) call <code>urlState.set(...)</code>; <code>urlState.onChange</code> reloads the list when a param that affects the request changed (grouping by plan status only regroups the loaded page, no fetch). Back/forward and links go through the same path. Reset both on leaving the idea area and on project switch.</li><li>QuickList gets <code>@items</code>/<code>@hasNext</code>/<code>@isLoading</code>/<code>@error</code>/<code>@onRetry</code> from the loader: skeleton rows in the list body only, the header/search/toolbar and the idea page beside it stay put, pager disabled while loading. Hermes idea events call <code>loader.retry()</code> instead of the route's loader closures (remove those closures).</li><li>Acceptance tests: page/sort/group/search/saved-search don't redraw the open idea page (a marker on its DOM survives) and only the list shows loading; back/forward restores the previous page and sort; reload keeps every param; leaving and returning (or switching project) starts from defaults with no previous items shown; a failed load shows the QuickList error with a working retry.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope</strong>: Task Board and Gantt Cal (next phase).</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4425, aprom-4426, aprom-4360, aprom-4361, aprom-4362, aprom-4365</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 7</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4428	2026-11-16	2026-11-09	done	high	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	3b34c2b96af0-b3ed-60c0-369a444a326a	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	2a16a3c66af2-baab-19af-e9d2c44308f8	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-09 19:02:52	aprom	0	0
