966caad268f0-871c-925a-cc2b6385955b	Taskboard Changes	2025-10-16 11:48:38	2025-10-28 09:34:42	0	<h3><strong>Problem Statement</strong></h3>\n<p>Currently, the Taskboard’s milestone section has several usability and functional issues that disrupt the user experience.<br>\nUsers face issues when creating or managing milestones, encounter unexpected UI behaviors (like scroll issues), and experience poor continuity when moving issues across milestones. These gaps make milestone management less efficient and lead to user frustration.</p>\n<h3><strong>Goal / Objective</strong></h3>\n<p>To enhance the milestone management experience on the Taskboard by resolving known usability issues, improving workflow continuity, and empowering users with better milestone control.</p>\n<h3><strong>Scope of Work</strong></h3>\n<p>This Epic covers the following changes and improvements:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Add “Create Milestone” Button:</strong><br>\nAllow users to easily create new milestones directly from the Taskboard view.</li>\n<li><strong>Allow End User to Close Milestone:</strong><br>\nEnable users to close completed milestones without leaving the Taskboard.</li>\n<li><strong>Fix Scroll Bar Issue:</strong><br>\nResolve the initial loading scrollbar glitch in the milestone container for smoother UI rendering.</li>\n<li><strong>Maintain Active Milestone Context:</strong><br>\nWhen an issue is moved from Milestone A to Milestone B, keep the Milestone A tab active to maintain workflow context and prevent UI jumps.</li>\n</ol>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3706	2025-11-20	2025-10-16	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	f79e81a568f0-f6b3-5cb9-e5a2c76ef237	\N	ae4ca1725acb-1902-6b9c-1a5d19be2920	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2025-10-28 09:34:15	aprom	1	0
