ba4ccd746af7-aa50-1f38-a940268bce3c	Attachment drop zone stays on "uploading" after a file that's too large or a failed upload	2026-11-13 21:44:26	2026-11-13 22:19:37	0	<h4>Problem</h4><p>Dropping a file larger than <code>ENV.app.upload.maxFileSize</code> (2 MB) on the issue attachment drop zone shows the size error, but the drop zone then stays on "uploading N files" until the page reloads. Every later upload adds to the count.</p><h4>Cause</h4><ul><li><code>app/utils/upload/issue-attachment-queue.js</code>, <code>uploadTask</code>: the size check calls <code>notifyError</code> and returns. The file is never uploaded and never removed from the ember-file-upload queue. <code>FormFields::FieldUpload</code> shows the "uploading" state as long as <code>queue.files.length</code> &gt; 0.</li><li>On the failure path (the <code>catch</code>), it calls <code>upload.rollback()</code>. Ember Data models have no such method, so the clean-up itself throws and the empty <code>upload</code> record stays in the store.</li></ul><h4>Do</h4><ul><li>Remove the file from its queue (<code>file.queue.remove(file)</code>) on the size-limit path and the failure path.</li><li>Replace <code>upload.rollback()</code> with <code>upload.rollbackAttributes()</code>, which unloads the new record.</li><li>Check the wiki page upload (<code>app/controllers/app/project/wiki/page.js</code>, <code>handleUpload</code>, where <code>//upload.rollback();</code> is commented out) for the same stuck state, and fix it the same way.</li></ul><h4>Tests first</h4><ul><li>A failing test: drop a file over the limit, check the error message, and check the drop zone goes back to its ready state ("drag" text and file input).</li><li>A failing test: the upload request fails with a server error. Check the error message, check the drop zone goes back to ready, and check no new <code>upload</code> record is left in the store.</li></ul><h4>Found during</h4><p>The manual check after the Ember 6.12 upgrade (aprom-4486). This bug was there before the upgrade, not caused by it.</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4545	2026-11-21	2026-11-14	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	70a8ecd06af3-1487-2734-22a7ca0b5d62	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	b30ae3296af7-3652-80a5-1cb3e7a5c9e6	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-13 22:19:37	aprom	0	0
