8f8e17346afb-9e2c-9895-341da616f791	Issue assignee and project manager avatars shrink to fit narrow columns (@minSize)	2026-11-16 19:16:31	2026-11-16 20:14:25	0	<p>The issue details assignee and the project overview manager show a 96px avatar (<code>@size="l"</code>). In narrow views (board quick view, small windows) there is no room for it. Use the avatar's new <code>@minSize</code> so it steps down to ml (64px) or m (40px) when the column is narrow.</p><ul><li><code>components/issue/issue-details.hbs</code> assignee (the flex row from the assignee row fix): <code>@size="l" @minSize="m"</code>; cap the assignee column at 25% of the row (<code>max-width</code> in <code>styles/modules/issue.scss</code>).</li><li><code>templates/app/project/index.hbs</code> manager in <code>.project-manager</code> (after aprom-4612): same row pattern as issue details (flex row, manager column auto width capped at 25%, the project details wrap beside it) and <code>@size="l" @minSize="m"</code>.</li><li>Name and label under the avatar keep wrapping within the column.</li><li>Tests: in a narrow container (e.g. 320px row) the avatar renders m or ml (check <code>data-size</code>), at full page width l; no overlap.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> in the board quick view the assignee avatar is smaller instead of cramped; on the full issue page and project overview it is 96px; nothing overlaps at any width.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4622, aprom-4623, aprom-4612</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 5</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	4624	2026-11-24	2026-11-17	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	69b873786af9-1368-4631-55b621317e73	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Agent Agamemnon	5db690626afb-21a1-948b-59ec5dd8a736	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-16 20:14:25	aprom	0	0
