43cb1f706ad7-63bd-e708-e2f9ba1cdcdc	ai kb: local, incrementally synced issue knowledge base (index + search)	2026-10-20 20:38:27	2026-10-21 13:10:32	0	<p>Agents (Agent Nestor first, and Claude Code in VS Code) need to find related existing issues without listing or reading every issue on every run.</p><ul><li><code>ai kb sync [--project X] [--full]</code>: pulls issues of every project the signed-in user can see into a local SQLite FTS5 index (<code>ai/state/kb.db</code>, git-ignored). Incremental: only issues modified since the last sync of each project; <code>--full</code> rebuilds.</li><li>Stored per issue: number, project, subject, status, type, priority, milestone, parent, assignee, complexity, dates, description and comments as plain text.</li><li><code>ai kb search "&lt;terms&gt;" [--project] [--status] [--limit]</code>: compact ranked hits (number, project, status, subject, snippet). <code>ai kb show &lt;n&gt;</code>: one issue from the index (no API call). <code>ai kb stats</code>: counts and last sync per project.</li><li>Tracker content stays local (dev-tools is a public repo).</li><li>Unit tests with a fake Gaia client; README and command card.</li></ul><p>Blocks the Agent Nestor issue.</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4061	2026-10-28	2026-10-21	done	high	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	7eedd6116ad7-b7ec-4943-1bf14eaae825	\N	a13debc86ad7-404c-ce18-75327b747d1b	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	e04551986ad7-940a-6fc0-98ac36822f04	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-21 13:10:32	adt	0	0
