af32fd796af2-54cf-3ec9-f07adbb78685	Role detail: Role box wastes space; use AppUi::InlineEditable for name and description	2026-11-09 21:44:15	2026-11-09 22:05:24	0	<p>After aprom-4432 the Role box on the role detail page is mostly white space. The name and description are <code>FormFields::FieldText</code>/<code>FieldTextArea</code> with <code>@allowInlineEdit</code>, so they render as full form fields even when only reading: the <code>.form-field</code> margin, a full-width field that pushes the pencil to the far right, and a textarea with placeholder and resize handle. The facts are 18px <code>&lt;h4&gt;</code> headings spread in thirds. Prometheus has the right component for inline editing: <code>AppUi::InlineEditable</code> (<code>components/app-ui/inline-editable.hbs</code>), used on the user profile page (<code>templates/app/user/page.hbs</code> ~l.30-160). The attached screen is a guide for layout and content only; the design system and the existing components decide the final look.</p><ul><li><strong>Name</strong>: <code>&lt;AppUi::InlineEditable&gt;</code> inside an <code>&lt;h3&gt;</code> next to the initials square. <code>&lt;:display&gt;</code> = the name (18px, bold); <code>&lt;:edit as |f|&gt;</code> = <code>FormFields::FieldText</code> exactly as the user page's name (<code>@value={{f.value}}</code>, <code>@onInput={{f.update}}</code>, validation via the role's <code>roleCreate</code> schema, <code>autofocus</code>, <code>f.onKeydown</code>). Wire <code>@onSave</code>, <code>@validate</code>, <code>@message</code>, <code>@onClearMessage</code> with the base create controller's <code>saveModelAttribute</code>/<code>validateInlineField</code>/<code>clearFieldMessage</code>; <code>@aclContext="role.update"</code>.</li><li><strong>Description</strong>: <code>&lt;AppUi::InlineEditable&gt;</code> lined up under the name (indented past the initials). <code>&lt;:display&gt;</code> = plain paragraph; empty state through the component's <code>@label</code>/empty hint ("Add a description"). <code>&lt;:edit&gt;</code> = <code>FormFields::FieldTextArea</code>. <code>@submitOnEnter={{false}}</code> so Enter adds a line.</li><li><strong>Layout</strong>: initials square 48px in the tier colour beside the name; caption "Created … by … · Modified …" (12px grey) under the name; facts (Access labels, Members, Actions granted) on one row under a light <code>#f4f4f4</code> separator, each a 12px grey label above a bold value, with a fixed gap (not spread in thirds). Remove the old <code>editRole</code>/<code>resetModelAttributes</code> wiring and the styles that served the FormFields-in-record layout from <code>styles/modules/role.scss</code>; new rules scoped under <code>.role-record</code>.</li><li>Tests: editing the name and the description saves (check and Enter for the name; check for the description), cancel restores the value, a blank name shows the validation message, no ACL hides the pencil, the empty description shows the hint.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance</strong>: the Role box is about as tall as the attached screen; reading shows plain text with pencils, editing shows the field only while editing.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4434</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 5</p><p><strong>Screens:</strong> role-record-inline.png</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4435	2026-11-17	2026-11-10	done	high	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	3b34c2b96af0-b3ed-60c0-369a444a326a	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	c77aae716af2-54cf-3ec9-1552b02bdfe6	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-09 22:05:24	aprom	0	0
