c1e4b0d06a0c-e2c6-af63-43c00b6c6b09	Implement Inline Skills and Education Addition	2026-05-19 11:34:25	2026-06-01 09:50:59	0	<p>Enhance the profile management experience by allowing users to add <strong>Skills</strong> and <strong>Education</strong> entries inline without navigating away from the current page or opening separate dedicated routes.</p>\n<p>This improvement will streamline profile updates, reduce interaction friction, and provide a faster, more intuitive editing experience for users.</p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<h3><strong>Functional Requirements</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Allow users to add:\n<ul>\n<li>Skills</li>\n<li>Education entries</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Support inline interaction directly within the profile section:\n<ul>\n<li>Inline form expansion</li>\n<li>Editable rows/cards</li>\n<li>Quick add interaction</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Newly added entries should:\n<ul>\n<li>Persist without full-page refresh</li>\n<li>Appear immediately in the UI after successful save</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3893	2026-05-20	2026-05-19	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	8c75ede669f8-20b5-691e-46bc7838c29f	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	014cdf426a14-1625-f3aa-279a6f6ed71d	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-06-01 09:50:59	aprom	0	0
173766606aef-6651-38f6-6a4ea93165a9	Generic module list: ezSearch from the module's search metadata	2026-11-07 12:48:23	2026-11-07 14:33:39	0	<p>The generic admin list (route <code>app.module</code>, path <code>/app/:module</code>, <code>controllers/app/module.js</code> + <code>templates/app/module.hbs</code>) has a jQuery QueryBuilder panel (<code>#builder</code>) that reads <code>views.&lt;Module&gt;.filters</code>. No module declares that key, so the panel can't work today. Under the metadata-driven list-view architecture (<code>docs/architecture/metadata-views/architecture.md</code>, from the search-metadata issue), a list view gets search by declaring <code>views.&lt;Module&gt;.search</code>. This list should do exactly that: show <code>&lt;EzSearch&gt;</code> when the module declares search metadata, and no search when it doesn't. No per-module code.</p><p><strong>Changes</strong></p><ul><li><code>templates/app/module.hbs</code> ~l.19-50: replace the <code>text-field</code> search (<code>populateQuery</code>/<code>openFilters</code>/<code>filter</code>), the <code>toggleFilters</code> button and the <code>.list-view-filters</code> row with <code>#builder</code> with <code>&lt;EzSearch @schema={{this.querySchema}} @query={{this.query}} @onApply={{this.applyQuery}} /&gt;</code>, rendered only when <code>querySchema</code> is set. Generic lists have no saved searches and no Save Search for now.</li><li><code>routes/app/module.js</code> <code>setupController</code>: load <code>query-schema</code> <code>load(this.module)</code> and set <code>controller.querySchema</code> (null when the module has no search metadata). Check <code>isDestroying</code>/<code>isDestroyed</code> after the await if it is done in the controller.</li><li><code>controllers/app/module.js</code>:<ul><li>Add <code>applyQuery(query)</code>: set <code>queryString</code>, reset <code>page</code>, then <code>navigate</code>.</li><li>Remove <code>searchByRules</code>, <code>setupQuery</code>, <code>openFilters</code>, <code>toggleFilters</code>, <code>populateQuery</code> and the imports of the old <code>utils/query/parser</code> and <code>utils/query/builder</code>.</li><li><code>?query=</code> keeps working through <code>navigate</code>.</li></ul></li><li>Acceptance test (<code>tests/acceptance/module/</code> + steps) for a module list that resolves to <code>app.module</code>:<ul><li>With search metadata: the bar shows, a typed query is applied and sent, and an error sends nothing.</li><li>Without search metadata: no search is rendered and the list still pages.</li></ul>If no real module reaches <code>app.module</code> with Mirage, use a test-only metadata fixture and say so in the PR. Don't add search metadata to real modules just for the test.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>The tests above pass.</li><li>No references to <code>utils/query/builder</code>, <code>utils/query/parser</code>, <code>#builder</code> or a <code>filters</code> view key remain in the module list.</li><li>The other lists are unchanged.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> declaring search metadata for more modules, saved searches on generic lists, removing the plugin (separate issue).</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4323</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 6</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4325	2026-11-14	2026-11-07	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	e0bb3e016aef-5fc0-200f-b9571271fe3f	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-07 14:33:39	aprom	0	0
