p the <code>.search</code> block (<code>document.scss</code> ~l.329): the ezSearch toolbar uses it.</li><li>Search the app for any remaining reference (<code>queryBuilder</code>, <code>query-builder</code>, <code>getRules</code>, <code>metadata.filters</code>, <code>.list-view-filters</code>) and remove it.</li><li>Update <code>docs/architecture/metadata-views/architecture.md</code> if it still mentions the old plugin. The generated YUIDoc in <code>docs/</code> is left as is.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>The app builds without the two packages.</li><li>No source references to the plugin or the deleted files remain.</li><li>The full test suite passes, including the Issue, Project and generic list ezSearch acceptance tests.</li><li>Issue list, Project list and a generic module list checked in the browser: no console errors.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> board, Gantt and calendar search (later phase), regenerating YUIDoc.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4324, aprom-4325</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 10</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4326	2026-11-14	2026-11-07	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	0fe5a8066aef-5582-619b-f64f769b11f7	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-07 17:26:36	aprom	0	0
