e7dd37086aef-1001-619b-115ff589ec37	Agents list: replace jQuery QueryBuilder with ezSearch	2026-11-07 14:47:03	2026-11-07 16:46:25	0	<p>The Agents list is one of the two remaining jQuery QueryBuilder users that block its removal (aprom-4326). Move it to <code>&lt;EzSearch&gt;</code> the metadata-driven way (<code>docs/architecture/metadata-views/architecture.md</code>): its search fields are declared in view metadata, not in the controller, and the saved-search handling comes from <code>controllers/prometheus/list.js</code> (base-class issue this one depends on).</p><p><strong>Changes</strong></p><ul><li><code>app/utils/metadata/metadata.js</code>: add <code>views.Agent.search</code> in the format of <code>views.Project.search</code>, covering today's filters in <code>controllers/app/agent/index.js</code> ~l.22-41:<ul><li>module <code>Agent</code>, text field <code>Agent.name</code>;</li><li><code>Agent.name</code> and <code>Agent.purpose</code> as text (labels <code>views.app.agent.list.name</code> / <code>.purpose</code>);</li><li><code>sponsor.name</code> as a user field with source <code>users</code> (label <code>views.app.agent.list.sponsor</code>);</li><li>aliases name, purpose, sponsor.</li></ul></li><li><code>templates/app/agent/index.hbs</code> ~l.15-50: replace the Saved Searches dropdown, the readonly <code>FieldText</code> (<code>openFilters</code>), Search (<code>searchByRules</code>), Clear (<code>clearSearch</code>) and <code>{{query-builder module="agent"}}</code> with <code>&lt;EzSearch @schema @query @savedSearches={{this.ezSavedSearches}} @activeSavedSearchId={{this.searchId}} @onSavedSearchChange={{this.selectSavedSearch}} @onApply={{this.applyQuery}} @aclContext="agent.read" /&gt;</code>. No <code>@onSave</code>: the list has no Save Search today.</li><li><code>routes/app/agent/index.js</code>: load <code>query-schema</code> <code>load('Agent')</code> next to the saved searches (~l.62) and set <code>controller.querySchema</code>.</li><li><code>controllers/app/agent/index.js</code>: remove <code>metadata.filters</code> and override <code>savedSearchContext()</code> (<code>relatedTo: 'agent'</code>, or whatever the route's saved-search query uses).</li><li>Mirage: record the last <code>query</code> param of the agent list request, as aprom-4305 did for issues.</li><li>Tests: update <code>tests/acceptance/agents/agents-list.feature</code> and its steps, and add scenarios:<ol><li>Type and run a query (e.g. <code>sponsor in hammad</code>): the formatted query shows and is sent.</li><li>Accept a suggestion with the keyboard.</li><li>Load a saved search: the bar shows it and <code>searchId</code> is in the URL.</li><li>An error is shown and nothing is sent.</li></ol></li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>The scenarios pass.</li><li>The other agent tests (catalog, create, detail, activation and mass actions) pass.</li><li>Checked in the browser at desktop width and at 390px.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> a Save Search button on this list, the Workflows list, removing the plugin (aprom-4326).</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4327</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 7</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4328	2026-11-14	2026-11-07	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	367166436aef-85b6-7072-60a93dfd8558	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-07 16:46:02	aprom	0	0
