y={{this.applyQuery}} @aclContext="workflow.read" /&gt;</code>. No <code>@onSave</code>: the list has no Save Search today.</li><li><code>routes/app/workflow/index.js</code>: load <code>query-schema</code> <code>load('Workflow')</code> next to the saved searches (~l.67) and set <code>controller.querySchema</code>.</li><li><code>controllers/app/workflow/index.js</code>: remove <code>metadata.filters</code> and override <code>savedSearchContext()</code> (<code>relatedTo: 'workflow'</code>, or whatever the route's saved-search query uses).</li><li>Mirage: record the last <code>query</code> param of the workflow list request, as aprom-4305 did for issues.</li><li>Tests: update <code>tests/acceptance/workflows/workflows-list.feature</code> and its steps, and add scenarios:<ol><li>Type <code>status:act</code>, press Enter: <code>(Workflow.status : Active)</code> shows and is sent.</li><li>Accept a suggestion with the keyboard.</li><li>Load a saved search: the bar shows it and <code>searchId</code> is in the URL.</li><li>An error (<code>status:zzz</code>) is shown and nothing is sent.</li></ol></li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>The scenarios pass.</li><li>The other workflow tests (editor, runs) pass.</li><li>Checked in the browser at desktop width and at 390px.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> a Save Search button on this list, the Agents list, removing the plugin (aprom-4326).</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4327</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 7</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4329	2026-11-14	2026-11-07	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	40bb72916aef-85b6-7072-8a6a462b08bb	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-07 17:04:12	aprom	0	0
