078f45026aef-f4f7-a72a-3ec54cb7b8a8	ezSearch: show the active saved search's name and an edited state with Update, Save as new and Revert	2026-11-07 17:51:03	2026-11-07 18:59:59	0	<p>When a saved search is applied, people should see which one it is, and changing it should not silently drop it. Today (aprom-4304) the mark is dropped as soon as an edited query is applied. New behaviour, agreed with the engineer from screen <code>compact-edited</code>:</p><ul><li>the Saved Searches button shows the active search's name;</li><li>after the query changes it shows "&lt;name&gt; · edited";</li><li>its menu offers Update "&lt;name&gt;", Save as new search… and Revert to saved.</li></ul><p>This goes in the shared base (<code>app/components/ez-search/base.js</code>, previous issue) so <code>&lt;EzSearch&gt;</code> gets it now and <code>&lt;EzSearchCompact&gt;</code> gets it with no extra work. <strong>About the attached screens:</strong> they are a rough guide to layout and content, rendered with only today's CSS, not the final look; the design system and the real components win.</p><p><strong>Changes</strong></p><ul><li>Base:<ul><li>Track whether the current tree differs from the active saved search's query (compare the serialized forms).</li><li>Keep the active search while edited.</li><li>Revert loads the saved query. Picking another search or Clear ends the edited state.</li><li>New optional <code>@onUpdateSavedSearch(search, query)</code>: Update calls it, and Save as new calls <code>@onSave(query)</code> as today.</li><li>The menu entries only show when the related callback is given.</li></ul>Update the base's YUIDoc argument list.</li><li><code>app/components/ez-search/index.hbs</code>: the Saved Searches button shows the active name (truncated with an ellipsis and a <code>title</code> tooltip) and "edited". The menu gets the three entries above the list, with the active search checked.</li><li>New <code>app/services/saved-search.js</code>: the store calls for saved searches (load by <code>relatedTo</code> and optional <code>projectId</code> for the current user, create, update <code>searchquery</code>). <code>controllers/prometheus/list.js</code> (aprom-4327) delegates to it, so controllers that don't extend the list controller (the idea browser, next issues) can reuse it. Add <code>updateEzSavedSearch(search, query)</code> to <code>list.js</code>.</li><li>Issue and Project list templates pass <code>@onUpdateSavedSearch={{this.updateEzSavedSearch}}</code>. Agents and Workflows keep no save.</li><li>Strings go in <code>translations/en-us.json</code> under <code>components.ezSearch.savedSearch.*</code>.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>Integration tests for the name, the edited marker, Update, Save as new, Revert, and leaving the edited state via another search or Clear.</li><li>A unit test for the service.</li><li>An acceptance scenario on the Issue list: apply a saved search, change it, Update, reload, and see the updated query.</li><li>Existing tests pass. Where an aprom-4304 test expected the mark to drop, update it to the new behaviour.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> renaming or deleting saved searches, the compact component.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4330, aprom-4327</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 10</p><p><strong>Screens:</strong> compact-edited.png</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4331	2026-11-14	2026-11-07	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	e16a47936aef-ac86-e044-7bab7f22408d	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-07 18:59:59	aprom	0	0
5d00a3266af2-3028-5ed1-7257dab691fe	Threads: limited Activity box in the thread info column	2026-11-09 23:21:01	2026-11-10 13:40:29	0	<p>Show a short history of a thread in the info column, last box, on both room types. The attached screens are a guide for layout and content only.</p><ul><li>Data: Activity rows with <code>relatedTo conversationroom</code> and the room id (Gaia request in this plan), newest 5, "Show more" for the rest. Only the kinds Gaia records: started the thread/vote, edited subject/description, linked/changed/cleared issue.</li><li>Rendering: date (DD MMM, time for today) + sentence ("Rana Nouman edited the description"), reusing the existing activity rendering/translations where they fit (e.g. the activities box from aprom-4242).</li><li>Live: reload on the room's update events.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> Mirage + integration test for the box (limit, sentence per kind). <strong>Out of scope:</strong> comments/votes in activity.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4442, agaia-4443</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 5</p><p><strong>Screens:</strong> threads-list.png, threads-vote.png</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4444	2026-11-17	2026-11-10	done	low	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	016ffdb66af2-3028-5ed1-e8572ffabaa7	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	f2d40ca96af3-5574-c5b6-481423c0c5af	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-10 13:40:29	aprom	0	0
