ffcd47c66ace-46f4-83ee-fc585a733d43	PATCH returns HTTP 200 when the model rejects the change	2026-10-13 18:18:39	2026-10-15 14:53:34	0	<p><strong>What happens:</strong> when a model refuses a PATCH (validation message, behavior returning false), <code data-tomark-pass="">RestController::patchAction()</code> returns <code data-tomark-pass="">{"status":"ERROR","messages":[...]}</code> with <strong>HTTP 200</strong>. <code data-tomark-pass="">postAction()</code> uses 422 for the same situation.</p>\n<p><strong>Impact:</strong> clients that check the status code treat a failed save as success (e.g. Prometheus would show "saved"). Found while testing <code data-tomark-pass="">/api/v1/setting</code> (agaia-3958): changing a fixed field returns 200 with status ERROR.</p>\n<p><strong>Expected:</strong> 422 Unprocessable Entity, like POST. Check Prometheus adapters/handlers that may rely on the current 200.</p>\n<p><strong>Complexity</strong>: simple</p>\n	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	1	1	1	3969	2026-10-20	2026-10-13	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	92ae09c66ace-1e5c-2b63-d1da9630092c	\N	cb9597e45acd-06d6-1141-34137d85f7a9	Agent Odysseus	Hammad Hassan	dabf4df56ad0-0c53-8847-cc56c52d0283	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-15 14:53:34	agaia	0	0
