f9c6d8286aeb-ef61-c1c6-2b1f6c131ee4	Workflow editor: show the 'Milestone completed' trigger and test-run a milestone	2026-11-04 20:13:45	2026-11-04 21:42:19	0	<p>Gaia adds a 'Milestone completed' workflow trigger (listed by <code>GET /workflowevent</code>) so a workflow can start an agent when a milestone is completed. The editor from aprom-4038 and 4057 keeps its own <code>catalog.js</code> copy of Gaia's node kinds and triggers (noted on aprom-4038), and its test run may only pick issues.</p><p><strong>Changes</strong></p><ul><li>Check where the palette and the trigger form get their triggers. If they're hard-coded, add <code>milestone.completed</code> (label 'Milestone completed', module Milestone). Better: take the triggers from the cached <code>workflowevent</code> catalog so later triggers need no UI change.</li><li>The properties panel's field and expression pickers offer the milestone's fields (from the trigger catalog's payload paths).</li><li>Test run: when the trigger's module is Milestone, the record picker lists the scope's milestones (<code>FormFields::FieldRelate</code>, searchable), and the run posts <code>entityType</code> Milestone with the milestone's id.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>A workflow with the Milestone completed trigger and a Run agent step can be built, saved, activated and test-run against a milestone.</li><li>Mirage handlers and an integration or acceptance test cover the trigger and the milestone picker.</li></ul><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> agaia-4271</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 6</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	4273	2026-11-12	2026-11-05	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Agent Agamemnon	2666dbc96aeb-f308-85f1-94