e>searchId</code> to <code>queryParams</code> (next to <code>view</code>) and to <code>linkQuery</code>, so the search stays when another idea is opened.</li><li>Apply, saved-search select, save and update use the saved-search service. Don't copy the list controller's code.</li><li><code>reloadIdeas</code> (Hermes reloads) keeps the active query.</li><li>While a search is active, matching archived ideas are listed after the open ones with their Archived label and the "Show archived" footer is hidden; without a search the list behaves as today.</li></ul></li><li><code>templates/app/project/idea.hbs</code>: the header shows "Ideas &lt;count&gt;" or "Ideas &lt;n&gt; of &lt;total&gt;" while searching, and <code>&lt;EzSearchCompact&gt;</code> sits in a <code>box-body</code> above the list. Keep the save dialog in the page, as on the Issue list.</li><li>Mirage: the idea handler records the last <code>query</code> param.</li><li>Acceptance (<code>tests/acceptance/idea/</code> + steps):<ol><li>Type and run a query: the list is requested with it and the count shows "n of total".</li><li>Remove a chip: it re-runs.</li><li>Apply a saved search: its name shows. Change it: "edited" shows. Update it.</li><li>Open another idea: the search stays.</li><li>An error shows and nothing is sent.</li></ol></li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>The scenarios pass.</li><li>The existing idea tests (create, page, plan review, live updates, collapse) pass.</li><li>Checked in the browser at desktop width and at 390px.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> searching message text, Mine, sorting, tags/categories, richer rows, plan progress as a search field.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4333</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 9</p><p><strong>Screens:</strong> compact-multirow.png, compact-edited.png, compact-mobile.png</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb70