b744f7516aef-0204-aab1-4f5985d08826	Build: remove the leftover doT import that breaks ember build -prod since the QueryBuilder removal	2026-11-07 19:53:27	2026-11-07 20:14:09	0	<p>Every "Deploy Prometheus | OVH" run has failed since PR #648 (aprom-4326, remove the jQuery QueryBuilder) merged on 2026-11-07 (e.g. run 42396328641 and the PRs for 4332, 4330, 4331, 4333, 4334). The Docker build stops in <code>ember build -prod</code> with <code>Cannot find module 'dot/package.json' from '/prometheus/temp'</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Cause:</strong> <code>ember-cli-build.js</code> still has <code>app.import("node_modules/dot/doT.min.js")</code>. <code>dot</code> (doT.js) was never in <code>package.json</code>; npm only installed it as a dependency of <code>jQuery-QueryBuilder</code>. With the plugin removed, a fresh <code>npm install</code> no longer installs <code>dot</code>, so the import fails. Nothing else in the app uses doT.</p>\n<h4>Change</h4>\n<ul><li><code>ember-cli-build.js</code>: remove the <code>doT.min.js</code> import.</li></ul>\n<h4>Acceptance criteria</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>A clean install (no <code>node_modules/dot</code>) followed by <code>ember build -prod</code> succeeds.</li>\n<li>The "Deploy Prometheus | OVH" workflow passes on the PR.</li>\n</ul><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	4335	2026-11-15	2026-11-08	done	high	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Agent Achilles	Agent Agamemnon	fa953cc46aef-89d1-170c-e07de1d73f80	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-07 20:14:09	aprom	0	0
