9b66cd586ace-34bf-02fa-581aac77363c	Settings: Email page (SMTP settings and test email)	2026-10-13 17:38:35	2026-10-19 18:27:15	0	<p>Lets admins configure outgoing mail.</p><p><strong>Scope</strong></p><ul><li><code>box-primary</code> "Outgoing mail (SMTP)": host, port, encryption (power-select), username, password, from name, from email, using <code>FormFields::*</code> with validation.</li><li>Password field is write-only: shows that a password is saved; blank keeps it.</li><li><code>box-info</code> "Send a test email" with recipient (defaults to the current user) and a <code>btn-default</code> button; shows success or the SMTP error via the notifications service.</li><li><code>box-default</code> "Emails sent by the system" (welcome / account password, reset password).</li><li>Save / Cancel below the boxes; navigation guard for unsaved changes.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>Saving updates the settings; reloading shows the saved values; the password is never displayed.</li><li>Test email reports success and failure correctly.</li></ul><p><strong>Tests</strong></p><ul><li>Gherkin feature in <code>tests/acceptance/settings/</code> with <code>@setupApplicationTest</code>, default scenario plus a details table for the data it needs, steps in <code>tests/acceptance/steps/settings/</code> registered in <code>steps.js</code>, Mirage factory + route handler. Scenarios: load, save, validation errors, test email success and failure.</li></ul><p><strong>Depends on</strong></p><ul><li>#3963 (settings shell)</li><li>#3958 and #3959 (A Gaia)</li></ul><p><em>Mockups:</em> attached in Files. Source: <code>dev-tools/mockups/settings/</code> (built from the real Prometheus CSS and shell; the footer position in the mockups is not part of the design).</p>	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	1	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	1	3964	2026-10-20	2026-10-13	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	6ba71de26ace-1e5