05f360e069f8-1760-c6b9-f5fcf996d2f9	Display lastActivityAt and dateJoined in User Management UI	2026-05-04 12:16:06	2026-05-05 10:42:19	0	<p>Update the User Management interface to display the newly added <b data-tomark-pass=""><code data-backticks="1">lastActivityAt</code></b> and <b data-tomark-pass=""><code data-backticks="1">dateJoined</code></b> fields for each user.</p>\n<p>These fields will provide admins with better visibility into user lifecycle and engagement by showing when a user joined the platform and their most recent activity. The UI should present this information in a clear, readable, and consistent format aligned with existing design patterns.</p>\n<h3><strong>UI Behavior</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b data-tomark-pass=""><code data-backticks="1">dateJoined</code></b>\n<ul>\n<li>Format: <code data-backticks="1">DD MMM 'YY</code></li>\n<li>Example: <code data-backticks="1">04 May '26</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><b data-tomark-pass=""><code data-backticks="1">lastActivityAt</code></b>\n<ul>\n<li>Display in <strong>humanized format</strong></li>\n<li>Examples:\n<ul>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">2 mins ago</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">3 hours ago</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">Yesterday</code></li>\n<li><code data-backticks="1">5 days ago</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3879	2026-05-05	2026-05-04	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	93e3874569d7-815e-6200-b21c86725458	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	12200e6569f8-20b5-691e-69bfb3e76380	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-05-05 10:42:18	aprom	0	0
