0819e5b5678e-5527-319f-24edc1a97597	Add pencil icon on project's member to edit membership	2025-01-20 13:22:16	2025-02-14 18:13:48	0	<p><strong>Description</strong>:<br>\nAdd a pencil icon next to each project member in the UI to allow editing of their membership details.</p>\n<p><strong>Purpose</strong>:<br>\nThis feature will improve usability by enabling users to quickly edit the membership details of project members directly from the project's page.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Display a pencil icon adjacent to each member's name in the <strong>project members' list</strong>.</li>\n<li>On clicking the icon:\n<ul>\n<li>Open an <strong>Edit Membership Modal</strong>.</li>\n<li>Pre-fill the modal with the selected member's current details.</li>\n<li>Allow updating fields such as role given to the member, or other editable attributes.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pencil icon is visible next to each member in the list.</li>\n<li>Clicking the icon opens the Edit Membership modal.</li>\n<li>The modal is pre-filled with the correct member details.</li>\n<li>Updates made in the modal are saved and reflected immediately in the UI.</li>\n<li>The feature is responsive and works across all supported devices and browsers.</li>\n<li>Acceptance test cases are added for the new functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3515	2025-01-21	2025-01-20	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	d887604167a0-5985-d8e3-056674b53f37	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2025-02-14 18:13:48	aprom	0	0
08678e806798-f2d2-e684-2c4029d0cdb2	Route using query params not working as expected	2025-01-28 07:23:52	2025-01-28 14:41:19	0	<p>It works perfectly when routing a specific route without using query parameters. After using query params inside that route, using button click (for pagination), the route is working as expected but when we directly add query params inside the URL and do a full page reload it shows the error as below:<br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<pre><code>router.js:993 Uncaught TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'name')\n    at Class._queryParamsFor (router.js:993:1)\n    at Class.finalizeQueryParamChange (route.js:1863:1)\n    at Class.triggerEvent (router.js:1453:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.triggerEvent (router.js:270:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.finalizeQueryParamChange (router_js.js:1953:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.queryParamsTransition (router_js.js:1448:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.getTransitionByIntent (router_js.js:1520:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.transitionByIntent (router_js.js:1469:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.doTransition (router_js.js:1605:1)\n    at PrivateRouter.transitionTo (router_js.js:2077:1)\n</code></pre>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Current Behavior:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Route using query params using full page reload removes the query params from the URL and shows the error as shown in the image above.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Expected Behavior:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>User should be routed to a specific route and query params should work as expected without causing any error.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Steps to Reproduce:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Signin to application</li>\n<li>Now use the URL&nbsp;<a href="http://prom.projects4.me/app/project/aprom/issue?page=2">http://prom.projects4.me/app/project/aprom/issue?page=2</a>&nbsp;and make a full page reload.</li>\n<li>Query params will be removed and the user will see an error as stated above.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Reference Links:</strong><br>\n<a href="https://github.com/emberjs/ember.js/issues/17118">https://github.com/emberjs/ember.js/issues/17118</a></p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3521	2025-01-29	2025-01-28	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	10c7a2216788-d753-eb27-75c3c2c13446	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2025-01-28 14:44:54	aprom	0	0
