3930d58668f0-9cba-eaeb-4f439e2e9e5c	Implement Auto-Open for Weekly Conversations	2025-10-16 12:51:05	2025-11-04 07:03:10	0	Modify the Weekly Conversations widget to automatically expand conversations when the Dashboard loads. Update the EmberJS component to set conversations to an expanded state by default, removing the need for users to manually click to open them. This involves updating the component's initialization logic and possibly modifying the conversation item templates to display in expanded state.\n<hr>\n<div>\n<strong>Test Cases (2):</strong>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Conversations auto-expand on dashboard load</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given I am on the Dashboard page\nWhen the page loads completely\nThen the Weekly Conversations widget should be visible\nAnd all conversations should be automatically expanded\nAnd conversation content should be immediately visible without clicking</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Auto-expanded conversations display correct content</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given the Dashboard has loaded with auto-expanded conversations\nWhen I view the Weekly Conversations widget\nThen each expanded conversation should show its full content\nAnd conversation metadata should be properly displayed\nAnd no manual interaction should be required to view conversation details</pre></div>\n<br>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3719	2025-11-28	2025-10-16	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	f79e81a568f0-f6b3-5cb9-e5a2c76ef237	be4df81768f0-3892-adb3-2af50c7985f8	ae5a3c325acb-1902-6b9c-e93d4161f6f9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	681eb1996905-230f-b68d-19c856d2f021	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2025-11-04 07:03:10	aprom	0	0
395bbe296917-b6c3-29af-1ef5a729a88c	Implement conversation filtering system	2025-11-14 10:45:13	2026-03-04 10:13:20	0	<p>Add filtering capabilities to the conversations list. Allow users to filter by status, participants, date range, watched status, and other relevant criteria to help users find specific conversations quickly.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Test Cases (3):</strong><br>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span data-tomark-pass="">Filter conversations by status</span><br>\n<strong>Test Case:</strong><br>\n<code class="issue-plan-test-case-pre" data-te-codeblock="" data-tomark-pass="">Feature: Filter Conversations<br>\nScenario: Filter by conversation status<br>\nGiven I am on the conversations page<br>\nWhen I select a specific status filter<br>\nThen only conversations with that status should be displayed<br>\nAnd the filter should be visually indicated as active</code><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span data-tomark-pass="">Filter conversations by participants</span><br>\n<strong>Test Case:</strong><br>\n<code class="issue-plan-test-case-pre" data-te-codeblock="" data-tomark-pass="">Feature: Filter Conversations<br>\nScenario: Filter by participants<br>\nGiven I am on the conversations page<br>\nWhen I filter by specific participants<br>\nThen only conversations involving those participants should show<br>\nAnd the participant filter should be clearly displayed</code><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span data-tomark-pass="">Multiple filters work together</span><br>\n<strong>Test Case:</strong><br>\n<code class="issue-plan-test-case-pre" data-te-codeblock="" data-tomark-pass="">Feature: Filter Conversations<br>\nScenario: Apply multiple filters simultaneously<br>\nGiven I am on the conversations page<br>\nWhen I apply multiple filters<br>\nThen only conversations matching all criteria should be shown<br>\nAnd I should be able to clear individual filters</co