45c4097768f0-cd3e-08bc-38c092e6add9	Handle Modal Close During Loading	2025-10-16 13:08:21	2025-11-04 07:00:07	0	Implement functionality to detect when the Issue Planning modal is closed while AI plan generation is in progress and automatically cancel the ongoing API request. This includes hooking into EmberJS component lifecycle methods and ensuring proper cleanup.\n<hr>\n<div>\n<strong>Test Cases (3):</strong>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Cancel request on modal close</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Feature: Modal Close Handling\n  Scenario: Cancel API request when modal is closed during loading\n    Given the Issue Planning modal is open\n    And an AI plan generation request is in progress\n    When the user closes the modal\n    Then the ongoing API request should be cancelled\n    And the loading state should be reset\n    And no memory leaks should occur</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Normal modal close without loading</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Feature: Modal Close Handling\n  Scenario: Normal modal close when not loading\n    Given the Issue Planning modal is open\n    And no API request is in progress\n    When the user closes the modal\n    Then the modal should close normally\n    And no cancellation should be triggered\n    And the component should be destroyed properly</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Modal close after request completion</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Feature: Modal Close Handling\n  Scenario: Close modal after request completes\n    Given the Issue Planning modal is open\n    And an AI plan generation request has completed\n    When the user closes the modal\n    Then the modal should close normally\n    And no cancellation should be attempted\n    And all resources should be cleaned up</pre></div>\n<br>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	3724	2025-11-28	2025-10-16	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	f79e81a568f0-f6b3-5cb9-e5a2c76ef237	7193b6d168f0-1c6a-eaeb-889449c975dd	ae5a3c325acb-1902-6b9c-e93d4161f6f9	Rana Nouman	Hammad Hassan	dd8e1b016904-9b63-9ee5-15abe00130c4	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2025-11-04 07:00:07	aprom	0	0
