471cd582643d-1f0f-b46a-9f8587728f0d	User image not displaying in issue ticket | Taskboard 	2023-04-17 08:16:07	2023-04-17 11:08:00	0	<p><strong>RCA:</strong><br>\nAs we're fetching issues against each milestone in <strong>Taskboard</strong>.&nbsp;But when fetching assignee image from our API we need assignee id as well its name to be used in&nbsp;<strong>alt</strong>&nbsp;of &lt;<strong>img/&gt;</strong>&nbsp;tag.<br>\nSo, Basically we need to fetch <strong>assignedTo</strong> relationship of every issues. Which is not possible when we fetch issues using&nbsp;<strong>milestone</strong>&nbsp;API, as&nbsp;<strong>assignedTo</strong>&nbsp;is a 2nd level relationship.</p>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<pre><code>milestone ==&gt; issue(1st level) ==&gt; assignedTo(2nd level)\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>Solution:</strong> As our API currently not support 2nd level relationship, so we have to fetch milestones first and then fetch issues with&nbsp;<strong>assignedTo</strong>&nbsp;relationship.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3308	2023-04-17	2023-04-17	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	58356343643c-0ffe-ba25-de5a9c658c7b	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2023-04-17 11:50:40	aprom	0	0
