6bc73d466772-26b7-8df7-6a638b1fd5f5	Fully Rely on yup	2024-12-30 13:51:39	2024-12-31 11:46:23	0	<p>Currently, the frontend uses a custom implementation to handle password validation, especially for matching the <strong>password</strong> and <strong>confirmPassword</strong> fields while creating user model. This custom logic adds unnecessary complexity to our validation code. Instead, we should use the validation capabilities provided by <strong>Yup</strong>&nbsp;and add customizations related to the metadata. This will make us fully rely on <strong>metadata</strong>&nbsp;and on&nbsp;<strong>Yup</strong>&nbsp;APIs.</p>\n<p><strong>Implementation:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove unnecessary code related to actual and dependent fields from .js and .hbs files.</li>\n<li>Remove <strong>validateDependentField</strong> function.</li>\n<li>Handle translated error in a more generic way e.g. error of type <strong>oneOf</strong>&nbsp;should be handle by the key passed from the metadata:</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code>validations: {\ndefault: {\ntype: "string",\nrules: [\n{\nname: "required"\n},\n{\nname: 'oneOf',\nvalue: [\n[ref('password')],\n'passwordMustMatch' // Translation key\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>or go with some other method to handle translations.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>update the <strong>setValidationMessages</strong> method and update the message with appropriate translations against the error type.</li>\n<li>Add more customization in&nbsp;<strong>generate-schema</strong> utility to pass multiple args to the schema method e.g. Schema.required().test(value1,value2,value3)</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3495	2024-12-30	2024-12-30	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	34bf8786676d-1d90-1099-1606e8583b8a	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50e