7f4758f76749-82a8-e347-392bc09c213c	Make SMTP credentials part of environment not script	2024-11-29 07:17:19	2024-11-29 09:40:51	0	<p>There is a bug triggered by GitGuardian that detects SMTP credentials directly injected into the script which ideally is not a secure practice to do and&nbsp;poses security risks and makes configuration changes more cumbersome.</p>\n<p><strong>Implementation:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Move SMTP credentials into environment variables (preferably .env file or system environment).</li>\n<li>Modifiy the PHP code to fetch these credentials from the environment instead of the script.</li>\n<li>Ensure that the application can read and use these credentials securely at runtime.</li>\n<li>R&amp;D on how to make this part of each release of Gaia and locally.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>All SMTP credentials should not be present in the script files.</li>\n<li>The credentials should be moved from the script to the environment.</li>\n<li>After the refactor, the backend application should continue to send emails via SMTP without any changes in functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3486	2024-11-29	2024-11-29	done	high	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	29393e98671f-f433-141c-87c17da1ce69	\N	cb9597e45acd-06d6-1141-34137d85f7a9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2024-11-29 09:40:51	agaia	0	0
