83eafd926878-4378-2661-da52fa5cbc49	Hover Preview Popover for Linked Entities	2025-07-17 11:50:27	2025-07-17 11:50:27	0	<p>Enhance the user experience by enabling an informational popover on hover for entity links (e.g., tasks, milestones, users).</p>\n<p><strong>Behavior:</strong><br>\nWhen a user hovers over an entity link (e.g., issue title, milestone, user name) for approximately <strong>3 seconds</strong> (<code data-backticks="1">3000ms</code>), a <strong>popover</strong> will appear near the cursor or the link element.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The popover will <strong>display a concise summary view</strong> of the hovered entity, fetched asynchronously.</li>\n<li>The popover will disappear when:</li>\n<li>The mouse moves away from the link or the popover, or</li>\n<li>The user clicks elsewhere on the screen.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Popover Content Examples:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For a Task: Title, Status, Assigned User, Due Date</li>\n<li>For a Milestone: Title, Start/End Dates, Completion %</li>\n<li>For a User: Name, Role, Current Assignments Count</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delay of 3 seconds ensures reduced UI noise from accidental hovers.</li>\n<li>The preview should not block navigation or break keyboard accessibility.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<img src="https://sdmntprwestus3.oaiusercontent.com/files/00000000-c9a4-61fd-98b1-dd6a1f293beb/raw?se=2025-07-17T12%3A39%3A20Z&amp;sp=r&amp;sv=2024-08-04&amp;sr=b&amp;scid=7bc0476f-eda2-5141-98a1-4dd089f0edfd&amp;skoid=e9d2f8b1-028a-4cff-8eb1-d0e66fbefcca&amp;sktid=a48cca56-e6da-484e-a814-9c849652bcb3&amp;skt=2025-07-17T04%3A20%3A57Z&amp;ske=2025-07-18T04%3A20%3A57Z&amp;sks=b&amp;skv=2024-08-04&amp;sig=Vz/hWqSXBdf%2Bl5059UsGUZv%2BKNdi5Cx0/BzPBzO28xo%3D" alt=""></p>\n	1	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	1	3655	2025-12-31	2025-09-01	new	low	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729		\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Hammad Hassan	Hammad Hassan	\N	5ff1668262c6-8aad-