8b85fc416570-7c18-dfe0-cbe765d5a694	Rerendering of issues in board with wrong count	2023-12-06 10:06:03	2023-12-07 09:48:48	0	<p><strong>Root Cause:</strong><br>\nAssume user is redirected to a project having <strong>107</strong> issues and all of these issues are for <strong>milestone A</strong>. When User navigates from <strong>project/index</strong> route to <strong>board</strong>, then <strong>milestone A</strong> section is rendered because store already has <strong>107</strong> issues and after the XHR fetch call in <strong>board.js route</strong> for the milestone A issues, that milestone A section is again rendered.</p>\n<p>Firstly I'm giving any sort of limit to the following call in <strong>board.js</strong> route, that's why <strong>milestone A</strong> section in <strong>board</strong> template renders <strong>107</strong> issues and after that <strong>21</strong> issues.<br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""></p>\n<pre><code>let issues = await _self.store.query('issue', {\nquery: `(Issue.milestoneId : ${milestone.id} )`,\nrels: 'assignedTo',\n});\n</code></pre>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\n<strong>Solution:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Firstly apply limit -1 to the above call and to get all issues of&nbsp;<strong>milestone A.</strong></li>\n<li>Unload issues from the store while exiting from the route in <strong>project/index</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3366	2023-12-06	2023-12-06	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	af0819336564-7c69-418e-63882289a2e8	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2023-12-07 09:48:48	aprom	0	0
