a060d1366953-4a0e-1f61-fdb2e5c7d4a2	Implement search functionality for issues in list section	2025-12-30 06:43:44	2026-01-26 11:07:53	0	Add a search field that allows users to search issues by issue number, subject, description, priority, and assigned user. The search should be a simple text field that filters the issue list in real-time as the user types.\n<hr>\n<div>\n<strong>Test Cases (4):</strong>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Search by issue number</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given the Gantt chart list section is displayed\nWhen I enter an issue number in the search field\nThen only issues matching that number should be displayed</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Search by subject</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given the Gantt chart list section is displayed\nWhen I enter text matching an issue subject\nThen only issues with subjects containing that text should be displayed</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Search by description</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given the Gantt chart list section is displayed\nWhen I enter text that exists in issue descriptions\nThen only issues with descriptions containing that text should be displayed</pre></div>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n<strong>Scenario:</strong> <span>Search by assigned user</span>\n</div>\n<div><strong>Test Case:</strong> <pre class="issue-plan-test-case-pre">Given the Gantt chart list section is displayed\nWhen I enter an assigned user name\nThen only issues assigned to that user should be displayed</pre></div>\n<br>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3776	2026-01-16	2025-12-30	new	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	\N	5a336504693a-136a-d633-5d74fdcbc2e1	ae5a3c325acb-1902-6b9c-e93d4161f6f9