9d8f53a4677f-08fb-4613-3f6cac7cabb6	Convert case insensitive URL to lowercase and redirect user to the URL	2025-01-09 09:57:49	2025-01-09 10:51:48	0	<p>According to W3 org standards, url can have multiple things in a case-insensitive format e.g. <strong>Scheme</strong> (HTTP),&nbsp;<strong>Host</strong> (domain name), etc. whereas <strong>Path</strong>&nbsp;and other things like <strong>Query parameters</strong>&nbsp;are case sensitive.</p>\n<p>So what we want is to convert the path from uppercase to lowercase to make our application work smoothly. For example, if the user unintentionally types <strong>/APP</strong> route, even if that route exists in our application, ember will treat this as case sensitive and throw an error of route not available. To make the user experience better we need to convert this path to <strong>/app</strong>&nbsp;and enable users to use the application efficiently.</p>\n<p>In case of route is not available, like <strong>/APPIT, the</strong>&nbsp;user will be redirected to the&nbsp;<strong>not-found</strong> route.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3497	2025-01-09	2025-01-08	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	34bf8786676d-1d90-1099-1606e8583b8a	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2025-01-09 10:51:48	aprom	0	0
