a13e30246748-90ec-958f-d7882aa75e15	Send reset link to user email	2024-11-28 07:45:37	2024-11-29 09:39:19	0	<p>Implement the functionality in the backend to send a password reset link to the user's registered email address. This should be triggered when a user requests a password reset via the frontend interface.</p>\n<p><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>When the user submits their email address for a password reset, a system-generated token should be created.</li>\n<li>A reset link should be sent to the user's registered email containing the token.</li>\n<li>The link should be valid for a limited time.</li>\n<li>If the email is not registered, the system will return the message "Password reset link has been sent to your email address." to avoid brute force attacks.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Implementation:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create a forget password controller, that will fire a password reset event.</li>\n<li>Create an email handler that will have a reset password handler.</li>\n<li>Set up test account and SMTP service on that.</li>\n<li>Enable two-factor authentication and create a new APP password that SMTP will use.</li>\n<li>Create a separate config file for SMTP and enter all of the configurations related to that.</li>\n<li>After validating the user's email, generate a token that will be used to change the password.</li>\n</ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3485	2024-11-28	2024-11-27	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	29393e98671f-f433-141c-87c17da1ce69	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2024-11-29 09:39:19	agaia	0	0
