b9ec7306671f-5b2a-c519-45f767ea432a	Implement Forget password functionality	2024-10-28 11:55:37	2024-12-02 12:23:56	0	<p>We need to implement the Forgot Password functionality. This will allow users who have forgotten their password to reset it securely and in a user-friendly flow.</p>\n<p><strong>Implementation:</strong></p>\n<ul data-tomark-pass=""><li data-tomark-pass="">There should be a separate form for Forget Password.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">The page should contain an email address field and a "send reset link" button to send a link to the mentioned email.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">There should be a separate button that will take the user back to the sign-in page.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">The form validation should work on both field level and form level.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">The HTTP request will be initiated with the pure javascript fetch call, instead of using ember data.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">The HTTP request of method POST will be initiated and the headers e.g. host will be provided through the ENV.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Extend the Signin controller with the Prometheus Create controller to handle the validations.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">As we're not using a based model here (we're using a javascript plain object for email), Update the validation functions e.g. \\\\\\_showError to make it more customizable.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Handle exceptions by proper translations.</li></ul>**Acceptance Criteria:**\n<ul data-tomark-pass=""><li data-tomark-pass="">The Forgot Password page is accessible via the login screen.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Users can enter their email address and successfully submit it.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">The email validation works correctly (i.e., it only accepts valid emails).</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Users can go back to the Sign page from the forget password form.</li><li data-tomark-pass="">Properly translated Success and error messages should be displayed.</li></ul>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3447	2024-10-28	2024-10-28	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	4f15ca76671f-f433-141c-9f9c0a0f1306	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	23a4749162c6-89cf-bcaf-50ebb8c0446b	2024-12-02 12:23:56	aprom	0	0
