bc1f0512673e-698e-e78e-b6afd60885de	Throw a known exception	2024-11-21 06:57:00	2024-11-21 06:57:13	0	<p>In the Token controller class, there is a function&nbsp;<strong>getUserByUsername</strong>(). This function returns the user model by getting the user from the database against the given username. If the user is not found then it throws an exception. The exception&nbsp;<span style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;" data-tomark-pass="">it throws is as <strong>Exception("User not found"),</strong> whereas in our Phalcon there is no class </span>of that type of Exception. So we have to replace this class with one of the currently available exceptions in our system.</p>\n	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3482	2024-11-21	2024-11-21	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	29393e98671f-f433-141c-87c17da1ce69	\N	cb9597e45acd-06d6-1141-34137d85f7a9	Rana Nouman	Rana Nouman	\N	33f2e1c062c6-81f4-bcaf-6a1b411477d8	2024-11-21 07:06:21	agaia	0	0
