cc5031e06a01-9696-3459-b98aa74b7114	Thread loading needs optimization	2026-05-11 11:43:08	2026-06-01 09:25:46	0	<p>There are multiple improvements required. Let me explains some scenarios</p>\n<p>Observation, when we navigate to Threads all the comments are being loaded one by one by preventing the screen loading, I think that the screen should be loaded and then the comments can be loaded one by one and rendered as we continue. Right now I have to wait 20-30 seconds after triggering the navigation.</p>\n<p>Scenario 1</p>\n<ol>\n<li>User open any page e.g. Issue List</li>\n<li>User tried to navigate to Threads, it takes 20-30 seconds to load the page</li>\n</ol>\n<p><br data-tomark-pass=""><br>\nScenario 2</p>\n<ol>\n<li>User open page e.g. Issue List</li>\n<li>User navigate to Threads</li>\n<li>Users scrolls down to load more threads</li>\n<li>As more threads are being loaded the&nbsp; users immediately navigates to another page from main navigation or top navigation the threads are still bein loaded in the background even when the new page has been loaded.</li>\n</ol>\n	1	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	1	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	3889	2026-05-29	2026-05-11	new	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	4b60d556673c-e6e8-d08b-52b27c67dd56	7b5806d76a01-e05c-3459-85fba1e8766e	ae6454575acb-1902-6b9c-f2ffa11a2697	Hammad Hassan	Rana Nouman	\N	bf3f206262c6-8e43-047e-2160cab7abb6	2026-05-11 11:43:08	aprom	0	0
