r Gaia PRs.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Checks:</b> unittest on a fixture issue; snapshot of the pack for a known issue to keep its size in check.</p>\n<p><b>Depends on:</b> A Gaia #4131, #4132, #4133; A Dev Tool #4138. <b>Exit:</b> a Gaia run's first ten turns contain no <code>cat</code>/<code>sed</code>/Read of <code>core/</code> or <code>tools/api-tester</code> files (verified with <code>ai cost</code>, #4126).</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4139	2026-12-14	2026-12-04	done	high	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	8fe2ae046adf-8154-4904-8f5112ed5746	\N	a13debc86ad7-404c-ce18-75327b747d1b	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	2b52a9526ae0-ab32-9d4f-5c5df8b1bfc4	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-27 09:07:21	adt	0	0
