>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4133	2026-11-27	2026-11-16	done	high	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	8d88c0836adf-8154-4904-0abe50edd8bc	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	37998d116adf-5108-72fa-a6b4db3668b3	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-26 17:15:31	agaia	0	0
