76a200806af7-3fb3-e127-bc6c51048533	Remove dead classic components and the vendor libraries only they use	2026-11-14 01:03:50	2026-11-14 02:01:00	0	<p>These classic components are not rendered anywhere:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>content-editable</code></li>\n<li><code>message-box</code> (top-level; <code>ConversationUi::MessageBox</code> is the live one)</li>\n<li><code>quill-editor</code></li>\n<li><code>summer-note</code></li>\n<li><code>relate-issue</code> and <code>relate-issuepriority</code> (top-level). Relate fields resolve to <code>related-fields/relate-*</code> through <code>{{component (concat 'related-fields/' @relateType)}}</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Removing them also removes the app's two observers and its <code>sendAction</code> calls.</p>\n<p>Only those components use these libraries:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>the Quill import: <code>vendor/quill</code>;</li>\n<li>the Summernote import: <code>vendor/summernote</code> and <code>app/styles/summernote.scss</code>;</li>\n<li>at.js: the <code>jquery.atwho</code> import and <code>app/styles/modules/atwho.scss</code>;</li>\n<li>highlight.js: the <code>highlightjs</code> import and <code>app/styles/highlight/</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>urijs</code> is a dependency that nothing imports.</p>\n<h4>Do</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Before deleting each file, check again that nothing uses it. Search templates (curly calls, angle brackets, <code>component</code> helper strings, <code>@relateType</code> values), JS and tests.</li>\n<li>Remove the components, the <code>app.import</code> lines in <code>ember-cli-build.js</code>, the vendor folders, the stylesheets and their <code>@import</code>s, and the <code>urijs</code> and <code>highlightjs</code> / <code>at.js</code> packages.</li>\n<li>The full suite and the build must stay green. Smoke-check the comment composer, wiki editing and the relate fields on issue create.</li>\n</ul><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a