2ed00cc36aef-978f-b5d5-f67c5cd56dd4	Task Board: issue quick preview overlaps the board	2026-11-07 21:33:34	2026-11-08 00:25:47	0	<p>Since aprom-4338, opening an issue's quick preview on the Task Board leaves lanes showing through and under the preview panel: in the engineer's screenshot the Done and Feedback lane headers cross the panel's description. Before 4338 the board narrowed and the panel sat beside it (selection flow in <code>controllers/app/project/board.js</code> <code>selectIssue</code>, layout in <code>templates/app/project/board.hbs</code>). 4338 probably changed the board's positioning or stacking (position, z-index or width of the board container or of <code>.milestone-filters</code>). Note that lane headers have <code>z-index: 999</code> (<code>board.scss</code> ~l.84), which becomes a problem once their ancestors' stacking changes.</p><p><strong>Changes</strong></p><ul><li>Compare the board's template and styles with <code>dev</code> before 4338 and restore the board's position, width and stacking.</li><li>The search slot must not change the board container's layout: it is positioned inside <code>.nav-tabs-custom</code> only.</li><li>If an earlier fix already resolved it, add the test and say so in the PR.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>An acceptance test opens the quick preview and checks that the preview panel and the board columns don't overlap (bounding boxes).</li><li>In the browser, with the preview open, no lane, lane header or card shows over or under the panel, at desktop width and at 390px.</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> the tab layout, lane scrolling.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4340</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 3</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4341	2026-11-15	2026-11-08	wont_fix	high	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae61a723