2524d2566adf-c3cd-5c87-bf24a92b3b25	docs/generated from the graph (model pages, route table, ACL matrix, assertion vocabulary, bundle guides) with CI drift check; anchored decisions docs	2026-10-26 08:07:01	2026-10-26 15:18:52	0	<p><b>Phase 4 of "Agentic Improve" (Gaia side).</b> Hand-written docs don't get used: <code>docs/architecture/rbac/*.md</code> was read by no Gaia agent session while <code>Acl.php</code> was re-read in three. Docs must be generated from the graph and reachable through a mechanical entry point (#ai-context issue in A Dev Tool).</p>\n<p><b>What</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>gaia-dev docs generate</code> writes <code>docs/generated/</code>: one page per model, a route table, an ACL matrix (resource × profile), the assertion vocabulary with examples, the auth profiles, and one guide per bundle from <code>docs/dev/bundles.md</code> (#4127) linking its exemplar PR and golden files. Every section ≤ 40 lines with a stable heading anchor, so a section can be served on its own.</li>\n<li><code>gaia-dev docs generate --check</code> fails when the committed docs are stale; add it to CI next to the graph drift check.</li>\n<li>Hand-written "why" docs stay in <code>docs/architecture/*/decisions.md</code>; add a PHPUnit test that every class/method/file they cite exists (drift test), and fix the current citations.</li>\n<li>Shrink <code>gaia/CLAUDE.md</code> Architecture section to pointers at the generated docs and <code>gaia-dev</code> commands (rules stay).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Depends on:</b> #4127, #4129. <b>Exit:</b> generated docs committed, CI green on drift, decisions docs pass the citation test.</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4132	2026-11-27	2026-11-13	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	8d88c0836adf-8154-4904-0abe50edd8bc	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	9a2d36566adf-f64c-4ae4-c109c7368885	402f48b