dc1c01f76aef-1a22-399b-6b8ea2aca275	ezSearch: Saved menu items turn white on hover without a highlight	2026-11-08 00:48:28	2026-11-08 01:05:25	0	<p>In the Saved searches menu (both <code>&lt;EzSearch&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;EzSearchCompact&gt;</code>), hovering an item turns its text white but the background stays transparent, so the item disappears. Cause: the shared dropdown gives hovered items a crimson background and white text (<code>app/styles/components/dropdown.scss</code> ~l.44-49, <code>.app-dropdown .app-dropdown-content &gt; *:hover</code>). The ezSearch styles reset the item buttons to <code>background: transparent</code> with a more specific selector, so the background is lost while the white text stays:</p><ul><li><code>.ez-search-compact-saved .app-dropdown-content button</code>, <code>app/styles/components/ez-search-compact.scss</code> ~l.62-68;</li><li><code>.ez-search .ez-search-saved .dropdown-menu button</code>, <code>app/styles/components/ez-search.scss</code> ~l.90-97.</li></ul><p><strong>Changes</strong></p><ul><li>In both places keep the transparent reset for the normal state only, and add <code>:hover</code> and <code>:focus</code> (keyboard) with <code>$primaryColor</code> background and white text, matching <code>dropdown.scss</code>.</li><li>Share one rule (or a mixin) for both menus instead of two copies.</li><li>The active search keeps its <code>fa-check</code>, and its icon stays visible on hover. Disabled entries, if any, get no highlight.</li><li>The Update, Save as new, Revert and Save current search entries behave the same.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p><ul><li>An integration test, for both components: a focused saved item has the crimson background and white text (computed styles).</li><li>Checked in the browser with the mouse and the keyboard on the Issue list (full) and the idea list and Task Board (compact).</li></ul><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> the suggestion menu, menu alignment.</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 3</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4346	2026-11-15	2026-11-08	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	9cacd6286ae5-b7f5-613b-853cf931f5e8	\N	ae61a7235acb-1902-6b9c-e933ed4dfda0	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	357614f16aef-718a-399b-359a84aa50f4	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-08 01:05:25	aprom	0	0
