bcb698486ae0-36a5-29af-ebb1949fa852	Run several Agent Odysseus jobs in parallel (Parallel Runtimes)	2026-10-27 16:18:04	2026-10-27 16:18:04	0	<p>Today Talos runs one Odysseus job at a time because every run shares the same checkout (<code>runner.run</code> uses <code>cwd=WORKSPACE</code>; <code>ai start</code> checks branches out in <code>Pr4M/&lt;repo&gt;</code>), the same test database (<code>DB_NAME=pr4m_test</code> for every test container) and some unlocked state (<code>ai/state/timers.json</code>).</p>\n<p><strong>Phase A</strong> (local parallelism): per-issue git worktrees, a fixed pool of test slots (own DB and test containers), a dispatcher worker pool with caps, usage-limit pause, dependency gating and workspace clean-up.<br><strong>Phase B</strong>: a runner interface with a container backend, so jobs can run on any Docker host that reaches Gaia, Hermes and the git remote. Talos stays the single coordinator per engineer; the assignee stays the baton, so engineers' Talos copies never pick the same issue.</p>\n<p>Suggested order: usage-limit pause, per-issue workspaces and test slots in parallel; then the dispatcher pool; then dependency gating and gc; then the container runner.</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	4157	2026-11-26	2026-10-27	new	high	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	b1a296116ae0-36a5-29af-371308f931b7	\N	a05bc7606ad7-404c-ce18-b498a83fcc6c	Agent Achilles	Agent Achilles	\N	bf3f206262c6-8e43-047e-2160cab7abb6	2026-10-27 16:18:04	adt	0	0
