a364e9556afc-72fe-b62c-67464ebf5e40	SearchController: GET /api/v1/search across searchable modules	2026-11-17 16:24:03	2026-11-17 16:24:03	0	<p>Expose the search core over HTTP. The controller has no permission of its own; authorization is the searched module's (done in <code>SearchService</code>). This is a deliberate exception to standard CRUD resources: record it in a new <code>docs/architecture/search/decisions.md</code> (registered wherever the decisions-docs test expects), with the search metadata, stored system search columns, event-driven embedding by Ares with the hash precondition, and ranking decisions.</p><p><strong>Changes</strong></p><ul><li><code>SearchController</code> with a list action only: <code>GET /api/v1/search?types=issue&amp;q=...&amp;limit=20</code>; route in <code>core/config/routes.php</code>; OAuth required; <code>$aclMap</code> declared so the action catalog publishes no <code>search.*</code> permission.</li><li>Thin: parse into <code>SearchRequest</code>, call <code>SearchService</code>, shape the response. 400 for missing or too short <code>q</code> or an unknown type; 403 when a requested type's <code>.get</code> is denied.</li><li>Response: <code>data</code> items <code>{type: 'searchresult', id: '&lt;type&gt;:&lt;recordId&gt;', attributes: {module, recordId, title, snippet, score, matchedBy, pinned}}</code>, <code>meta</code> <code>{query, types}</code>.</li><li>api-tester cases incl. <code>acl</code> profiles (denied module = 403, members scope hides other projects' issues); regenerate <code>docs/generated</code>.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the cases pass; searching an issue number pins that issue; a typo in a subject word still finds it.</p><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> semantic matching (next issue), Prometheus UI.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> agaia-4666</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 8</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	7ea8b58662