c992d0406af3-8d6f-4330-56c6effd27a4	Design system doc: shell rules for project pages and the List + detail (QuickList) pattern	2026-11-10 18:30:33	2026-11-10 18:44:09	0	<p>The Threads review (aprom-4454..4460 and the nested section.content bug) found mistakes that <code>docs/ui/design-system.md</code> doesn't prevent. Section 2 lists the content header and <code>section.content</code> as shell parts but never says pages must not render them, section 3 has no pattern for the QuickList list + detail layout used by Roles, Ideas and Threads, and nothing covers the label/status details. Agents read this doc before every UI change, so write the rules down. Docs only, no code.</p><ul><li><strong>Section 2 (App shell):</strong> add that pages under <code>app.project</code> start directly with their <code>.row</code>: they never render their own <code>section.content-header</code>, page title row, <code>&lt;BreadCrumb/&gt;</code> or <code>section.content</code>, because <code>templates/app/project.hbs</code> renders the project-name link, the single breadcrumb and the content section. Project pages have no page title (like Task Board and Gantt Cal); breadcrumb labels come from <code>services/breadcrumb.js</code>.</li><li><strong>Section 3 (Page patterns), new "List + detail page (QuickList)":</strong> <code>.row</code> with <code>.col-md-3</code> <code>QuickList</code> in a <code>box box-primary</code> + <code>.col-md-9</code> outlet; the detail is a <code>.col-md-8</code> record box + <code>.col-md-4</code> info column of small boxes; the first row opens by default (index route <code>replaceWith</code>), empty state only when nothing matches. QuickList box order: header = title + create button in <code>&lt;:actions&gt;</code> (<code>btn btn-primary btn-sm</code>, ACL), then <code>&lt;:search&gt;</code> with <code>EzSearchCompact</code>, then the group/sort toolbar (wraps when narrow, never overflows), then the rows (group headings when grouped), then <strong>pagination in the box footer</strong> (range <code>1-20 / 20+</code> + ‹ ›, limit+1, never in the header). State via <code>utils/state/</code> (UrlState + ListLoader), list reloads in place. Examples: Roles, Ideas, Threads.</li><li><strong>Section 8 (Buttons, labels, icons, avatars):</strong> no small uppercase type/eyebrow label above a box title (the title is <code>h3.box-title</code>); issue statuses always render with the <code>status-label</code> + <code>status-style</code> helpers and the status class (as in <code>components/issue/issue-details.hbs</code>), never the raw value; information shown in a side box (e.g. a linked issue) is not repeated in the record header.</li><li><strong>Section 9 (Other building blocks):</strong> add "Reply / comment box" = <code>ConversationUi::CommentComposer</code> (toast-ui WYSIWYG with its toolbar, mentions and issue links); never a plain textarea. Record boxes are plain <code>box box-*</code> with no extra shadow or border.</li><li><strong>Section 12 (Checklist):</strong> add items: no own content-header/breadcrumb/section.content in project pages; List + detail pages follow the QuickList order (create in header, pagination in footer); statuses via <code>status-label</code>; comment input is the CommentComposer.</li><li>If <code>public/ui-docs/quick-list.md</code> (component library) says anything that contradicts the pagination/actions placement, align it.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the doc sections above are updated, consistent with the code of Roles/Ideas/Threads; markdown renders cleanly. <strong>Out of scope:</strong> code changes; new reference screenshots.</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 2</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4465	2026-11-17	2026-11-10	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	016ffdb66af2-3028-5ed1-e8572ffabaa7	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	379545b6