c0d85d446af9-1368-4631-4d07293ed5aa	AppUi::EmptyState and AppUi::Box components	2026-11-15 10:26:08	2026-11-15 13:07:02	0	<p>Two small layout blocks from the design system. Depends on aprom-4566 and aprom-4567.</p>\n<h4>AppUi::EmptyState</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First confirm there are at least three copies of the empty-state pattern (design system section 4). If not, drop it from this issue (R1) and say so in a comment.</li>\n<li>Shape: <code>@icon</code>, <code>@message</code>, and an <code>&lt;:action&gt;</code> block.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>AppUi::Box</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Shape: <code>@variant</code> (primary, default …) plus <code>&lt;:header&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;:tools&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;:body&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;:footer&gt;</code> blocks; AdminLTE box markup, square edges.</li>\n<li><b>For new code only.</b> The ~151 existing boxes are not migrated.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Deliverables</h4>\n<ul><li>Components, ui-docs pages + manifests, integration tests with <code>data-test-*</code> selectors; design system updated to point at <code>AppUi::Box</code> for new boxes.</li></ul><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4571	2026-11-22	2026-11-15	done	low	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	69b873786af9-1368-4631-55b621317e73	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	3f1fe5366af9-bd13-d988-c70fbb27a35a	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-15 13:07:02	aprom	0	0
a8b45de96af3-1487-2734-315421cf0ecf	Use the router service: drop implicit router injection and the controller/route transition methods	2026-11-10 21:33:28	2026-11-11 14:25:34	0	<p>Ember 5.0 removed implicit injections and the transition methods on controllers and routes.</p><ul><li><code>app/initializers/inject-router.js</code> calls <code>application.inject('route'|'component', 'router', 'router:main')</code>. In the spike it failed with <code>application.inject is not a function</code> before every test. Delete the initializer and add <code>@service router</code> (<code>router: service()</code> in classic classes) to the files that use <code>this.router</code> without declaring it (about 19 routes and components, e.g. <code>routes/app/settings.js</code>, <code>components/app-ui/nav-bar.js</code>, <code>components/issue/issue-details.js</code>).</li><li>Check those files for uses of the private <code>router:main</code> (e.g. <code>router.resetToken</code> in <code>controllers/reset-password.js</code>) and replace them with public router-service APIs.</li><li>Controllers: <code>transitionToRoute</code> / <code>replaceRoute</code> → <code>this.router.transitionTo</code> / <code>replaceWith</code> (35 uses in 20 files).</li><li>Routes: <code>this.transitionTo</code> / <code>this.replaceWith</code> → the router service (6 uses). Current test logs already show the <code>routing.transition-methods</code> deprecation.</li></ul><p>Works on 4.1.</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4478	2026-11-18	2026-11-11	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	70a8ecd06af3-1487-2734-22a7ca0b5d62	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	2911d2176af4-eaef-53d2-bf9151c61c95	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-11 14:25:35	aprom	0	0
c82612a26af9-1368-4631-16733b4848ed	List-page parts (ListToolbar, Pager, DataTable) piloted on agent and workflow lists	2026-11-15 10:26:16	2026-11-15 13:07:06	0	<p>Five list pages (workflow/index, agent/index, user/management, projects/index, project/issue/index) repeat the same parts: table, row actions, pagination and mostly EzSearch. Extract them as separate composable parts (not one <code>ListPage</code>) and pilot on two pages. Depends on aprom-4566 and aprom-4567.</p>\n<h4>Parts</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><b>AppUi::ListToolbar:</b> <code>&lt;:search&gt;</code> (EzSearch / SavedSearch), <code>&lt;:actions&gt;</code> (create, export) and <code>&lt;:selection&gt;</code> blocks.</li>\n<li><b>AppUi::Pager:</b> range text (<code>1-20 / 20+</code>) and ‹ › buttons from <code>@offset</code>, <code>@limit</code>, <code>@hasMore</code>, plus an <code>@onPageChange</code> event. Switch QuickList's footer pager to it.</li>\n<li><b>AppUi::DataTable:</b> a new, slim table. Do not extend <code>AppUi::Table</code> (21 args, four loading modes); its current users stay on it.\n<ul>\n<li>Columns are descriptors <code>{ key, label, sortable, cell }</code>; <code>cell</code> names a cell component, or the page supplies a <code>&lt;:cell&gt;</code> block (hand-built cell always allowed).</li>\n<li>Sorting and selection are events out; row actions go in a <code>&lt;:rowActions&gt;</code> block (with <code>AccessControl</code> inside as today).</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Pilot</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Move <code>agent/index</code> onto the parts.</li>\n<li>Move <code>workflow/index</code>.</li>\n<li>Write a before/after report as an issue comment: template/controller lines, test churn, readability, anything the parts could not express. It decides whether the other three pages follow.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Deliverables</h4>\n<ul><li>Components with ui-docs pages + manifests and integration tests; both pages' tests switched to <code>data-test-*</code> selectors; no visual change (compare screenshots before/after); lint and tests green.</li></ul><p>Complexity: complex</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4572	2026-11-22	2026-11-15	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	69b873786af9-1368-4631-55b621317e73	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	c4f3c7786af9-a4d7-d359-1f99656c0e72	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-15 13:07:06	aprom	0	0
8d7a06f46afc-30ee-311d-11e5a6dce45e	Workflows: TriggerEventCatalog reads its events from the event registry	2026-11-17 15:36:45	2026-11-18 13:52:21	0	<p>Workflow trigger events are defined in <code>core/libs/workflows/TriggerEventCatalog.php</code> (<code>EVENTS</code> const). The event registry (<code>app/metadata/events.php</code>, class <code>EventRegistry</code>) now holds the same definitions; the catalog should read them so there is one list.</p><ul><li><code>TriggerEventCatalog</code> takes the registry entries that are enabled and on the <code>workflow</code> channel; <code>model</code>, <code>on</code>, <code>fields</code>, <code>to</code> come from the entry's <code>source</code>, the label from the entry (add a <code>label</code> key if needed). Remove the private <code>EVENTS</code> const; keep the public API (<code>names</code>, <code>has</code>, <code>definition</code>, <code>models</code>, <code>raisedBy</code>) and constants unchanged.</li><li>A disabled event is neither offered by <code>GET /workflowevent</code> nor raised by <code>WorkflowTriggersComponent</code>.</li><li>Update <code>tests/libraries/workflows/TriggerEventCatalogTest.php</code>; inject the registry so the test can use a fixture.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the workflow trigger list and the events raised are unchanged on dev; a test shows a disabled event disappears from both.</p><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> renaming or merging trigger names.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> agaia-4640</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 4</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	4642	2026-11-24	2026-11-17	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	7b8e27936afc-30ee-311d-92e7628909b7	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Agent Nestor	Agent Agamemnon	1e2e78646afd-715d-1e86-b44a849585e1	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-18 13:52:2