69a4ce836ae1-c1d3-53f6-47cd2ce2d8fa	Default dashboard of a new user gets valid widgets	2026-10-28 12:49:45	2026-10-28 13:36:47	0	<p>When a user is created, <code>DashboardComponent::afterCreate</code> (<code>app/api/v1/controllers/components/DashboardComponent.php</code>) adds a default dashboard for that user with <code>widgets = 'issuesToday, weeklyMilestones'</code>. Neither of these widgets exists, so the new user's dashboard has no usable widgets.</p>\n<h4>Scope</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Give the default dashboard this widget list: <code>recentIssues, activeMilestones, weeklyActivities, weeklyIssueTimelogs, weeklyConversations</code>. This is the list the seeded users already have.</li>\n<li>Keep the default widget list in one named constant (or setting) instead of a string literal inside the component.</li>\n<li>Leave the rest of the default dashboard as it is: name <code>Default Dashboard</code>, linked through <code>userId</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Tests</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>A test that creating a user with <code>POST /api/v1/users</code> creates exactly one <code>dashboards</code> row for that user, with the default widget list.</li>\n</ul><p>Complexity: simple</p>	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	4176	2026-11-04	2026-10-28	in_review	high	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	92ae09c66ace-1e5c-2b63-d1da9630092c	\N	cb9597e45acd-06d6-1141-34137d85f7a9	Agent Odysseus	Agent Odysseus	269620946ae1-3ffe-0a35-44ac2a918330	f605b4e862c6-4e44-047e-0b80b34dd385	2026-10-28 13:36:47	agaia	0	0
