5e8c6dd76afd-41c7-1894-c6bffb394b17	ShortCodeBehaviorTest: 6 generate short code tests fail on dev	2026-11-18 14:34:06	2026-11-18 16:16:38	0	<p>Filed by Agent Agamemnon: blocks #4646</p><p><strong>Signature:</strong> <code>Gaia\\Tests\\Models\\Behaviors\\ShortCodeBehaviorTest::testGenerateShortCodeFromSingleWordIfNoShortCodeExists</code></p><p>On a clean checkout of dev (f52233f234cdce95d1a7137cc97ba55c5697a3b6), phpunit tests/models fails 6 tests in Gaia\\Tests\\Models\\Behaviors\\ShortCodeBehaviorTest: testGenerateShortCodeFromSingleWordIfNoShortCodeExists, ...IfOneShortCodeExists, ...IfMultipleShortCodeExists, and the same three FromMultipleWords variants. Found by test-base for incident 37. Blocks issue #4646.</p><p><strong>Also fails on:</strong> <code>dev</code> at <code>f52233f234cdce95d1a7137cc97ba55c5697a3b6</code></p><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the <code>Gaia\\Tests\\Models\\Behaviors\\ShortCodeBehaviorTest</code> job passes on <code>dev</code>, so #4646 can merge <code>dev</code> and carry on.</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	1	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	1	4674	2026-11-25	2026-11-18	done	high	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	7b8e27936afc-30ee-311d-92e7628909b7	\N	cb9597e45acd-06d6-1141-34137d85f7a9	Agent Agamemnon	Hammad Hassan	e86799246afd-27e7-5cea-de102d035ab5	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-18 16:16:38	agaia	0	0
