5db336616afa-4169-5cb2-d236a9c5f694	AppUi::Dropdown: menu opens where it should (auto alignment) and standard menu colours	2026-11-15 23:16:45	2026-11-17 10:10:19	0	<p>We are finalizing the core components of the Component Library. The Dropdown demo is broken: the menu does not appear where it should and the primary colour is overused. Fix the component, its demo and docs; do not change pages that use it (ezSearch keeps its own scoped overrides).</p><p>Today: <code>components/app-ui/dropdown.{hbs,js}</code>, styles <code>app/styles/components/dropdown.scss</code>: the menu is always <code>right: 0</code> (at a left edge it opens off-screen), items hover crimson with white text, <code>z-index: 99999</code>; the demo's <code>.active</code> item is plum (<code>styles/components/developer-entry.scss</code> ~l.29-68).</p><ul><li><code>@align</code>: <code>auto</code> (default), <code>start</code>, <code>end</code>. Start = menu's left edge on the trigger's left edge; end = right edges aligned. Auto measures on open: start when the menu fits in the viewport to the right, otherwise end; and opens upward when there is no room below. Re-measure on window resize while open.</li><li>Menu look = Bootstrap <code>dropdown-menu</code>: white, 1px <code>#ddd</code> border, square, items <code>#444</code> text, hover/focus <code>#f4f4f4</code> background with <code>#444</code> text (no crimson fill), a selected item (<code>.active</code> or <code>aria-selected</code>) shows crimson text + <code>fa-check</code>, no fill; dividers. <code>z-index</code> 1000. Keep the existing shadow, add none.</li><li>Trigger: <code>btn-default</code> unless <code>@isPrimary</code>; caret as today. Close on outside click and Escape; focus returns to the trigger.</li><li>Demo <code>components/developer/demos/dropdown.{hbs,js}</code> and its rules in <code>developer-entry.scss</code>: placement left / right edge, align control (auto/start/end), near the bottom (opens up), many items (scroll); remove the plum <code>.active</code> rule.</li><li>Docs <code>public/ui-docs/dropdown.md</code> + new manifest <code>dropdown.json</code>.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance</strong>: at both edges and near the bottom the menu is fully visible; hover/selected colours as above; integration tests for align start/end, auto flip (stub sizes), Escape. <strong>Out of scope</strong>: changing ezSearch's or the board's dropdown overrides.</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 8</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4590	2026-11-23	2026-11-16	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	69b873786af9-1368-4631-55b621317e73	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	d0872dc46afa-4169-5cb2-fbd4b772cda9	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-16 00:04:01	aprom	0	0
b04a1a066af0-970b-16ca-2f497f6c7125	Component Library: Modal entry (bootstrap-modal)	2026-11-08 17:21:52	2026-11-08 19:56:00	0	<p><code>bootstrap-modal</code> is our only modal, and we have had bugs with its confirm handling and with modals trapped inside a parent's stacking context or styles (fixed by rendering through <code>in-element</code>, see <code>components/idea/message-screen.hbs</code>). Document it in the Component Library.</p><ul><li><code>components/developer/demos/modal.{hbs,js}</code>: an Open button and Controls for title, <code>@containerClass</code>, <code>@removeConfirmBtn</code>, confirm behaviour (resolves after 1s / rejects / returns true synchronously) and "render inside a constrained box" vs "render with in-element" to show the stacking problem and its fix.</li><li>Event log: open, confirm (with result), cancel, hide.</li><li>Registry entry (group Overlays) with status taken from the current confirm behaviour (experimental if async confirm is not in the component yet) and <code>public/ui-docs/modal.md</code>: arguments, the confirm contract as it is in the code today, and Do and Avoid (render outside scroll/stacking containers, title is translated via <code>t</code>).</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance</strong>: each control combination demonstrable; events logged; docs tabs render; integration test of the demo.</p><p><strong>Out of scope</strong>: changing bootstrap-modal (log bugs found as separate issues).</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4374, aprom-4375, aprom-4376</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 4</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	51754f446ae4-9faf-391a-2704d46e39cb	4380	2026-11-15	2026-11-08	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	5d51af446af0-970b-16ca-455730e26234	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Nestor	Agent Agamemnon	1e8973966af0-f6b3-5263-dd9c4767a808	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-0