9d4793e56af0-970b-16ca-f7094514398d	Component Library: ezSearch entry (EzSearch, compact multi-row, compact linear)	2026-11-08 17:21:33	2026-11-08 19:06:53	0	<p>ezSearch (<code>components/ez-search/</code>, <code>components/ez-search-compact/</code>) is our search bar and builder, used on the Issue, Project, Agent, Workflow and Idea lists, the Gantt and the Task Board. Document it in the Component Library with one entry and three variants.</p><ul><li><code>components/developer/demos/ez-search.{hbs,js}</code>: a variant switch in Controls (EzSearch full / EzSearchCompact multi-row / EzSearchCompact linear) over a fixture schema in the <code>views.&lt;Module&gt;.search</code> metadata shape (text, select with static values, date, user fields) and fixture saved searches. No Gaia calls: saving a search only logs.</li><li>Controls: <code>@query</code> preset (empty, simple, AND/OR with brackets, invalid mix), <code>@baseQuery</code> on/off, active saved search.</li><li>Event log: <code>@onApply</code> (show the exact query string Gaia would receive), <code>@onSave</code>, <code>@onSavedSearchChange</code>, <code>@onUpdateSavedSearch</code>.</li><li>Registry entry (group Search, stable, used in: Issues, Projects, Ideas, Gantt, Task Board; variants 3) and <code>public/ui-docs/ez-search.md</code>: arguments of both components (see <code>components/ez-search/base.js</code>), the metadata format and value sources (<code>services/query-schema.js</code>), keyboard behaviour, and rules under Do and Avoid (no AND/OR mixing without brackets, bare words are one phrase, do not wrap EzSearchCompact).</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance</strong>: all three variants work on the fixture; Apply logs the query string; docs tabs render; integration test of the demo.</p><p><strong>Out of scope</strong>: changes to ezSearch itself (log bugs found as separate issues).</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> aprom-4374, aprom-4375, aprom-4376</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 5</p><p>Complexity: s