6f792c886afa-4169-5cb2-de8547068bd9	AppUi::DataTable: QuickList selection look, standard row action icons, more-menu on AppUi::Dropdown	2026-11-15 23:17:03	2026-11-16 02:04:58	0	<p>We are finalizing the core components of the Component Library. DataTable's select icons and selection colour don't match QuickList, and the row action icons' style, colour and size are inconsistent. Fix the component, give it its own demo and update the docs; do not change pages that use it.</p><p>The attached screen is a guide for layout and content, not the final look: the design system and the real components win.</p><p>Reference markup to align with: QuickList row check <code>components/quick-list/row.hbs</code> (<code>button.quick-list__check</code> with <code>fa-square-o</code>/<code>fa-check-square</code>; styles <code>styles/components/quick-list.scss</code> ~l.155-175: unchecked <code>$mediumColor</code>, checked <code>$primaryColor</code>, selected row <code>#f9fafc</code>) and <code>QuickList::SelectAll</code> (already used in the header).</p><ul><li>Rows: replace the native checkbox with the same icon button as QuickList (same size, colours, aria-pressed); selected rows get the QuickList selected background. Header select-all shows none/some/all (<code>fa-square-o</code>/<code>fa-minus-square</code>/<code>fa-check-square</code>).</li><li>Row actions: one standard: icon-only <code>btn btn-box-tool</code> look (grey <code>$mediumColor</code>, <code>#444</code> on hover, 14px, square, title + aria-label), right-aligned, same gap; the more-actions button uses <code>fa-ellipsis-v</code> in the same style and opens its menu with <code>AppUi::Dropdown</code> (<code>@align="end"</code>) instead of the hand-made <code>.data-table-more-menu</code>.</li><li>Styles in <code>app/styles/components/app-ui-data-table.scss</code>.</li><li>Own demo <code>components/developer/demos/data-table.{hbs,js}</code> (columns, sort, groups, selection with a Selection across 3 fixture pages, row actions 