f418cd466ad7-d41d-2b49-1a91af21fa59	Workflow module: workflows, nodes, edges and actor references	2026-10-20 17:12:20	2026-10-30 10:17:59	0	<p>Part of agaia-4048 (Workflows).</p><ul><li><code>workflows</code>: name, description, status (Draft | Active | Disabled), scope (projects), version, owner.</li><li><code>workflow_nodes</code>: workflowId, category (trigger | condition | actor | action), kind (e.g. <code>issue.assignee.changed</code>, <code>filter</code>, <code>switch</code>, <code>run_agent</code>, <code>set_status</code>), config (JSON, validated per kind), name, position x/y.</li><li><code>workflow_edges</code>: from node + output port (e.g. a switch case or a run outcome) → to node.</li><li><code>workflow_references</code>: which users and agents a workflow names (workflowId, nodeId, entity type, entity id), kept in sync on save, so an agent can list its workflows.</li><li>Validation on save: exactly one trigger, no cycles, every port connected or explicitly ended, config valid for its kind.</li><li>ACL: <code>workflow.*</code> resources; 'workflow admin' is just these permissions.</li></ul><p>Mockups: the screenshots attached to this issue (from the 'Agents Screens' design canvas, https://claude.ai/artifact/9WYrFcT3LacRG9QLeBSQUL, private until shared).</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4049	2026-10-27	2026-10-20	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	7a626c876ad7-b7ec-4943-0da4f6053570	eef04cc76ad7-d41d-2b49-e6106c38f089	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	8e63ab596ae3-d76c-0745-280ecb238f65	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-30 10:17:59	agaia	0	0
