cca820a56af4-f61a-254b-374955a3c132	Retro - aga-Docs-MVP	2026-11-11 13:38:20	2026-11-11 13:38:20	0	<p>2026-11-11 to 2026-12-11 (milestone status completed) · 4 issues (0 done, 4 carried over: all <code>deferred</code>) · 0.55h logged (33m, all on #4489) vs no estimate recorded (0m on every issue)</p>\n<h2>Summary</h2>\n<p>The milestone closed on the day it started with all four issues in status <code>deferred</code>; none was done. Only #4489 saw work: its PR (prometheus#748) was opened, then a CodeRabbit round produced fixes that could not be committed because the branch needed a rebase, and the issue stopped there. #4490, #4491 and #4492 were never started because they chain behind #4489. The issues themselves are well specified, but the chain of dependencies (including the cross-project dependency on #4488 in A Gaia) meant nothing could run in parallel.</p>\n<h2>Numbers</h2>\n<table><tr><th>Measure</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Planned / added</td><td>4 / 0 (all created 2026-11-11, the start date; no history of moves seen)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Delivered</td><td>0 of 4 (0%)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Not delivered</td><td>4 deferred</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Estimate accuracy</td><td>not computable (no time estimates recorded)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Late</td><td>4 (not done)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Rework</td><td>1 (#4489: bot round 1 fixes, uncommitted)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Waiting</td><td>#4489 waited on #4488 (from 10:16 to the PR at 12:31, same day); #4490 waited on #4489; #4491 and #4492 on #4490</td></tr></table>\n<h2>What went well</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Issue descriptions are specific: files, acceptance, out of scope, dependencies and estimated file counts, so the work was unambiguous — #4489, #4490, #4491, #4492.</li>\n<li>The upstream Gaia issue #4488 (A Gaia, outside this milestone) shipped its PR and finished <code>done</code>, unblocking #4489.</li>\n<li>#4489 produced a PR within about 12 minutes of logged implementation time, with 1408 Ember tests passing and follow-up candidates listed in the PR comment — #4489.</li>\n<li>Stranded-issue detection worked: #4489 was picked up after a 15-minute idle period — #4489.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>What didn't go well</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Not delivered: #4489 (deferred; PR #748 open, unmerged; bot-round fixes sit uncommitted in the worktree, blocked on a rebase onto origin/dev that would need a force-push). #4490, #4491, #4492 (deferred, no work, no comments beyond a wait notice on #4490).</li>\n<li>#4489 became blocked because origin/dev moved after the branch was pushed; the bot-round rules forbid a rewrite of a pushed branch, so the round could not complete — #4489. (Single case.)</li>\n<li>Agamemnon declined to triage the #4489 block ("incident type 'other' is outside premise"), so the block needed a human decision — #4489. (Single case.)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Patterns</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Strict serial dependency chain:</strong> #4489 → #4490 → #4491 and #4492, with #4488 (A Gaia) upstream. A single stalled issue held all three others; #4490 was never started because its predecessor never finished — #4489, #4490, #4491, #4492. Note #4491 and #4492 could in principle go parallel once #4490 is done, but both also edit <code>metadata.js</code> and the sidebar and reference each other's work conditionally.</li>\n<li><strong>Estimates absent:</strong> all four issues show 0m estimated; only "estimated files" appear in the description (7, 8, 10, 9). #4489 landed 10 files vs 7 estimated.</li>\n<li><strong>Cross-project dependency:</strong> #4489 depends on #4488 in another project and milestone ("Docs MVP"), so this milestone's dates cannot be met independently.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Surprises</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The milestone is marked <code>completed</code> although no issue is <code>done</code> (single case; the state reflects deferral, not delivery).</li>\n<li>All four issues were created within about 30 seconds on the start date, and the milestone's 30-day window shows no work after day one (data as of this run).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Proposed actions</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Let a bot round that finds the base branch moved either merge origin/dev (no force-push) or have a documented rule for a one-branch <code>--force-with-lease</code>, so uncommitted review fixes are not stranded — addresses the #4489 block — Talos bot-round rules / <code>ai commit</code>. Works if a bot round after a moved base finishes without a human.</li>\n<li>Have Agamemnon route "blocked on a rebase" to the reviewer with the two options, rather than leaving it with the owner and no triage — addresses the #4489 block — Agamemnon incident types.</li>\n<li>Record a time estimate on each issue when Nestor/Talos creates it — addresses missing estimates — issue-creation step in Nestor. Works if estimate accuracy can be computed next retro.</li>\n<li>Do not mark a milestone <code>completed</code> while it has non-done issues other than deliberately moved ones; move deferred issues to a successor milestone — addresses the completed-with-zero-delivered state — milestone process.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Proposals only; no follow-up issues were created.</p>\n<h2>Data gaps</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Estimates: none recorded, so estimate accuracy and overruns are not computed.</li>\n<li>Status history: not available, so bounces and time in <code>deferred</code> are not measured; when and why each issue was deferred is not in any comment.</li>\n<li>PR #748: only review states (one claude comment review, one CodeRabbit review, 3 comments, open) were read; round details come from the issue comment (2 CodeRabbit threads).</li>\n<li>Milestone moves in/out are not visible; "Planned / added" assumes all four were there from creation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Issue ledger</h2>\n<table><tr><th>#</th><th>Title</th><th>Status</th><th>Est</th><th>Actual</th><th>Review rounds</th><th>Notes</th></tr>\n<tr><td>4489</td><td>Docs: doc model, adapter, serializer and Mirage support</td><td>deferred</td><td>none (7 files)</td><td>33m</td><td>1 bot round (2 threads), fixes uncommitted</td><td>PR #748 open; blocked on rebase; 10 files</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4490</td><td>Docs: doc page route</td><td>deferred</td><td>none (8 files)</td><td>0m</td><td>0</td><td>waiting on #4489; not started</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4491</td><td>Docs: All Docs list page</td><td>deferred</td><td>none (10 files)</td><td>0m</td><td>0</td><td>depends on #4490; not started</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4492</td><td>Docs: Create Doc form</td><td>deferred</td><td>none (9 files)</td><td>0m</td><td>0</td><td>depends on #4490; not started</td></tr></table><p>Complexity: simple</p>	72e3d4a86ae8-11b0-bd37-a3bd55a4171b	72e3d4a86ae8-11b0-bd37-a3bd55a4171b	1	72e3d4a86ae8-11b0-bd37-a3bd55a4171b	72e3d4a86ae8-11b0-bd37-a3bd55a4171b	4502	2026-11-18	2026-11-11	new	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729		\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Hera	Hera	\N	bf3f206262c6-8e43-047e-2160cab7abb6	2026-11-11 13:38:20	aprom	0	0
