dfa143626af0-cd0b-cccd-da122efdc5c3	Service clients: OAuth client kind service, client_credentials tokens without a user	2026-11-08 20:38:55	2026-11-08 21:37:00	0	<p>Services (Talos runtimes, Hermes, later Ares) need their own identity, never to be confused with agents, which are users and also use client_credentials (agaia-4028, <code>core/libs/authorization/AgentClientCredentials.php</code>). This adds the service client concept.</p><ul><li>New resource <code>Serviceclient</code> (bundle B): name, kind (<code>runtime</code> | <code>hermes</code>), status (active | disabled), scopes (JSON list, defaults per kind from <code>config/*.php</code>: runtime gets <code>agent.delegate</code> plus the runtime read scopes, hermes gets <code>token.introspect</code>), lastUsedAt, oauth client id. Admin-only ACL: list, get, PATCH status; no POST (clients are created by enrollment, later issue). api-tester acl cases.</li><li>Mark every OAuth client with a kind (app | agent | service). The client_credentials handler branches on it: agent clients keep today's behaviour (token user_id = agent email); service clients get a token with <strong>no user_id</strong> and the client's scopes; disabled clients get nothing. A service client can never get a user token and an agent client never a service token.</li><li>Store only a hash of service secrets (follow agaia-4028's Agentcredential storage if it already hashes; otherwise hash in <code>core/libs/oauth2.0/storage/pdo.php</code> for service clients).</li><li>Service clients are not users: no row in users, not in user lists or pickers.</li><li>Decision entries in <code>docs/architecture/rbac/decisions.md</code>.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> phpunit for the grant branching (agent, service, disabled, app client); a service token on any existing CRUD resource still fails as today. <strong>Out of scope:</strong> what service tokens may access, enrollment, rotation.</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 10</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4384	2026-11-16	2026-11-09	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	dee441406af0-cd0b-cccd-253efc87745a	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	43d843596af0-7d1c-cccd-d34d150f3571	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-08 21:37:00	agaia	0	0
