3402bf786af0-7d1c-cccd-3dc4dd8b15ea	Introspection: callable with a service token, returns actor type, client, scopes and project ids	2026-11-08 20:40:20	2026-11-08 22:24:35	0	<p>Hermes will check socket tokens with Gaia introspection (agaia-4029) using its own service token, replacing <code>/user/me</code> plus a membership query with the user's token. Contract change with A Hermes (socket auth issue).</p><ul><li>Accept a service token with scope <code>token.introspect</code>; keep the agaia-4029 shared-secret door for Ares until Ares is reworked.</li><li>Response (RFC 7662 names plus ours): <code>active</code>, <code>sub</code> (user id), <code>actorType</code> (user | agent | service), <code>clientId</code>, <code>act</code> (the service client id when the token is delegated), <code>scope</code>, <code>exp</code>, <code>projectIds</code> (memberships, for users and agents), <code>serviceKind</code> for service tokens. Inactive or disabled = <code>{active: false}</code> only.</li><li>Agent tool grants stay in the response as 4029 built them.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> phpunit and api-tester cases for user, agent, delegated, service and expired tokens. <strong>Out of scope:</strong> Ares changes.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> agaia-4384</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 6</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4392	2026-11-16	2026-11-09	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	dee441406af0-cd0b-cccd-253efc87745a	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	341fc8956af0-cd3e-4f0e-a1663f3dffca	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-08 22:24:35	agaia	0	0
789104896af6-69ae-0716-056263483fed	Helm chart: TLS-capable ingress for devapi.projects4.me	2026-11-13 12:11:36	2026-11-13 12:37:42	0	<p>devapi.projects4.me is now served over HTTPS on the dev cluster (cert-manager, Let's Encrypt issuer <code>letsencrypt</code>), but the repo's helm chart has no TLS support, so it no longer matches what is deployed.</p><ul><li><code>helm/templates/ingress.yaml</code>: when <code>.Values.ingress.tls.enabled</code>, add the <code>cert-manager.io/cluster-issuer</code> annotation (from <code>.Values.ingress.tls.issuer</code>), <code>ingressClassName: traefik</code> and a <code>spec.tls</code> block for <code>.Values.ingress.host</code> with secret <code>{{ .Release.Name }}-tls</code>.</li><li><code>helm/values-dev.yml</code>: <code>ingress.tls: {enabled: true, issuer: letsencrypt}</code>. <code>helm/values-qa.yaml</code>: <code>tls.enabled: false</code> (QA has no TLS yet).</li></ul><p>Done when <code>helm template</code> with values-dev renders the annotation and tls block and values-qa renders the ingress unchanged.</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	8a024ab56ad5-2c2e-412a-dd21fa8ef390	7ea8b586623c-5e99-bfcb-d51d01a7a16b	4514	2026-11-20	2026-11-13	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	92ae09c66ace-1e5c-2b63-d1da9630092c	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Agent Odysseus	Rana Nouman	7944c5a66af7-a085-22b1-658d5d64535b	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-13 12:37:42	agaia	0	0
