aa930fc96af7-7919-f6fb-9576c2a67294	Modal migration: issue detail to AppUi::Modal	2026-11-13 13:33:30	2026-11-13 14:51:50	0	<p>Depends on #4516. Move these screens from <code>BootstrapModal</code> to <code>AppUi::Modal</code> and remove their <code>$('.modal').modal('hide')</code> calls: close by returning <code>true</code>/a Promise from <code>@confirm</code>, or by flipping the <code>{{#if}}</code> that renders the modal.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>app/components/issue/issue-details.hbs</code> (5 modals) and <code>issue-details.js</code> (6 jQuery hide calls)</li>\n<li><code>app/components/issue/issue-planning.hbs</code></li>\n<li><code>app/components/issue/file-preview.hbs</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Update the integration and acceptance tests of these screens only (e.g. <code>file-preview-test.js</code>, <code>issue-planning-steps.js</code>). Do not edit the shared <code>modal-steps.js</code>/<code>list-steps.js</code>. Apply the PowerSelect-in-modal and Messenger approach documented in #4516. Runs in parallel with the other migration issues: they share no files.</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4517	2026-11-20	2026-11-13	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	70a8ecd06af3-1487-2734-22a7ca0b5d62	\N	ae5c14575acb-1902-6b9c-78da78712ee9	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	6e53b2306af7-a555-43bc-314155dc3f09	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-13 14:51:50	aprom	0	0
fd5748b76ae5-92fb-9f4e-c78228215784	Agamemnon: premise config and the incident packet	2026-10-31 12:50:05	2026-10-31 13:45:12	0	<p>Agamemnon becomes an AI agent with deterministic tools, used only when a rule would otherwise hand an issue to the owner. This issue defines what it may handle and what it is given.</p><p><b>Premise</b> (config, e.g. talos/agents/agamemnon/premise.json): the incident types Agamemnon may handle, each with its allowed tool tiers. Anything not listed goes to the owner as today. Expanding the premise is a config change.</p><ul><li>test_contention: suite logs overwritten, runner hung, "tree changed" after a parallel run → wait for a free slot, retry.</li><li>ci_failed: re-run, then Odysseus.</li><li>merge_conflict: resolve (see the conflict issue) or Odysseus.</li><li>dirty_generated: known generated files modified in a workspace → back up and restore.</li><li>docker_down: detect, pause dispatch, notify the owner (starting Docker is not in the premise yet).</li><li>handback_failed: retry.</li></ul><p><b>Classifier:</b> deterministic mapping from handback reason, run summary and log tail to an incident type, or "other".</p><p><b>Incident packet</b> (JSON): issue, PR, handback reason and detail, run summary and log tail, <code>ai mergecheck</code> output, workspace git state, Docker state, the other in-flight issues with their changed files, and Agamemnon's earlier comments on this issue.</p><p>Depends on: adt-4225</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	1	4228	2026-11-07	2026-10-31	done	medium	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	c36638756ae5-92fb-c743-0dd51d887bec	\N	a13debc86ad7-404c-ce18-75327b747d1b	Agent Achilles	Hammad Hassan	c8f332906ae5-3157-5f17-8c5d1eb39f2b	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-10-31 13:45:13	adt	0	0
202b8d856af0-7d1c-cccd-18245ab29c97	Agents: delegationScopes and the delegation grant for runtimes	2026-11-08 20:40:00	2026-11-08 23:02:04	0	<p>Talos (a runtime service client) must run Gaia-declared agents without holding their secrets. It asks Gaia for a short-lived token acting as the agent.</p><ul><li><code>Agent.delegationScopes</code>: JSON list of permission names with <code>*</code> (same vocabulary as token scopes). Empty = the agent can't be delegated. Editable by those with agent.update; an agent can't change its own (extend <code>AgentEscalationGuard</code>).</li><li>New grant type (e.g. <code>urn:projects4me:params:oauth:grant-type:agent-delegation</code>, params <code>agent_id</code>, optional <code>scope</code>), registered in <code>core/libs/authorization/OAuthServer.php</code> like <code>AgentClientCredentials</code>. Client must be an active service client with scope <code>agent.delegate</code>; agent must be active with non-empty delegationScopes; requested scope must be a subset (default = all of them).</li><li>Token: user_id = agent email (as today), client_id = the runtime's client, scope = granted, 1 hour, no refresh token. Keep these token rows (no purge) so the token table shows which runtime acted for which agent when.</li><li>Decision entry in <code>docs/architecture/rbac/decisions.md</code>.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> phpunit for every refusal case and the happy path; a delegated token can't reach anything outside its scopes (relies on the token scopes issue). <strong>Out of scope:</strong> per-step scopes, runtime-to-agent binding.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> agaia-4384, agaia-4385</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 9</p><p>Complexity: complex</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4390	2026-11-16	2026-11-09	done	medium	cb4567905acd-06d6-1141-7dd99b59dd21	dee441406af0-cd0b-cccd-253efc87745a	\N	cbaa72735acd-06d6-1141-98f835ab32e9	Agent N