adb630886afa-b805-5654-a309c8662803	Use AppUi::Avatar in comments, the comment composer and the weekly conversations widget	2026-11-16 11:27:41	2026-11-16 11:49:34	0	<p>We are adopting the Component Library: every user picture uses <code>&lt;AppUi::Avatar @user={{...}} @size=... /&gt;</code> (<code>components/app-ui/avatar.{hbs,js}</code>, sizes xs 20, s 30, m 40, l 96px; image with an initials fallback, agent look built in).</p><ul><li><code>components/conversation-ui/comment-frame.hbs:3</code> <code>Agent::UserAvatar @class="img-circle img-sm"</code> (30px) -&gt; <code>@size="s"</code> with <code>(hash id=@userId name=@userName)</code>. This frame is shared by issue comments, thread comments and idea messages; check all three.</li><li><code>components/conversation-ui/comment-composer.hbs:12</code> current user image (30px) -&gt; <code>@size="s"</code>.</li><li><code>components/widgets/weekly-conversations.hbs:~60</code> <code>img.img-circle.img-sm</code> (30px) -&gt; <code>@size="s"</code> with <code>(hash id=comment.createdUser name=...)</code>.</li><li>AdminLTE floats <code>.box-comment img</code> and offsets the comment text by 40px; keep the avatar floated left with the text beside it (scope a rule in <code>styles/modules/conversation.scss</code> if needed). Its 30px <code>!important</code> rule matches s.</li><li>Update tests that select the old images (use <code>data-test-avatar</code>).</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> comments, the composer and the widget show 30px AppUi avatars with the same layout as before; agents show the agent look; a missing image shows initials.</p><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> removing <code>Agent::UserAvatar</code> (cleanup issue).</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 6</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4608	2026-11-23	2026-11-16	done	medium	add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729	69b873786af9-1368-4631-55b621317e7