a0dc42e46ae8-0360-4071-e99677c6748a	Agent Hera: write a retrospective issue when a milestone completes	2026-11-02 21:03:28	2026-11-03 05:42:36	0	<p>Hera is the first agent defined in Gaia and run by Talos. When a milestone completes, she reads all of its issues and creates a retrospective issue named <strong>Retrospective {{Milestone Name}}</strong> in the milestone's project. Her role prompt, model and limits live in her Gaia Agent record; Talos takes them from her agentspec.</p><ul><li><code>talos/agents/hera/agent.json</code>: kind <code>events</code>, <code>gaiaAgent</code> "Agent Hera", <code>gaiaEnv</code> <code>gaia-mcp/hera.env</code> (her client id and secret, adt-4041), the projects she covers, and allowedTools limited to the gaia MCP tools she needs: <code>gaia_get_milestone</code>, <code>gaia_list_issues</code>, <code>gaia_get_issue</code>, <code>gaia_create_issue</code>. No file editing and no git.</li><li>Trigger <code>milestone.completed</code> with a prompt naming the milestone and project.</li><li>The role prompt, shipped as <code>talos/agents/hera/role.md</code> for the engineer to paste into Hera's Gaia record. Hera:<ul><li>first checks that no issue "Retrospective &lt;name&gt;" exists in the project, so she never writes a second one;</li><li>reads every issue of the milestone (paging), including comments and time;</li><li>creates one Task in the milestone's project, assigned to her sponsor, with an HTML description covering: what shipped (issue refs grouped by type); estimate vs logged time; issues reopened, handed back, blocked or needing input, and why; review rounds; what went well; what went badly; proposed follow-ups.</li></ul></li><li>README: setting Hera up. Create the Agent in Gaia, issue a credential, grant <code>agentspec.get</code>, <code>milestone.get</code>, <code>issue.get</code>/<code>issue.create</code> and <code>comment.get</code>, add project memberships, write <code>hera.env</code>.</li><li>A test that hera/agent.json loads with the events kind.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> marking a test milestone completed produces exactly one "Retrospective &lt;name&gt;" issue covering all of the milestone's issues; completing it again (or a duplicate event) creates none.</p><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> catching up on milestones that completed while Talos was down, skills, other retrospective triggers.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> adt-4259, adt-4261, adt-4262, adt-4041</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 5</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	549d42946ad7-581a-8cbb-bbef380694da	4263	2026-11-10	2026-11-03	feedback	medium	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	7edc8c366ae8-0360-4071-f0d5103ebc86	\N	a0d690f56ad7-404c-ce18-27bd5d2a1517	Agent Nestor	Agent Achilles	6c4386936ae9-0e2a-9418-dd48489ec1b3	e148d40962c6-8e43-047e-c52d37422aed	2026-11-03 05:42:36	adt	0	0
