f31722066aeb-4599-8fd2-644915b450ea	Agamemnon: docker_pressure incident, wider docker_down, Docker state in the triage packet	2026-11-04 21:21:55	2026-11-04 23:13:01	0	<p>Runs that died from Docker running out of memory are classified as <code>other</code> and go to the owner, even though freeing memory, waiting and retrying would have resumed them. <code>docker_down</code> may only notify. This issue lets triage handle both.</p><ul><li><code>talos/lib/agamemnon/classifier.py</code>: a new <code>docker_pressure</code> rule (OOM kill, exit code 137, <code>Killed</code> from the test runner or ember build, Docker reporting the container OOMKilled, and similar), checked before <code>test_contention</code>. Widen <code>docker_down</code> (Docker Desktop starting or stopped, <code>error during connect</code> variants, pipe or socket not found on Windows and Linux).</li><li>Check the patterns against the real run logs of recent handbacks (Talos state and talos.db; the issues handed back over roughly the last 50). List in the PR which past handbacks are now classified differently.</li><li><code>premise.json</code>: <code>docker_down</code> gets read, engine, wait, retry, notify ("start the engine; restart only if it stays unresponsive and nothing else is running; then retry"). <code>docker_pressure</code> gets read, free, wait, retry, notify ("stop stale containers; if still short, hold-until-docker; then retry").</li><li><code>triage.py</code> <code>run</code>: fill the packet's <code>docker</code> with <code>docker_state.read()</code> plus its verdict instead of <code>None</code>.</li><li><code>role.md</code>: a Docker section: read <code>docker</code> first; when memory is short, free and hold, never restart; start before restart; never restart while other runs are in flight.</li></ul><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> classifier tests built from real log excerpts (secrets removed), a triage test showing the packet carries Docker state, and premise loading tests. Manual merge (<code>agamemnonProtected</code>).</p><p><strong>Out of scope:</strong> remote Docker hosts, installing Talos as a system service.</p><p><strong>Depends on:</strong> adt-4278</p><p><strong>Estimated files:</strong> 8</p><p>Complexity: simple</p>	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	b7844c206ad7-8b87-6fc0-22987a8fb708	1	4279	2026-11-12	2026-11-05	done	medium	9f00a9366ad7-404c-ce18-9081c0a9fec6	7edc8c366ae8-0360-4071-f0d5103ebc86	\N	a13debc86ad7-404c-ce18-75327b747d1b	Agent Nestor	Hammad Hassan	ee6d49b06aeb-3897-5028-aa0f7ad53629	402f48b562c6-8e43-a8e0-0abdb1b2f5be	2026-11-04 23:13:01	adt	0	0
