a607e2215835-b8f6-bf45-62703a8a48f8	Entities	2016-11-23 09:57:58	2016-11-23 09:57:58	1	Hammad Hassan	1	Hammad Hassan	0	published	0	1	1	<h1><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Entities</span></h1><p>This is the list of all the entities in the system that we are going to use.</p><p><br></p><h2><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Projects</span></h2><p>\tProjects obviously are the most basic unit in this project, everything in the system even the ACL and Navigation menu is tied to projects.</p><p><br></p><h2><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Banner</span></h2><p>\tA banner is a banner, it cannot be anything else and it should not be anything more or else.</p><p><br></p><h2><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">System</span></h2><p>\tA system is composition of units which are designed to represent a system. So if a system = a and unit = b and units = c then as per the Pythagoras theorem if a = b and b = c then a = c. This basically means that a system is after all a system </p><p><br></p><h2><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Test</span></h2><p>\tA test is what is used in order to verify the working of a system as per the intention it was designed for.</p><p><br></p><h2><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Alpha Maniac</span></h2><p>\tA you make a really awesome and super cool system but it is one that is absolutely nuts is called alpha maniac.</p>	
