es, for example 35 of 39 minutes on #4367.<\\/li><\\/ol><p><strong>Proposed actions:<\\/strong> serialise or split the shared translations file; print the first build-error lines in <code>ai test<\\/code>; require flagged follow-ups to be created or waived at ship time; clear Messenger toasts between acceptance scenarios; record time estimates on issues.<\\/p><p><strong>Data gaps:<\\/strong> no done-dates or status history, so lateness and time in feedback can't be measured. I did not read PR review history with <code>gh<\\/code>, so review rounds come from issue comments only.<\\/p>"}	\N	2026-11-08 17:27:15	2026-11-09 11:35:00	65265000	2026-11-08 17:27:15	2026-11-09 11:35:00	f
